\id PSA  
\h La Bu 
\toc1 La Bu 
\toc2 La Bu 
\toc3 Labu 
\mt1 PSALMS  
\mt2 LABU  
\mt3 Labu Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip Hiche lekhabu hin na lungthim sunga giltah'a thu asei ding ahi. Ajeh chu kipana, lunghemna, chamna, lunggimna chule kinepna hihen kinepnabei hijongleh hiche Labu'a kon hi, kitilkhouna le lung kipana thei namudoh tei ding ahi. Khang masa laija Labu'a thucheng kijih hohi, tukhang kipana le dinmun ho toh jong akitoh in ahi. Labu'a um thucheng phabep hi, taona thutoh akilhon in, vahchoi tothoa kipana'a dim, chule kisihna neija chonset phondohna le khat le khat Elohim Pathen henga kitaopeh tona thudol ho aseijin ahi.  
\ip Phat phatah napeh'a nasim'a ahileh hiche lekhabu hin bukimsel'a aman aleding ahi. Labu hi avel vel-a nasim'a ahileh athah beh-a houlim pina nachan ding, hichu tule phatsot tah'a ding ahi. Lunglut tah in sim in, ajeh chu Hebrew La toh kisai hohi, La dang hotoh akikhehna um ahi.  
\ip Chule hetdinga pha chu, Labu hi la-lam toh kisai ahin, houlam tahsan-dan toh kisai lou ahi. Labu jih ho hin, alhangpia amaho lungthim sunga kon ho hilchetna apeh-u ahin, Tahsan thudol-a Elohim Pathen thu adihtah ahilchet-u ahipoi. Labu sung thu umdan ho phatah in vele chun—Elohim Pathen le mihemte kiguijopna thudol jeng ahi. Hijeh chun La toh kisaija thucheng kijih hohin, lunglut tah le na hinkho sunga taona tothoa sim jing ding in nakouve.  
\is1 Lekhabu Jih Ho Chule Akijina Lo  
\ip Israel Leng David chun Labu som sagi le thum ajih in ahi. Chule Labu som nga hi koipen in anajih ham, ti hetdoh ahahsan; ahinlah Labu adangse hi Asaph, Korah chihlhah te, Solomon, Mose le Ethan kiti Ezrahite amaho cheng hin anajih-u ahi.  
\ip Chule phabep chun, Elohim Pathen henga taona le Ama vahchoina thudol-a Labu hi anajih-u ahi. Hinlah adang phabepma chun, kipun khom'a Elohim Pathen hou toh kisaijin anajih un, ama ama cheh thiljih-a kon hin, lhagao lam kitilkhouna ahiti, aki muchen in chule Labu hohi aboncha Thangvahna, Taona chule Elohim Pathen kilam hilsahna jeng ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 BU KHATNA  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Adia Mipha Leh Migilou  
\p
\v 1 Migiloute thuhil jom louva, michonse ho lamlhah dunga jong dingle lou; chule Elohim Pathen ginglou ho kikhop na dunga jong tou khompi lou mi chu anun nom ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Hitobang mihochun Yahweh Pakai Dan thu a bou lunglhai na aneiyun, Yahweh Pakai Dan thu chu sun le jan in angaito jing jeng ui.   
\p
\v 3 Hitobang mi hochu twi lonna luipanga kiphut, aphat cha hung gaji adojong gopjilou thingphung tobang ahi; hitobang miho jong chu atohna lam lam'uva alolhing jiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai ginglouho vang chutobang ahipoi: huilhoh mangle changvai tobangbep ahiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Hijeh a chu Yahweh Pakai gingloute chu thutan nikho tengleh themmo changdiu, michonse hon jong mikitah ho lah'a mun aneiloudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in michonpha ho lamlhah ahetpeh jing in, Yahweh Pakai ginglou ho lampi vang manthahna'a lut diu ahi.   
\c 2  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Thaonupan Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Ipi dinga chitin namtin kitohmoa, thilphachomlou ngaito na a aphat'u amoh man chatvei u hitam?   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in lengdinga athaonupa dounan leiset lengte akikhom un, chule vaihom thunei hon jong thulhuh asem un, hitin asei ui.   
\p
\v 3 “Ei-kihennauva kon ahin kilhamlhao hitin, Elohim Pathen thaneina'a kon'in kilha ong-u hite” atiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Hinlah Yahweh Pakai in avan laltouna'a kon'in amaho chu ahin nuisat in, Yahweh Pakai a din nuijat umtah ahitauve.   
\p
\v 5 Chuin Yahweh Pakai in amaho chu lunghang tah'in aphoh in, alunghan jah jeng chun amaho atijatsah tai.   
\p
\v 6 Chutah in “Keiman kalhendoh lengchu kalhang theng Zion molvum a katousah'e,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Keiman thugahna chu phongdoh inge; Yahweh Pakai in kahengah hitin asei e, “Nangma hi kachapa nahi, Keiman tunia nangma hi kahin nahi tai.”   
\p
\v 8 Kahenga nathum pouleh chitin namtin hi nagoulo dinga kapeh ding, vannoi leiset pumpi geija nagou kahisahding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Nangman amahohi thihjolla najep boh'a; belkhengpa bel kivoh chip banga ahal hal a nakoi ding ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hijeh chun Vo leiset lengte kichih theiyun; Chule leiset thutan ho nanghon thuhil ngaiphaovin.   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai chu ging tah in akin bol un, chule kithing pum in Ama chu houvun.   
\p
\v 12 Yahweh Pakai lungsatna nachung uva achuh a namanthah masangun akengphang kolchah in chop un, ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai lungsat na neocha jong eihodia deojah ahi. Atahsan nau Yahweh Pakai a koi jing ho chu anun nom ahiuve.   
\c 3  
\s1 Elohim Pathen'a Kingaina Le Bitna  
\s1 David lengpa'n achapa Absolom'a kona ajam manga alasem  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, idia eisulam vaiding mi pung jing hitam! eidou din mitamtah akipandoh taove.   
\p
\v 2 Ama kihuh doh na hi Elohim Pathen a aumpoi tin kalungthim in mitamtah'in aseijui. Selah.   
\p
\v 3 Ahinlah Yahweh Pakai, nanghi eiveng tup, kalum'a kisoung nahi; Ka loupina le khodah ngam-a, gal jona eipeh jing nahi.   
\p
\v 4 Keima O sangtah in Yahweh Pakai henga kataovin, Aman alhang thenga kon'in eihin donbut tai. Selah.   
\p
\v 5 Keima kalum'in ka-imu jin; Yahweh Pakai in eichin tup'a eihoidam jeh'in, kajing-thou kit tai.   
\p
\v 6 Keima doudin mihem sangsom sangjan ei umkimvel jongle kichakit taponge.   
\p
\v 7 Hung thoudoh in O Yahweh Pakai; neihuhdoh'in, Elohim ka Pathen: Eidou hojouse khagu eivohchipeh in; nangma migilou ho hahemtah jong vopul soh ji nahi.   
\p
\v 8 Huh hingna hi Yahweh Pakai a kon bou ahi: Na phattheina jong namite chunga aume.   
\c 4  
\s1 Elohim Pathen In Asanpehna Dinga David Taona  
\s1 Lalamkai pan semjangle selangdah ho to atho dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Kakou teng neidon but'in, them eichan sah a O Yahweh Pakai; ka lhahsam nikho teng jong le nangman lunglet neipe ji; neikhoton lang kataona neingai peh tei in.   
\p
\v 2 Vo mihem chapate, nanghohin itihchanpi neisuh jum diu hitam? Itihchan ajehbei a nei thepmosah uva, itihchan pihi jouthu nachepi diu hitam?   
\p
\v 3 Ahin nanghon heuvin, Yahweh Pakai in ama gingho Ama ding'in atum'in alhengdoh'e. Yahweh Pakai kakou tengleh Aman ei-donbut teijin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Ki sonlelnan kithing pumin umun, ahin chonset boldaovin; hichu nalupnao muna jong nalungthimu toh gelkhom jinguvin lang umdet jingun.   
\p
\v 5 Lungthengsel a kilhai naho boljingun chule natahsan nao Yahweh Pakai a koi jingun.   
\p
\v 6 Hiho sanga phajo eimusah thei diu koi ham? tin mitamtah'in seiunte, Yahweh Pakai namaivah achun keiho neihinsu emsel un.   
\p
\v 7 Nangman lengpitwi leh changle mim nengchat'a kilamdoh ho kipani sangin, kalungthim nakipasah tai.   
\p
\v 8 Keima Nanga dia lungmonga kalup a ka-ihmut ding ahi, Yahweh Pakai nei hoidoh inlang neivengtup in.   
\c 5  
\s1 Elohim Pathen In Avenbitna Dinga David Taona  
\s1 La lamkai pan pengkol to tho a sah ding David lasem  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, ka ocheng ho neingaipeh'in, Kalungthim a kataona jong neigelkhoh peh'in.   
\p
\v 2 Panpi ngaija kakana neigelkhohpeh'in, ka lengpa le Elohim ka Pathen; ajeh chu nangma kom'a bou taovakahi.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai, jingkah teng kataona nei ngaipeh'in, jingkah seh leh nangma lam sang ingting kangai chat jouse nakom kahinlhut a kinemtah a ngah jingding kahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nangma thil phalouho chunga kipah ji pathen nahipon, migilou ho jong na angsuna aumthei ji pouve.   
\p
\v 5 Nangma angsunga mikiletsah ho a dingjou jipon; Yahweh Pakai nang man gitlou nale chonset bol jouse nathet soh hel e.   
\p
\v 6 Nangin jouthu sei ho nasuh mang ding ahi; Yahweh Pakai in mijoulhep holeh tolthat ho athet ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Keima din vang, Nangailut na bulhingsetjal chun na hongsung hunglut nange; Chule nangma ginle jana a nahouin theng mai a bohkhup a chibai kabohding nahi.   
\p
\v 8 O Yahweh Pakai, kamelma ten eijo lounadin nalamdih a neipui in. Kamasanga um lampi hi kajuidih nadin neihin lhun jang peh in.   
\p
\v 9 Ajeh chu kamelmate kamsunga thutah apotthei tapon, asunglam'u jong setnajeng ahitai; Alol sung ujong lhankhuh abangin, alei ujong chuchi a kilhunglut kalbi abang e.   
\p
\v 10 O Yahweh Pakai ama ho khu gotna petan. Aduhabol nauhi amaho lhuh na hihen! Achonsetnao ho jeh'in delmang jeng'in, ajeh chu amahohin nangma dounan na atong'un ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ahin koihileh nangma lhalim noi'a umho chu thanom'u hen! Nangma thangvahna lachu kipah tah'in sajingu hen! Amaho chunga nalhajah in hoidoh jing in lang, Nangma min ngailu jing ho jong kipa na lodim jing'u hen.   
\p
\v 12 O Yahweh Pakai, nang'in michonpha ho phatthei naboh tei in. Nalungtoh te ngailut na ompho phatah achun nahoibit jing e.   
\c 6  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Hepina Ngaiya David Taona  
\s1 David in Sheminith lakai a semjang jangget toh thodia lalamkaipa sah dia asem  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, nei lung han san loujen in! Lungsat namoljol a chun neikhoukhah hih helin.   
\p
\v 2 Neikhoto teijin lhasam le hatlou kahi Yahweh Pakai, neidam sah in kagu kachang jousen eichip ui.   
\p
\v 3 Kalhagao alengvai lheh jeng tai, O Yahweh Pakai itihchan pi hitia hi kaum ding hitam?   
\p
\v 4 Hungkilen O Yahweh Pakai, kalhagao huh doh in. Namingailutna longlou jeh chun neihin huhdoh tei in.   
\p
\v 5 Ajeh chu thina ahin nangma geldoh na aumpoi: lhankhuh a kona jong koiham nahin thangvah ding?   
\p
\v 6 Ka ka kamao nan kachao lhatai; janseh a kakanan kajalkhun achin in, kaka na mitlhi hon kalupna jalkhun akotsah sohtai.   
\p
\v 7 Genthei a kaka nan kamit athimtan; kagalmiten eisuh genthei jeh'uvin apomhel jengtai.   
\p
\v 8 Gitlouna bolho jouse kakoma kon'in potdoh tauvin; Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in kakana eijahpeh tai.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai in kangaichat a kathum na ho eihetpeh tan; kataona hi eidonbut ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 10 Kagalmite jouse kijumsou henlang kithing pumin um uhen: Jum le ja pumin gangtah in kinungle taohen.   
\c 7  
\s1 Thudih Kiphonna Dinga David Taona  
\s1 Cush kiti Benjamin mipa chungchang a David in tumging jatchom chom ho to thoa Yahweh Pakai anga anasahdoh la  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen eihoidam din nangma kahin belle. Eipedoh a pang hoa kon'in neihoidohsah'in, neihuhdoh'in.   
\p
\v 2 Achuti loule panpi ding bei a kaum a, keipi bahkai-jin mi abolset banga eiboset uva, ahal halla eibotel diu ahi.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai, ka-Pathen keiman thil suhkhel kaneija, thildihlou kana tohdoh khah'a,   
\p
\v 4 Lungmonga kachenkhom pi khat chonphatlouna kalethuh a, ajehbeija kagalmi kanchom khah'a ahileh,   
\p
\v 5 Kagal mite khut-ah neipedoh jeng in lang kahin na lajengu hen, amahon tolla eichotpha jeng uhen chule kaloupi najouse bon lah'a kaithang jeng-u hen. Selah   
\p
\v 6 O Yahweh Pakai, lunghan in hungthoudoh'in, Doumit melpu kagalmite jeh in nang hung kichoisang in; Chule hung kipatdoh'in Elohim ka Pathen nathutan dihtah chu hinpolut in.   
\p
\v 7 Namasangah chitin namtin kikhom soh hen: Ama ho chunga namun dih tah chu hin kimusah kit in.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai chu chitin namtin ho thu atan ahi: Kachondih naho nei phondoh peh tan, O Yahweh Pakai, ajeh chu keiman them mo na kanei poi O hatchung nung.   
\p
\v 9 Mi phalouho thil dihlou bolna kichai sah tan, chule michonpha ho chu domsangin. Ajeh chu nangman mihem lungthim gilsung ve Pathen dihtah chu nahi.   
\p
\v 10 Elohim ka Pathen hi kalum'a pang ahin, alungthim dih le akitah ho chu ahuhhing jin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Elohim ka Pathen hi thutan dihtah ahin, niseh'in miphalou chunga alung hangjingin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Mihemkhat chu akisih louva ahileh, Elohim ka Pathen in achemjam kinol hem intin, athalpi kaosa akoijing ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Aman thina manchah gimneitah chu kigot intin athalpi meikou chu akapding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Miphalou hon setna avop un, umhelna le thilphalou va agaiun, jouthu ho ahinpen doh sah jiu ve.   
\p
\v 15 Amahon mi lhahlutna dingin kotong thuhtah alaijiuvin, ahinlah amaho joh alhalut jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Midia set na abol hou chu amaho angsung joh in achuhjin ahi. Michunga chudinga thilse agon houchu amaho luchunga joh achujin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Keiman Yahweh Pakai chu akitahna jeh'in thangvah ing-ting, keiman Yahweh Pakai hat chung nung min chu ka thangvah ding ahi.   
\c 8  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Loupina Mihem In Ajabolna  
\s1 David in Gittith lakai a sah dia lallamkai pa apeh lacheng  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, ka-Pakai u, leiset chunga hi itilom loma naming loupi hitam! naloupi nahi vanho sangin asangjon ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nangin chapang hole naosen ho kamsunga nathahat naho nahil in, hiti chun nagalmi hole nangma douho nasuthipjin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Keiman janteng vanthamjol kavet akangaito jiteng, nakhut jung ho natoh in lhathah le ahsi ho agongtoh sel ui.   
\p
\v 4 Mihem hi ipi hija hibanga nagelkhoh'a, Mihem Chapa hi ipi dinga hibanga hi nakhohsah ham?   
\p
\v 5 Nang'in amaho hi Vantil sanga themchabou nemjep in nakoi jin, loupina le jana dimset in lallukhuh nakhuhpeh e.   
\p
\v 6 Nangin nathilsemsaho jouse chunga vaihop na napen, thiljouse akhutnoija nakoitan ahi:   
\p
\v 7 Kelngoiho le bong ho chule gamsahang ho jouse,   
\p
\v 8 Vantham jol'a vachate, twikhang len'a nga-ho chule twikhang len'a kijap jouse ahiuve.   
\p
\v 9 O Yahweh Pakai, ka-Pakai u, leiset chunga hi itilom loma naming loupi hitam!   
\c 9  
\s1 Elohim Pathen in thu adih'a atanjeh'a David in athangvah  
\s1 Lalamkai pan Alumoth-labben lakaiya sah dia David lasem  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai kalungthim pumpin nangma thangvah ing-kate. Thil loupi nabol ho hi seiphongle-inge.   
\p
\v 2 Nangma jal a kipana a kadimset ding ahi. Namin in vahchoi la sang e, O Yahweh Pakai Hatchungnung.   
\p
\v 3 Nang nahung dindoh teng kagal mite anungjam jiuvin, akiseplhu vin na angsunga athiden jitaove.   
\p
\v 4 Ajeh chu nangin kadih nalam a thu neitan pehin, navan laltouna'a kon'in thu adih'in nahin tan e.   
\p
\v 5 Nangman namtin vaipi nalethuh in migiloute nasu-mang'in, amin'u tonsot'a din nathai mangtai.   
\p
\v 6 Melmate chu nangin a-itih'a dingin nasumang in, khopi nasuh mang ho jong tun suhmil'in aumgam-tauve.   
\p
\v 7 Ahinlah Yahweh Pakai hi tonsot leng ahin, thutanna dingin alaltouna atungdoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Aman leiset hi thudih'a achungthu atan a, namtin vaipi chunga hi dihtah'a vai ahop ding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakaihi bolgentheija umho dinga hoidohna ahin, hahsatna nikho hoa dinga kicholdona kulpi ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Namin heho jousen nahin tahsan ui, ajeh chu, O Yahweh Pakai nangin nangma holte chu nadalha ngaipoi.   
\p
\v 11 Jerusalem'a vaihom Yahweh Pakai vahchoinan lasauvin. Suhmil theilou atohdoh ho namtin jah a seiphongun.   
\p
\v 12 Ajeh chu aman tolthat ho aphu alahjin, panpi beiho apanpin ji. Aman migentheiho kana jong nahsah mon akoijipoi.   
\p
\v 13 Neikho to teijin O Yahweh Pakai; eibose teuvin ichan a eisuh genthei u hitam, thina kokhuh a kon'in neiloidoh'in.   
\p
\v 14 Zion chanu kelkot phunghoa lhangphong tah'a kathangvah theina dingin neihuhdoh'in, chutengleh neihuh doh jal a kakipa thanom ding ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Midangho lhahlut nadia asem u kokhuh a chun Namtin vaipi alhalut un, athang kam uva chun amaho keng joh a ohtai.   
\p
\v 16 Yahweh Pakai hi athutan dihna'a kon'in akilangdoh jin: Migilouho vang amaho thang-kamna'a a-ohden jiuvin ahi. Selah   
\p
\v 17 Migilouho vang lhankhuh a lhalut untin, hichu Elohim Pathen nahsah lou namtin vaipiho chunga got na jong ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Ahinlah panpi ngaichaho chu nahsahmoa umjom jing loudiu: chule migenthei te kinepna jong tonsot a suhmil-a um louding ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hungthou vin, O Yahweh Pakai! Mihemho kinoise sah-hih beh'in! Nangma ginglou namtin vaipi ho chungthu hi tanin!   
\p
\v 20 amahohi tijatnan lungkhamsah'in, O Yahweh Pakai. Namtin vaipi hi mihem maimai ahiu kihetdoh sah'in.   
\c 10  
\s1 Migilou Lekhupna Dinga Elohim Pathen Henga David Atao  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, idia gam lhatah'a ding nahim? Genthei kathoh jiteng ibol'a kisel jia nahim?   
\p
\v 2 Migilouten noise tah'in migentheite adel mangjiu vin, mi-o nadinga asem'u thang a chun amahojoh hin-o sah'in.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu amhon thilselam a alung ngaichat hou akiletsah piuvin, mikilose ho apah chauvin, Yahweh Pakai chu ataitom-un ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Migilou te vang Elohim Pathen holdin akiletsah val un, alungthim pumpiu vin jong Elohim Pathen aum poi atiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Ahinlah amaho hi abol-lam lam uvah alolhing'un ahi. Achung uva hunglhung ding eng-bolna ho jonghi amupha jipouve. Amahon agal-mihou jouse chu ataitom-un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Amahon, kachung'uva thilse kiti chulouding ahi tin atahsan un; boina hoa kona aitih a ongthol ding kahitaove atiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Akam-uvah sapsetna, joule nal, chule gihsalna adimset ui. Alei muh uva jong thilse le thilphalou jeng aum e.   
\p
\v 8 Amahon khopam lam gamthip lah hoa mi achanglhi jiuvin, them-mona neilouho thading agojiuve. Amit un alhasam te umna aching lhi jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Keipi bahkaiho bang'in akisel'un lhasam le hatloute mat jeng dingin angahun ahi. Sachangho bang'in tah-lelte chu len akhu khum un amandoh jitaove.   
\p
\v 10 Lhasam a bolsetna toh te chu asugep jiuvin; miphalouho thahatna noi a chun alhalut jitaove.   
\p
\v 11 Migilou ten Elohim Pathen in eimupha pouve atiuve! Aman amit sing intin, “Eihon ibol uhi mu hih beh inte” atiuve!   
\p
\v 12 Hung kipat tan O Yahweh Pakai, migiloute hi gotna petan, O Elohim Pathen! Hatlou lhasam te hin sumil hih beh in.   
\p
\v 13 Migiloute Elohim Pathen sam se pum puma iti ongthol diu ham? Amahon Elohim Pathen in eithemmosah pouvinte tin angai touve.   
\p
\v 14 Ahinlah Yahweh Pakai nangin athilse bol-houhi namusoh keije. Nangin hicheho hi melchih inlang amahohi gotna pen. Hatlou lhasam ten atahsan nao nanga akoi un, nulou palou te jong nangin vengbit in.   
\p
\v 15 Hiche migilou mi-engseho hi abanjang-u heh bongin! abon-uva nasuhmang kahsen anung u deljingin.   
\p
\v 16 Yahweh Pakaihi atonsot tonsot leng ahi! Elohim Pathen neilou nam mitechu gamsung akon a mangthah ding ahiuve.   
\p
\v 17 Yahweh Pakai nangin tah-lelte kinepna hi nahetsa ahi, nangin thon louva akana-u najahpeh'a nahin lhamon ding ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Nangin nulou palou te leh bolgentheija umho chungthu adih'a natanpeh ding, chuteng athi thei mihem in amaho hi asuh lengvai theilou diu ahitai.   
\c 11  
\s1 Mikitah Kiselna Mun  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Keiman eiveng tup din Yahweh Pakai katahsan e. Hijeh achu, nangin ipi dia, “vacha bang'in nahoibitna dingin hiche molchunga khun galeng tan” natiham!   
\p
\v 2 Migilouhon athalchangu akhaoto suhtoh san akoi un aloisal tauvin ahi. Amahon munthip a kon-in milungdih ho ahinkap'un ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Dan leh thupehho akisuhset teng, michonphapa chun ipi abolthei nahlai dingham?   
\p
\v 4 Ahinlah Yahweh Pakai chu a-houin munthenga chun aum e; Yahweh Pakai chun vanna kon'in vai ahinhom nalaije. Aman mijouse ahin vechilsoh keijin, leiset chunga mitin ahinkholtoh e.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai in michonpha le migilou anigelin ahinkhol toh e. Aman thunoh baotam bol ho athen ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Aman migiloute chunga mei-am lenglung leh katsong meikong gojuh'a ajuhsah ding hui savetvut pumma gotna apeh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai dihnahin thu adih'a kitan achepin, hijeh'a chu thudih chepi hochun Yahweh Pakai mai amudiu ahi.   
\c 12  
\s1 Migilou Ho Kidou Teng Panpi Ngehna David Atao  
\s1 Sheminith lakai a Lalamkai pa sah dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Huhhing in, O Yahweh Pakai, michonpha mangthah ding ahitai! Leiset mihem te lah a mikitah jong abeitai!   
\p
\v 2 Heng le kom jengjong jouthu jengin akilhemtouvin, muhnal a lungthima kilhep lhahding jeng thu asei ui.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai in dangnal tah a thukisei ho hi asuh bei ding, kiletsahna thuchengho jonghi asuthip ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 4 Amahon aseijun, eihon lungna chim set'in jouthu seiju hite, ajeh chu i-lei ikam'u eihoa hilouham, kon eisuh tang jou diuham? atiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai in adonbut in, “Keiman hatlou lhasamte chunga bolgenthei naho kamudohtai chule migenthei ho ka lemao jong kajatai. Tun keima kipan inting huhdoh dia eingaichat bangu va kahuh doh diu ahitai.”   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai kitepna hi thengsel'a ahin, dangka mei chunga sagivei kilhit theng tobang ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hijeh chun, Yahweh Pakai nangin bol-hesoh'a umho nahuhdoh ding ahi, ti kaheuve, chule hiche kitahlou khang mitea kon'a tonsot geija dinga nahoidoh ding ahi,   
\p
\v 8 migilou te muntina vahle henlang migilou pen ho jong gamsung a kidomsang u jong le.   
\c 13  
\s1 Gim Le Hesoh Pet'a Panpi Ngaiya David Taona  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, phat itihchan geihi neisuhmil ding hitam? Itih chan keija kon'a nakiselmang ding nahim?   
\p
\v 2 Itihchan gei hiche hahsatna hi kathoh ding ham? Itih chan asun ajan'a lungkhamna dimset'a kaum ding ham? Itih chan kagalmiten hanla eisap khum diu hitam?   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen hung kiheiyin, neihin donbut tan! Katha kile dohsah'in, neithisah hih'in.   
\p
\v 4 “Ama hi kajou tai!” tin kamelma te hi ka lhuh nin kipasah hih beh in.   
\p
\v 5 Amavang namingailutna longlouvachu kingai jing kahi. Neihuhdoh jeh a keima kipa jing ding kahi.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman Yahweh Pakai vahchoi lan sang e ajeh chu Ama keidin thilpha tah eibol peh ati.   
\c 14  
\s1 Mihem Ngolna David In Ahilchet  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Mingol'in bou alungthim in “Pathen aumpoi” ati. Amaho hi lepche ngen ahiuvin, chule athilbol ujong adihlou jeng ahin, khatcha jong thilphabol aumpouve.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in vanna kon'in lei mihemte jouse ahinven, mikhattou aching tahbeh um-em, chule Elohim Pathen ngaicha'a hol-a um-em atin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hinlah aumpoi, abon'un aki-heimang gamtauve, abonchauva lepche ngen ahiuvin, koimacha apha aumpoi khatcha jong aumpoi.   
\p
\v 4 Setna bolten hetna anei lou u hintem? Amahohin kamite changlhah bang'in aneuvin, Yahweh Pakai komin la taoding agelpouve.   
\p
\v 5 Amahohi tijatnan alodim diuahi, ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in athua nung ho aumpin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Migilou ten bolgentheija umho tohgon asuhsetpeh jiuvin, ahin Yahweh Pakai in amite ahuhdoh jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Zion molsang a kon a Israel huhdoh dinga koi hungding ham? Yahweh Pakai in amite aki-ledohsah kit teng, Jacob in kipana asap phon a, Israel in Elohim Pathen athangvah ding ahi.   
\c 15  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai na intheng sunga, kon nangma nahou ding hitam? Koiham nalhang thenga na angsunga hunglut ding?   
\p
\v 2 Hitobang mi themmona bei, thil dihjeng bol, lungthim theng pumma thudih jeng seiho.   
\p
\v 3 Akam a miseiset ding nomlou chule aheng akom chunga thilse bollou, ahiloule aloi agol chunga thilse seinomlou.   
\p
\v 4 Chonset kithang-atpiho theinomlou va, Yahweh Pakai dihtah a juiho ngaisanga, chuleh itobangin hahsa jongleh akitepna nitjingho.   
\p
\v 5 Athoi lalouva sumpa homho chuleh setna neilouho, ahethemlou ho lhemlha a phatchomna sum hol lou. Hitobang miho chu ahinkhouva dingdet jingding ahiuve.   
\c 16  
\s1 Hoidohna Dinga Elohim Pathen Henga David Ajam  
\s1 David Michtam (Lakai jatkhat)  
\p
\v 1 Neihoibitnin O Elohim Pathen: ajeh chu nangahi kinem jing kahi.   
\p
\v 2 O Kalhagao, nangman Yahweh Pakai koma Nanghi ka Pakai nahi nati, thilpha kaneijouse hi nanga kon bou ahi;   
\p
\v 3 Leiset a Elohim Pathen lhentumte hi pachat umtah ahiuvin, amahohi keidinga kagal lamkai le kakipa thanop napen ahiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Pathen dangho nung jui a delle ho chu alung khamnao kibejing ding ahi. Amaho thisan a kilhaina ganthat a pang ka hilou ding, a pathen nu jong kahoupeh loudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai hi ka chanding gou le ka phatthei channa khon chu ahi. Yahweh Pakai in ka ijakai eichintup peh e.   
\p
\v 6 Nangin neipeh gam jonghi gamphapen ahi, itobanga goupha kidang neipeh hitam!   
\p
\v 7 Ijakai eihilla ka Yahweh Pakai chu keiman thangvah inge; janteng jong le avel in eigeldoh sah jin eihil jie.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in eiumpi danhi keiman hetna kanei jinge. Amahi kakomma naichakhatna um ahi ti kahen hijeh chun keima lungthomhao ponge.   
\p
\v 9 Hijeh hin keima kalung amongsellin chuleh kipanan kadimmin Elohim Pathen kathangvah e.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu nangin thina mun a neidalha pon natin namitheng te jong lhankhuh a lhahlutsah pon nate.   
\p
\v 11 Nangin hinnalampi chu neimusah'in natin, neiumpi jal a kipana le nei umpina tonsot nopna chu nei pen nate.   
\c 17  
\s1 Mi-Sugentheitea Kon Gimna Aum Teng Hoidohna Dia David Taona  
\s1 David Taona  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai adih thumna a kaka ogin hi nei jahpeh in, katao nahi nei ngaipeh in, lungthengsel le dih tah katao ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Kathem chan na neiphondoh peh'in, ajeh chu nangin thudih a natong namuchet ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Nangin kalunggel ho napatep jin, janteng jongle kalungsung navelhaji. Nangin kapum changin neivechillin kathepmo na namupoi; kakamsung jenga jong set na potlou ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 4 Keiman nathupeh Dan dungjuiin, migilou ho le mi-engseho ho khonung kajui ji poi.   
\p
\v 5 Kakalson dan hin nalampi kajui jingin nangma lampia konnin kapotdoh pon ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Keima nangma komma taova kahi ajeh chu O Elohim Pathen nangin neisanpeh teiding kahei. Kataona hi lunglut tah'in neingaipeh in.   
\p
\v 7 Nami ngailutna longlou chu kidangtah in neimusah'in, agalmitea konna hoidohna ngaichaho chu nathahatna gimneitah chun nahuh doh ji e.   
\p
\v 8 Nangman namit teni na chintup jing bangin keima jong nei vesuijin. Nalhaving limnoija chun neisellin.   
\p
\v 9 Kavel a eidoujing migilouho a kon in eivengtup in, eithatgo kamelma hoa konnin nei huhdoh in.   
\p
\v 10 Amahohi mi khotona bei ahiuvin akiletsah nao thucheng chu ngaitan!   
\p
\v 11 Amahon eihin juilutnun eiumkimvel uvin tola selhuh dingin agomkom ahol un ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Anehding changlhih le keipi bahkai hangtah bang le keipinou vin gamthip lai matding avetlhih le tobang ahiuve.   
\p
\v 13 Hung kipat tan O Yahweh Pakai kidintepin lang seplhu jengin! Nachemjammin migilouhoa konnin neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 14 O Yahweh Pakai naban thathatnin vannoia ama phatchomna ngaito hohi sumangin. Amavang nangma goulu hohi nangman vah va jing in. Achateu neijong suhnengpeh inlang ason apahteu goulo ding geija adalhah peh theina diuvin gontoh peh'in.   
\p
\v 15 Monabeija hinkho Kaman jeh a namel kamu teiding ahi. Kathodoh tengleh nangma toh kimaitoa ikimuto ding chule kalungnachim tante.   
\c 18  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Phattheina Jal'a David Thangvahna  
\s1 Elohim Pathen lhacha David la. Yahweh Pakai in agalmi jouse le Saul a kona ahuh doh nikhoa asah;  
\p
\v 1 Keiman nangma kangailui Yahweh Pakai; Nangma hi kathahatna nahi.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai hi kasongpi, kakulpi, chuleh eihuhhingpu ahin, Elohim ka Pathen hi kasongpi ahin eiveng tup jing ahi. Amahi kalumdal, eihuhhinga thahat chu ahin, chuleh kahoidohna munpi chu ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Keiman thangvah dinga lomtah Yahweh Pakai chu kakouvin, aman kamelmatea konnin eihuhdoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Thina khoisatna chun eiumkimvel tan, manthahna twipi chun eichup tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Damun lungkhamna chun eiumkimvelin, kalampi a thinan thang akam e.   
\p
\v 6 Ka lungkham val phatnin Yahweh Pakai chu kakouvin, Elohim ka Pathen komma chun panpi ngaichan kataovin Aman ahouin thenga konnin kataona asangin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hi jouchun leiset akilingin akihot e. Molbul ho jeng jong kihot e ajeh chu Elohim Pathen lunghang a ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai nah hom a meikhu ahung potdoh in, meikou gimneitah akam a konnin ahungkou doh'in chuleh Mei-am al lenglung Ama-a konnin ahung koudoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Aman vanho chu ahongdoh'in meilom thimletlut chu ahin chotphan ahung kumsuh in,   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai chu vantil pipui khat chunga atouvin, huipi chu alhavingin amangin alengin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai chu muthim in ahung kitom in, meilom twi jingletlut pumin ahung lhungin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Yahweh Pakai vah'in ahintom chu meilom satah'in ahinkhu khum in gelchang le mei-am chu gojuh'in ahung julhan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Yahweh Pakai chu vanna konnin ahung kisen in hatchungnung ogin chu gelchang leh mei-am koulah achun akithongin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Aman athalpi ahin kapmin agalmiho chu athe cheh'in, avah em lahlah chun amaho chu asuboi gamtan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 O Yahweh Pakai nangin nagalmi ho napho a lunghangtah a nakisen chun twikhanglen ato geijin akikangin, leiset bulpi jouse jong akeuvin aumjie.   
\p
\v 16 Aman vanna konnin akhut ahin lhangin eihin kaidoh'in, twipi thuh lah'a kon in jong eikaidoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Aman kagalmi hattah tah ho a konin eihuh doh in, kasang a hatjo ka dougal hoa kon in eihuhdoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hahsatna kato pettah'in amahon eihin delkhum un ahinlah Yahweh Pakai in eipanpin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Aman kahoidohna mun nah eipuilut in eihuhdoh tai ajeh chu ama kipana kahi.   
\p
\v 20 Yahweh Pakai in thildih kaboljeh in kipaman eipen mona kaneilou jeh'in eikiledohsah tai.   
\p
\v 21 Keiman Yahweh Pakai lampi kajui in, thilse lam jon'in Elohim Pathen'a kon'in kakiheimang poi.   
\p
\v 22 Keiman Yahweh Pakai chonphatna lampi kajui jingin, a Dan thupeh ho kapaidoh khapoi.   
\p
\v 23 Elohim Pathen masangah nolnabei kahin, chonsetna kon'in kaki kangse jing e.   
\p
\v 24 Yahweh Pakai in thildih kaboljeh in Aman kipaman eipejin ahi. Aman themmonabei kahi amui.   
\p
\v 25 Mikitah kom'ah nangmatah jong nakitah'in, monabei ho kom'ah monabei nahi.   
\p
\v 26 Milungtheng ho kom'ah nalungtheng in ahinlah miphalouho kom'ah nakhohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Nangin mikineosah ho nahuhdohjin ahinla mikiletsah ho nasujumjin ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Nangin thaomei neidetpeh'in, Yahweh Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen'in kamuthim jong neisalvah peh e.   
\p
\v 29 Nangma hatna chun kagalmi hi neisuhchip peh'in Elohim ka Pathen toh kapankhom poupou leh itobang bang sang hijongleh kakal ngapchan ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Elohim Pathen lampi chu nolnabei ahi! Yahweh Pakai kitepna jouse alolhing jinge. Amahi ahuhdoh ding ngaicha jouse dinga lum le pho ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Yahweh Pakai tailou pathen dang um'am? Elohim Pathen tailou songpi det dang um'am?   
\p
\v 32 Hiche Elohim Pathen hin eihatdoh sah'in kalampi jong hoibitnapen ahisah ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Aman molsang hahsa chung dunga kadindet theina din kakeng jong sakhi keng bang'in atah sah e.   
\p
\v 34 Aman kakhut teni jong galsatna a manthei dingin agongin, kabanjang jong sum-eng thalpi loithei dingin ahatsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Nangman nagaljona lum chu neipetan nabanjetnin neipanhun ahi. Neikithopina hin eithupi sah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Nang man kakeng phang tenin alhonal louna dingin kalampi neikehlet peh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Keiman kagalmite kadel'in kaman'in ahi; amahohi kajo kahsen katangpon ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Amahohi ahung ki thodoh jou louna diuvin kasat lhun kakeng noijah akijammun ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Nangin kagalsatna dingin thahatnan neivon in; Nangman kagalmite chu kakengphang noi a neikoipeh e.   
\p
\v 40 Nangin angongchang'u neichotpha sah'in eivetda ho jouse chu kasumang sohtan ahi.   
\p
\v 41 Amahon panpi athummun koiman ahung huhdoh pouve. Amahon Yahweh Pakai akouvun ahinla Aman adonbut pon ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Keiman amaho chu huilah a vutvai kithethang bangin tol ah kagoibong sel'in, bonlhoh lah'a kasunat gamatai.   
\p
\v 43 Nangin eihouse jing ho chungah galjona neipetan ahi. Nangin namtin vaipi chungah vaihom'in neipansah tan ahi. Kanahet phahlou miho jeng jong kalhachan ahungpang tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Kamin ajah jah'un kanoijah alut un gamchommi hojeng jong ka-anga akisunem gamtauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 45 Hansanna aneijou tapouvin kithing pumpum'in ka-ang ahinbel tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 46 Yahweh Pakai ahing jinge, kasongpia apanjeh'in kathangvah e! Ka sochatna Elohim ka Pathen chu loupi jing tahen!   
\p
\v 47 Amahi eibolse ho lethuh jinga Elohim ka Pathen chu ahin, aman namtin vaipi hi eisuhnem peh'in kanoijah eikoipeh tai.   
\p
\v 48 Chuleh kagalmitea konnin eihuhdoh'in nangman kagalmiten aphah joulouna munnah neikoijin, eidouva mi-engse hoa konnin neihoidohsah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 49 Hichejeh hin O Yahweh Pakai namtin vaipi lah'a nathangvah ingkate, na min vahchoinan la sang nge.   
\p
\v 50 Nangin leng a natun pa din goljona loupitah chu napetai; Chuleh nathaonupa David leh achilhahte chunga nalungset longlou namusah e.   
\c 19  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Natoh Ho Leh Athu Hing In Aloupina Phong  
\s1 David labol  
\p
\v 1 Vanho'n Elohim Pathen loupina aphongdoh un ahi. Vanthamjol hon jong akhut thepna atahlangui.   
\p
\v 2 Anitin in aphongdoh jing jeng un; jansim janseh le amachu aseiphong jingui.   
\p
\v 3 Ocheng soh lou vin thu asei un; a ocheng'u hi akijakha ngaipoi.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinlah athu chun vainoi alodim in, thucheng jong chun vannoi leiset athechansoh in ahi. Vanthamjol hoa Elohim Pathen in nisa chenna ding asem peh e.   
\p
\v 5 Hihchu kichen jouva moulang emsel a ahung potdoh bangin avahchan jengin ahi. Kisongtah a lhaitet golseh a pango bang in haltah le kipah tah in aum e.   
\p
\v 6 Vanmong langkhatna konnin nisa ahung sohdoh jin ajotna ding vanmong lang khat gei in ajui peh jie. Hiche asat a kon chun imacha ahoidoh ji poi.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai thuhil hohi achamkim in, lhagaova asuhhal jing in ahi. Yahweh Pakai Dan thu hohi tahsanthei tah ahin milham jong chihsah jengthei ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai thupeh hohi adih'in, lungthim kipasah ji e. Yahweh Pakai thupeh hohi akicheh'in lungsunga hetthem theina eipeuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai ginle jana neihi athengin ahi, hichehi tonsotna ding ahitai. Yahweh Pakai thutan hi adih'e; a etih a dih jing jeng ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hicheho chu sana sanga deiumjo ahin, sana thengpen sanga jong deiumjo ahi. Khoiju sangin jong alhumjon, akhoiphang dunga kilhoh lhatil sangin jong alhumjoi.   
\p
\v 11 Hicheho hi nasohpa dinga gihsal na ahin, nathu nung hoa dia kipana chanvou lentah ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Kalungsunga chonset kisel guh jouse hi itikahetdoh jouding ham? Hitobanga kiselgua setna hoa konhin neisilthengin.   
\p
\v 13 Nasoh hi henasasa chonset bolna a konnin neihuhdoh'in! Hicheho hi kachunga vaihomsah hihbeh'in, chuteng keima chonsetna a konna kahoidoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Kakam a kon'a hung potdoh thucheng holeh kalungsunga kalunggel ho nalunglhaina hihen, O Yahweh Pakai kasongpi leh eihuhhingpu.   
\c 20  
\s1 Galjona Dinga David Taona  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Na hahsat nikhon Yahweh Pakai'in nakana taona nadonbut hen. Jacob Pathen Elohim min chun thilse jousea kon in nahoidoh hen.   
\p
\v 2 Aman ahouintheng a kon'in kithopina nahin pejing henlang Jerusalem a kon in nahin hatsah jinghen.   
\p
\v 3 Elohim Pathen'in namaicham thilto ho hingeldoh jinghen lang chuleh napumgo thiltoho jong khotona in nahin vetpeh jinghen.   
\p
\v 4 Elohim Pathen'in nalunga nangaichat nape henlang nathilgon jouse nalolhinsah soh keihen.   
\p
\v 5 Nagaljona thu kajah tenguleh kipah'a kasapdiu ahi, chuleh Elohim ka Pathen u minna galjona ponlop kadopsangdiu ahi. Yahweh Pakai in natao na jouse donbut jing hen.   
\p
\v 6 Tun keiman athaonu lengpa chu Yahweh Pakai in ahuhdohji ti ka hetai. Aman avan mun thenga kon a ahin donbut ding, chuleh athahatna nasatah a chu ahuhdoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Namtin vaipi abankhat chun a sakol u leh sakol kangtalai hou akiletsah piuvin, ahin eihonvang Yahweh Pakai, eihon Elohim Pathen u minbou ikiletsahpi diu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Namtin vaipi hohi hunglhu'u vintin chip lhadiu ahi, ahinla eihovang idindoh diu chule dehtah a idin diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Kalengpau chu galjona pe'n, O Yahweh Pakai! Panpi ngai a kakana neidonbut tei in.   
\c 21  
\s1 Melma Khutna Huhdohna Jal'a David In Elohim Pathen Athangvah  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Nathahatna ahi lengpa iti kipah hitam O Yahweh Pakai! Galjona napehjeh'in aman kipah'in kho asam e.   
\p
\v 2 Ajeh chu nangin alungthim'a angaichan napen aman athumho khatcha jong nadapeh poi.   
\p
\v 3 Nangin lolhin naleh houtheinan nalamto jin, aluchungah sana hoipen lallukhuh nakhuhsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Aman ahinkho nahoitup peh din athumjin, chule nangin ataona nasanpeh jie. Ahin nikho jong tonsot a din nasuh saopeh ji e.   
\p
\v 5 Nagaljona chun jabolna lentah achansah in, thupina le loupinan najemhoijin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Nangin tonsot malsomnan naphungvuh in chuleh nangtoh umkhom a nopna kipana achun naphung vuh e.   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu lengpa'n Yahweh Pakai atahsan e. Hat chungnung ngailutna longlou chun alhuhna dinga konnin na hoidoh sah jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Nangin nagalmiho chu namattup sohkei ding, nangma nadouho jouse chu thahattah na banjetna chu na mattup ding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Nangma nahung teng amaho chu meikong lah'a naselut ding ahi. Yahweh Pakai in alunghanna a asuhgam ding meikonga ahalgam ding ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Achateu leiset chunga kon a nathaimang ding; amahon sonlepah aneikitlou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Amahon nangdounan thil gong jongleu, athilse gonhou chu lolhing louding ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Ajeh chu amahon nathalchang amaho kapna dinga nadoi chu amutenguleh kiheimang untin jammang diu ahitai.   
\p
\v 13 O Yahweh Pakai na thahat na nasatah a chun hungthou doh tan. Tumgin le lasah to thoa nahat na natoh chu kakipa pi diu ahi.   
\c 22  
\s1 Gentheina Pum'a David Thangvahna  
\s1 La lamkaipa henga jingkah khovah kona sakhi laina pen banga peng liuva sah dinga david labol  
\p
\v 1 Ka Pathen Elohim, ka Pathen idia neidalhah hitam? Panpi ngai a kamao teng idia gamlha tah a um ji nahim?   
\p
\v 2 Niseh in nangma kakoujie, Elohim ka Pathen, hinlah nangin nei donbut poi. Janseh jongleh kakou ogin naja jin, hinlah lungmon na kanei jipoi.   
\p
\v 3 Israel'in athangvah jing laltouna-a tou nangmahi Atheng nahi.   
\p
\v 4 Kapu kapa teovin nangma natahsan un, nangman amaho nahuh hing tai.   
\p
\v 5 Naheng a akap un huhhing in a umtaove. Amahon nangma natahsan un nang man amaho nasujum poi.   
\p
\v 6 Hinlah keima hi mihem a dia lhing joulou lungtol bang bep kahi. Mijouse dia thet umle musit umchu kahitai!   
\p
\v 7 Eimu jousen eihouseovin, aleiju adosah un, alu apeijun asei uve,   
\p
\v 8 “Ama pa hi Elohim Pathena ki ngai pa chu hilou ham? Achuti le a Pathen Elohim chu kihuhdoh sah hen! Yahweh Pakai in amahi angailut a ahileh aYahweh Pakai in huh doh hen!”   
\p
\v 9 Nangin kanu naobusunga konin neina hoidamin nei pui galkai in, kanu a-anglum laija patna nangma tahsanje neina hil ahitai.   
\p
\v 10 Kahung pen a patna nangma ban thahatna a eikipelut a ahitai. Kahung penlhah a patna ka Pathen chu nangma nahi jing e.   
\p
\v 11 Keija kon in gamla loujen in ajeh chu boina ahungnai in, koima dang eikithopi thei aumpoi.   
\p
\v 12 Bongchal ho'n aum kimvel bangin kagal miten eihin um kimvel taovin, Bashan bongchal khohlai hon eium kimvel taove!   
\p
\v 13 Hang tah le kisong tah Keipi bahkai in aneh ding aboltel bangin keima val lhum dingin akamkau ve.   
\p
\v 14 Kahinkho hi twi banga kisunglha ahitai, kagu kachang hojong akilhep gamtan, kalungchang jong khoilu bangin ajunlha gamtai.   
\p
\v 15 Nisan asah gep leilhang bangin katha akanghel jengtai. Kaleijong kadang chungah akikamat tai. Nangin vutvai lah a neijam in athidin neida lhatan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Kagalmiten uichahon bangin eium kimvel taovin. Migilou honkhat in eium kimvel taovin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Kagu kachang hojong simthei ahisoh tan. Kagal miten eiveovin eivesalteh jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Kavon hojong vang asan un akihom gamtaovin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 O Yahweh Pakai keija konin umgamla hih behin! Nangma kathahatna nahi neihung kithopi loijin.   
\p
\v 20 Nachemjam chun neihuhdoh in, kahinkho manlutah hi hiche uicha hoa kon in neihuhdoh peh in.   
\p
\v 21 Keipi bahkai kam a kon in neiloidoh peh in lang hiche gambongchal hang kiteni ki a kon in neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 22 Kasopi pasal holeh numeiho kom a naminhi phongjal leng katin, Houbung kikhom holah a nangma kathangvah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Ama gingho jousen Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah hen! Jacob chilhahte jousen amachu ging uvin! Israel chate jousen amachu jana peohen!   
\p
\v 24 Ajeh chu aman migentheite thohgimna jouse chu anungsun pon, panpi ngaichatna a taona neiho angaipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Keiman Houbung kikhopna lah a nangma kathang vahding ahi. Nangma chibai boh ho angsunga kakitepna kasuh bulhit ding ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Mivaichaten neovintin vaset diu ahi. Yahweh Pakai holte jousen amachu athangvah diu ahi. Alung thim u tonsotna kipah jingding ahiuve.   
\p
\v 27 Vannoi leiset miten Yahweh Pakai chu ahin hetdoh diu chuleh akom a hung kilediu ahi. Chutengleh namtin vaipi insung jousen a anga hungkun cheh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Ajeh chu leng thaneina chu Yahweh Pakai ama a bou ahi. Aman namtin vaipi chunga vai ahom ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Leiset chunga mihaohon ankong sem untin chibai aboh diu ahi. Ahinkho kichai a leivui sohding athithei mihem jouse a anga kun cheh hen.   
\p
\v 30 Ichate jouseuvin jong Ama kin ahinbol diu ahi. Ahung lhungding khang miten jong Yahweh Pakai kidanje chu ahin jahpeh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Tua penglou laiho komma jong thudih a anatoh naho jouse hung kiseipeh ding ahi. Amahon athilbol natoh naho jouse ahin jahdiu ahi.   
\c 23  
\s1 David in Yahweh Pakai in a kelngoi bangtah a eichin ahi ti  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu akelngoi keima eiching pa ahi, keiman lhah samna neiponge.   
\p
\v 2 Aman hamhing dumlah lah a kelngoi bangin eikicholdo sahjin, kilinglou hel twiveina pang dungah eipuilei.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai in katha akiledoh ji. Amintheng khohsahna jalin lamdih lang jenga eipuilen ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Thim jin napen phaicham palgalkai jongleng keima kichaponge, ajeh chu nangman naum jing in nateng gol le namoljol chun neihongin neilhamon jinge.   
\p
\v 5 Ka melmate masangtah jenga jong nangin kaneh ding ankong neiluipeh in, naphat theina thao ka lujangah neinupeh in kadon ding khonjong phatthei na aletset in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Tahbeh in phatnale hepinan kahinkho lhung keiya eijui jingding ahi, chuleh keijong tonsot na Yahweh Pakai inn sunga kachenjing ding ahi.   
\c 24  
\s1 Loupina Lengpa  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 vannoi leiset le asunga umjouse hi Yahweh Pakai a ahi. Vannoi pumpi le asunga cheng mihemte jousehi Ama a jeng ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Ajeh chu Aman leiset khombul hi twikhanglen chunga atun ahin, twipi thuhlah a aphudet ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Koiham Yahweh Pakai moul chunga kaldoh jouding? Koiham amunthenga dingthei ding?   
\p
\v 4 Akhut le Alungthim thengho bou, chuleh milim semthu houlou le jou seilouho bou hidiu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Amahon bou Yahweh Pakai malsomna amudiu ahin, chuleh ahuh hingpao Elohim Pathen toh ki guijop na dihtah aneitheidiu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hitobang miho hinbou nangma naholthei diu chuleh Jacob Elohim Pathen nangma nachibai theidiu ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Khanglui kelkot ho kihonglen un! Khanglui kotpiho kihong len un lang leng loupi chu lutsah un.   
\p
\v 8 Koiham lengloupi chu? Yahweh Pakai hattah leh thupi tah, Yahweh Pakai koiman ajojou lou galhattah chu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Khanglui kelkot ho kihong lennun, khanglui kotpiho kihong lennun, loupina leng chu lutsah un   
\p
\v 10 Koiham lengloupi chu? Van Elohim Pathen sepai, Ama hi leng loupi chu ahi.   
\c 25  
\s1 David Tahsandet Tah'a Atao  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, kahinkho hi nang kapetai.   
\p
\v 2 Nang katahsan e Elohim ka Pathen! Nei jumso hihbeh in, chule kalel na a hin ka melmate kichoisang sah hihbeh in.   
\p
\v 3 Nangma tahsan koimachan jumna ato loudiu ahi, amavang mijoulhep gojing honvang jumna ato diu ahi.   
\p
\v 4 O Yahweh Pakai lamdih chu neihil in; kajuiding lampi chu neiko peh in.   
\p
\v 5 Nathutah chu neihil in hichea chun neipui in ajeh chu nangmahi eihuh hinga Elohim ka Pathen chu nahi. Nilhum kei keijin nanga hin kinepna kanei jinge.   
\p
\v 6 O Yahweh Pakai gol lui a patna neihin puinao nami khoto nale na mingailutna longlou hingeldoh in.   
\p
\v 7 Ka khangdon lai a kachonset gitlou naho neigeldoh peh hih inlang nami ngailutna longlouva neipuina johchu galdoh in, ajeh chu nangma milungset them nahi, O Yahweh Pakai.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakaihi apha ahin adih jengbou abol'e, aman lamdihlou vache ho jeng jong lamdih akopeh jinge.   
\p
\v 9 Aman mi kineosah hochu lamdih a apuijin, ama dei lampi chu ahil jinge.   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai kitepna nitjing holeh ama deipeh dungjuija chonho chu ami ngailutna longlou leh akitahna in apuihoi jinge.   
\p
\v 11 Namin loupina dingin O Yahweh Pakai, ka chonsetna simjoulou neingai dam in.   
\p
\v 12 Yahweh Pakai ging ho chu koi ho hiuvam? Amaho che nading lampi chu Yahweh Pakai in avetsah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Amaho chu khangtou untin achateovin jong gamsung alodingu ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai hi ama gingjing tedinga golphapen ahin, Aman hitobang miho chu akitepna ahiljing e.   
\p
\v 15 Kamit tenin Yahweh Pakaichu avejingin, aman kagalmite thangkol a kon in eihuhdoh jinging e.   
\p
\v 16 Neihin ang-ngatnin lang neikho ton, ajeh chu keima kachangseh a lungthom haotah a um a kahi.   
\p
\v 17 Kaboi na ho akhoh se cheh un. Oh hichehoa konhin neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 18 Kalung gimnahi neihet pehin chuleh kahah satna hohi neivet peh inlang kachonset naho ngaidam in.   
\p
\v 19 Ven galmi ijat mong kanei hitam chule ama hohin ichan geija eihotnu hitam!   
\p
\v 20 Neivengbit in! amaho akona hin kahinkho huhdoh in! nangma a kisel kahi neijumso hihbeh in.   
\p
\v 21 Kitah nale thenna in eivengbit hen ajeh chu nanga hin kakinepna aum jinge.   
\p
\v 22 Vo Elohim Pathen Israelte hi aboi najouseu va kon in lhatdoh tan.   
\c 26  
\s1 David In Thudih Le Tahsan Ahina Dol Elohim Pathen Henga Aphon  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai themmo na bei kahihi phongdoh tan, ajeh chu keiman kitah na neitah in hinkho kamang in nungchonlou hel in Yahweh Pakai a tahsan na dettah kaneije.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai neipatep inlang neikhol chil in, kachondan leh kalungthim hi vechen mongin!   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu neingailutna longlouhi keiman kahejing e, chuleh keiman nathudih dung jui in hinkho kamange.   
\p
\v 4 Keima mijouho tojong kakivop khompon, miphalhem ho deilam jong kachepipon ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Keiman migiloute kikhop na kathet in thilphalou hojong kanuse ji e.   
\p
\v 6 Themmona kaneilou vetsahna in kakhut kasil in namaicham kahin jon e O Yahweh Pakai,   
\p
\v 7 Thangvah la sapum in nakidan na ho kaphong doh e.   
\p
\v 8 Na houin theng kangailui, Yahweh Pakai, naum pi na loipi tah kilan doh na mun chu.   
\p
\v 9 Michonse ho thoh ding neithoh sah hih in, tolthat hoto kibang in neithep mo sah hih in.   
\p
\v 10 Set bolnom nan akhutnu asuboh un, chuleh amahon phatseh in nehguh akilah un ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Keiman hitobang hinkho chu kamangpon, kitahna hinkhoa kading jinge. Hijeh chun neilhat doh inlang nami hepina chun neipuijin.   
\p
\v 12 Tun keima tolgo lai a dettah in kadinge chuleh keiman lhangphong tah a Yahweh Pakai kathang vahding ahi.   
\c 27  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Thaneina Dol'a David Tahsan Detna  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakaihi keidin vah leh huhhingna ahi. Chuti ahileh idia kakichat ding ham? Yahweh Pakaihi kakulpi, hahsatna a eihuhdoh pa ahi. Chuti ahileh ken idia kakithin ding ham?   
\p
\v 2 Migilou ten suhgamdia eihindel khum uva, kagalmite leh eidou teovin eihin nokhumteng uleh kipal lhuvintin chuleh lhugam diu ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Galmi tamtah in eium kimvel jeng jongleh kalung linglao ponte, ijemtin thagam dingin eihin delkhum jongleo Elohim ka Pathen a lung mongtah a kaum ding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche thilkhat Yahweh Pakai henga kathum kadei pipen chu kahinkho lhumkeija Yahweh Pakai in na umding, Yahweh Pakai lolhinna a chu lunglhaisel a um a ahouin na aphatnaho geljinga hinkho manding hi ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Ajeh chu aman hahsatna a konna eihoidoh sahding a Houin thenga chu eihoibit ding Aman mi maiphah louva songpi chunga eiselding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ajeh chu boina hon eihin lonkhum jong le Aman eihoi dam ding ahi. Ama houintheng sunga kipah le thanom tah a pumgo thilto kabolding semjang saipum a Yahweh Pakai thangvah la kasah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Kahung taove neingai peh in O Yahweh Pakai. Namikhoto na pum in neidonbut in.   
\p
\v 8 “Hungin lang neihoulim pin” nati chu kalungthim in ajan hitin adonbutne, “Yahweh Pakai kahunge”   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai neinung ngat hihbeh in. Na lunghan nan nasoh hi paidoh hihbeh in. Nangmahi eikithopi phapen chu nahijenge. Tun neipaidoh hih in; neidalha hih in, O Elohim Pathen ka huhing pu.   
\p
\v 10 Kanu le kapan eipaidoh jeng jongleh Yahweh Pakai in eikolchah jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 11 O Yahweh Pakai kahinkho manding Dan neihil in lamdih jenga neipuiin, ajeh chu kagal miten eichang lhijingun ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Amaho khut a neilhah lutsah hih in, ajeh chu amahon kabol louhel thil a themo eichan un, phatin in kachungah thilse abolgo jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ahijeng vangin, hiche mihing gam a kaum laisen Yahweh Pakai phatna kamu jing jeng ding kakinem e.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai chu lungneng tahin ngah jingin, Hanginlang hatnin, Henge, Yahweh Pakai chu lungneng tah in ngah jingin.   
\c 28  
\s1 David Dinga Elohim Pathen Hi Panpi Le Hoidohna  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai kasongpi nakom a kataove, Ngaipeh lou in neikoi hih beh in. Ajeh chu nangin neithip sanleh keijong lhadah ing kating kathi ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 2 Hepina ngeh a neipanpi dia katao teng nei ngaipeh tei in, kakhut kahin domsang in namun theng lam kahinsan e.   
\p
\v 3 Thilse bolnom jing a, akam uva thungei ngei seija alung sunguva thilse jeng gonle ho to nei sumang tha hih beh in.   
\p
\v 4 Amahon achanding dol u athilse bolu toh kitoh in got na pejengin! Athilse bolu dungjui chetnin lethuh jengin! Michunga athilse bol gu'utoh kitoh in amaho chungah chuhsah in.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai in ipi abolham ti amahon anahsah pouve, Elohim Pathen khut sem ipi jeh a umham agel pouve, hijeh a chu aman abotel a tonsot gei a kitung doh lou diu ahitai.   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah in umhen! Ajeh chu khotona kangaicha a kataona chu eijah pehtai.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai hi kahat nale kalum ahi. Kalungthim pumpin amachu katah san e. Aman eikithopin kalungthim kipanan adim e. Thangvahna la'n keiman kasam phonge.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in amite thahat apei, amahi athaonu lengpa dinga ahoidohna kulpi ahi   
\p
\v 9 Namite huhhing in! Kelngoi chingpha bangin nagoulu Israel chu phatthei bohtan, chule tonsot in amahohi nabanjetnin puitan.   
\c 29  
\s1 David In Ijakai Elohim Pathen Loupina Jeng Ahi Ti  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Nangho vanmi hon Yahweh Pakaichu jana peuvin; Aloupi nale athahatna jeh in Yahweh Pakaichu jana pecheh un.   
\p
\v 2 Amin loupinajeh in Yahweh Pakai chu jabolcheh un. Athenna thupitah jehchun Yahweh Pakaichu chibai bohun.   
\p
\v 3 Twipi chungah Yahweh Pakai ogin athong doh e. Vanthamjol ginbang in Elohim Pathen loupina akithonge. Yahweh Pakaihi twikhanglen chungah akithonge.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai ogin hi thaneitah ahi, Yahweh Pakai ogin hi thupitah ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai Ogin hin Cedar thing thupitah hojong aban tumboh gam e; Yahweh Pakai thupinan Lebanon Cedar thingho jong asubong soh gamtai.   
\p
\v 6 Aman Lebanon moljeng jong bongnou bangin akichop sah e, Aman Hermon moljeng jong gambong bangin akichop sah e.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai oginhi kolphe meivah gimneitah banga ginga ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai Ogin chun gamthip gamgolai jeng jong akilinsah e; Kadesh gamgolai jong Elohim Pathen in akilin sah e.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai Ogin hin gangpi phung phatah hojong ahot ling in, gammang jong asuchai hel e. Ahou in theng sungah mijousen “Aloupi” tin asam uve.   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai chu twipi chunga chun atouvin vai ahom e.   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai in amite thahat apen, Yahweh Pakai in amite chamna apen phatthei aboh'e.   
\c 30  
\s1 Huhdohna Jal'a David In Elohim Pathen Athangvah  
\s1 Houin kilhangdoh nia sah dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai nangin neihuhdoh tahjeh in kahin thangvah e. Nangin kagalmite kachunga nakithang at sahpon ahi.   
\p
\v 2 O Yahweh Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen panpi ngaichan kahin kouvin nangman ka tahsa nakiledoh sah tai.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai nangin lhankhuh a kon in neihin puidoh in, thina kokhuh a ka lhahlut na dinga kon in jong neihoidoh sah e.   
\p
\v 4 Nangho Elohim Pathen mite jousen Yahweh Pakai thangvahna lasaovin! Amintheng chu choi an'un.   
\p
\v 5 Ajeh chu alunghan hi phat chomcha bou ahijin, ami hepina vang hinkhoa ding ahi. Ka na nikho ho jong kipanin ajui pai jitai.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman ka phatthei nikhon, “Imachan eisutang jouponte!” kanati.   
\p
\v 7 O Yahweh Pakai nami hepinahin muol bangin eisudettai. Keija kon a nakiheimang jiteng leh keima kading jou jipoi.   
\p
\v 8 O Yahweh Pakai nahenga kahung tao ahi. Nami hepina chu kathum in hitin kaseije,   
\p
\v 9 “Keima kathi alhankhuh a ka lhalut teng nangdinga ipi phachom dingham? Katahsa leivui in nang navah choi thei dingham? Nakitah na thu chu hiche hin aphondoh thei ding ham?   
\p
\v 10 Neihin ngaipeh in Yahweh Pakai neihin khoto in. O Yahweh Pakai neihin kithopin”   
\p
\v 11 Nangin kalung khamnahi kipah tah a lam nan neiheidoh pehtai. Nangin kalung khamna silpon neilahdoh pehin kipana silpon joh neisilpehtan ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hitiachu thipsan louva thangvahna la kasah jing theina dingin. O Yahweh Pakai Elohim ka Pathen, keiman nangma tonsot in thangvah jing tange.   
\c 31  
\s1 David In Kicha Le Tija Pum'a Elohim Pathen Akou  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David Labol  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai neihuhdoh ding ngaichan nakom kahin bel e; Jumna neimusah hih behin. Neihuh dohin ajeh chu nangma chondihtah Elohim Pathen nahi.   
\p
\v 2 Kataona najah nadin neingai peh tei in; neihung huhdoh loi in. Kakiselna songpin pang jing inlang, kahoidohna kulpi hijing in.   
\p
\v 3 Nangmahi kasongpile kakulpi nahi namin loupina dingin kahahsatna a konnin neihuh doh in.   
\p
\v 4 Kadougal hon kalhuhna dinga thang eikampeh naova kon in neihuhdoh in, ajeh chu kahoidoh nahi nangma a bou aum e.   
\p
\v 5 Kalhagao nangma khut a ka pedoh tai. Neihuhdoh in Yahweh Pakai ajeh chu nangmahi kitah jing Elohim Pathen nahi.   
\p
\v 6 Phatchom nabei semthu pathen hou hokhu keiman kathet ahi. Kenvang Yahweh Pakai katahsan jing e.   
\p
\v 7 Nami ngailutna longlou jeh in keima kipah thanom jing inge, ajeh chu nangin kaboina ho neihet peh jingin chuleh kalung gimna jouse nangin neihet thempeh jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Nangin kadougal ho khutnah neipelutpon, lungmon na munjoh a neikoi jin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Neikhoton Yahweh Pakai ajeh chu keima hahsatna a um kahin kamitlhin kamit akhutan ahi. Kahinnale katahsa abeipaiding ahitai.   
\p
\v 10 Lungkham a thipaiding kahitai, gentheinan kahinkho asuhchom tai. Chonset in kajaitha anem sah in asung langa beipai ding kahitai.   
\p
\v 11 Kamelma ten eisamseovin, kaheng kakom ten eitheuvin ahi. Kagol kapaite jeng jongin eihin naingam tapouvin ahi. Lampi dunga eimu jongleh ajam mang gamji taove.   
\p
\v 12 Keima mithisa bang leh bel kehsa bangin notthap in kaumtai.   
\p
\v 13 Keima chung changhi thujoungen eikisei khum in tijatnan eium kimvel tan, kadougal ten keidounan thilse agong un kahinkho hi suhmang ding agouve.   
\p
\v 14 Ahinlah Yahweh Pakai keima nanga kingai jing kahin, “Nangma Elohim ka Pathen nahi!” kati.   
\p
\v 15 Khonung kakhankho hi nangkhut a um ahin hitia tanglouva eidelle jinghoa konin neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 16 Nami khotona chun nasohpa hi hinsalvah in, namingailutna longlou chun neihin huhdoh tan.   
\p
\v 17 O Yahweh Pakai neijumso hihbeh in, ajeh chu panpi ngaichan nangma kakou jinge, miphalou hochu jumsah jon, amaho chu alhankhuh uvah thipsan sahtan.   
\p
\v 18 Jouthu pot na alei u suthip in, ami noise nao le Elohim Pathen mite a houset nao leichu suthip jengin.   
\p
\v 19 Vo Yahweh Pakai nangma gingte dingin nangin ijakai nasuh nengpeh hi iti phat apha hitam. Panpi ngaicha a nakom a hungte nangman naphat thei in, vannoi mite mitmu changtah in nangman phatthei nabohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Nangin amahochu suhsetding gohoa kon in na angsunga nahoi bitjin, chuleh ahousetnao leile danga kon in jong na angsungah nahoibit jinge.   
\p
\v 21 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvahin umhen, ajeh chu Aman angailutna longlou kidangtah chu eimusah jingin, kachen na khopi gal akinokhum a kon in jong eihoidoh sahtan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Lunglinglao pum in keima kapengjah in, “Yahweh Pakai toh eiki sukhentai!” kati. Hinla Yahweh Pakai nangin nei kho to dia ka ka na neijahpeh in panpi ngaicha a kakouna neidonbut tai.   
\p
\v 23 Nangho Elohim Pathen miteho Yahweh Pakai chu ngailu vin! Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in ama a kingai jingho chu ahuhdoh jingin ahi. Ahinlah mi noiseho chu engbolna nasatah apejin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Hijeh chun Yahweh Pakaija kinepna neiho jouse hatnunlang hangun!   
\c 32  
\s1 Ngaidamna'a Kon Phattheina Thudol'a David Vahchoila  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Oh, asei ngailou nahou ki angaidam a achon set nahou kisuhmang peh ho iti thanop um hitam.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in ajihlutsa achonset nao athaimang peh a ahinkhou jongkitah tah a mangho chu iti kipa um a hitam!   
\p
\v 3 Keiman kachonset kaphon nomlou chun katahsa chu amangthah anahin, niseh in kapeng in kamao jinge.   
\p
\v 4 Sun le jan in kipui dih na nakhujol chun eidou ve. Nipilai a nichangsat in asuhkang twihu bangin katha asukang hel jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Akhon nan kachon setna nahenga kaphong in, kamo najouse selguh ding golou vin kasei tai “Kalouchal kasetna jouse Yahweh Pakai kom a phongdoh tang e” kati. Hiti chun Yahweh Pakai nangin neingaidam e! Kachonsetna jouse abeisoh tai.   
\p
\v 6 Hijeh chun, phatpha umlai hin Elohim Pathen mite jouse naheng a taocheh uhen, hiche thutanna twilen lah a alhahlut lou nadiuvin.   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu nangma hi kakiselna kulpi nahin; nangin boinana a kon in neihuh doh e. Galjona lan neiumkimvel tai.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in aseije, “Nahinkho a lampi phapen achu kapui le ding ahi. Keiman kathu mop a kavetsui jing ding nahi.   
\p
\v 9 Sakol le Sangan bangin hetna beiyin um hih in, ajo leh kamdal le thihkol bupeh a thunoiya ki koi nabah loding ahi.”   
\p
\v 10 Miphalou hohi lungkhamna tamtah in abomjin, ahinla Yahweh Pakai tahsan hovang angailutna longlouvin aum kimvel jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hijeh chun ama lungdei a chon ho Yahweh Pakai a kipah thanom jingun! Milung thengho jouse thanom tah in khosam un!   
\c 33  
\s1 Misempa Le Misudampa Elohim Pathen Vahchoina  
\p
\v 1 Elohim Pathen mite jousen Yahweh Pakai thangvahna la kipah tahin saohen; milung thenghon Ama athangvah diuhi lomtah ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Semjang gin ngaitah in Yahweh Pakai thangvah un, tumgin jangsom ngaitah saijin nguiheo vin saovin.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai thangvahnan lathah saovin; thepna neitah in selangdah saijun lang kipah tah in la saovin.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai thusei jouse chu atah ahin chuleh anatoh athilbol jouse chu tahsan thei cheh ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Adihleh apha kiti jouse chu Yahweh Pakai deilam ahin, Amingailutna longlou chun vannoi leiset hi adimin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai thucheng hin bou vanmun hi asem doh in, Ama thucheng haikhum chun ahsi jouse apendoh sah tai.   
\p
\v 7 Aman twikhanglen jong agamgi asempeh in chule twikhanglen jouse hi munkhat a aveikhom sah in akoidet in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Vannoi leiset pumpin Yahweh Pakaihi jana peohen, chuleh mijouse a-angsung a kichatah in dingu hen.   
\p
\v 9 Ajeh chu ama thucheng khat in leiset khang akipatsah ahi! Ama thupeh a kitungdoh jeng ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai in namtin vaipi thil gon houchu asuhboi peh in, chuleh atohgon hou jouse chu asuhmo peh in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinlah Yahweh Pakai thilgon vang tonsot in adet jing e, ama tohgot hochu itih a jong killing lou ahi.   
\p
\v 12 A pakaiju Elohim Pathen hikha nammite chu anunnom ahiuve, Yahweh Pakai in agoulo dinga alhen nammite chu anun nom ahiuve.   
\p
\v 13 Yahweh Pakai in vanna konnin mihemte jouse ahin ven musoh kei e.   
\p
\v 14 Alaltouna a konin ahin ven leiset chunga cheng jouse hindan ahesoh keijin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Alung thim u sempa ama ahijeh'in alung gellu le athilbol jouseo ahesoh kei e.   
\p
\v 16 Gal manchah phapen in lengpa huhdoh jou pontin, hangta le hansan nan jong gal hat pa ahuh doh jou poi.   
\p
\v 17 Gal satna sakol khatnin jong gal na josah jouding ahipon, thahatna jousen jong nang nahuhdoh jouponte.   
\p
\v 18 Ahinla Yahweh Pakai in ama gingte, angailut na longlou va ki ngaijing ho avelhi jing e.   
\p
\v 19 Yahweh Pakai in amaho chu athina diuva kon in ahuhdoh jin athigam nadiuva kon in ahuh dohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Keihon Yahweh Pakaijah kinepna kakoi ui. Ajeh chu amahi eiki thopiu leh eilum uva pang ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Ama a hin ilungthimu akipah in, ajeh chu eihon amin thenga tahsan na dettah inei un ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Vo Yahweh Pakai nami ngailutna longlou achun eium kimvel u hen, ajeh chu nang jenga bou ka kinepnao aum e.   
\c 34  
\s1 David In Phat Jousea Elohim Pathen Avahchoi  
\s1 Anomang pa Abimelech masang a mingol bang a aum nachung a David labol  
\p
\v 1 Keiman Yahweh Pakai chu phat tin in thang vah in kate. Yahweh Pakai thagvah nahi kakam sunga gingdoh jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Keima Yahweh Pakaiya bou kithang at jing ding kahin; Panpi beite jouse lunglut cheh uhen.   
\p
\v 3 Hungun Yahweh Pakai loupi nahi seiphong khom u hitin amin hi choi-an khom u hite.   
\p
\v 4 Keima Yahweh Pakai kom a kataovin aman kataona eisanpeh tai. Aman kakichatna jousea jong eilhat doh tai.   
\p
\v 5 Ama panpi ding ngaicha jouse vah bangin hungvah doh untin, amai uva jachatna muthim jinglou helding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Kahahsat behseh phat in kataovin Yahweh Pakai in eingai peh e; aman kaboina jouse eisuh lhap peh tai.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai vantil chu hoidamna ahin; ama ging te aman aumkimvel in ahuhdoh jinge.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai phatje chu patepmun lang veovin, Yahweh Pakaija kisel jing mite chu iti kipa hitaovem!   
\p
\v 9 Nangho Elohim Pathen mite ho Yahweh Pakai chu ging jingun ajeh chu ama ging jingten angai chat jouse amudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Keipi bahkai gol hat laitah jong agilkel jin, ahin Yahweh Pakai tahsandet jing hovang thilpha alhasam ngaipouve.   
\p
\v 11 Kachate ho hunguvin kaseihi kingai phaovin, chuleh keiman Elohim Pathen ginje kahilding nahiu ve.   
\p
\v 12 Hinkho sottah leh phatthei na lhingset a hingnom umkha em?   
\p
\v 13 Thuse seinan nalei tuhtangin lang chuleh nakam jong jouseinan mang hih in!   
\p
\v 14 Thilse a kon in kihai mangin lang thilpha bol in, chamna hol in lang hichu chepin.   
\p
\v 15 Yahweh Pakai mitin thilpha boljingho avesui jingin; panpi ngai a koute din akol tenin jong akihong jing e.   
\p
\v 16 Hinla thilse bolte chu dou mit nin aven, aman amin u leiset akon athaimang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Yahweh Pakai in panpi ngaichaho kouna angaipeh in. Aboi naova kon in ahuhdoh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Lungthim kisuchipte kom a Yahweh Pakai chu anai in; Alhagao kisu gimte ahuhdoh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Michonpha hon boina tampi atohjiuvin, hinla Yahweh Pakai in phat tinin ahung huhdoh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in michonpha ho gule chang ahoibit pehjin; khatchajong abohsah pon ahi!   
\p
\v 21 Hamset nan migiloute hinkho alah teiding, michonpha ho hotbol tejong got na chang tei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Hinla Yahweh Pakai in ama kin bolho vang alhatdoh ding, ama a kisel jing honjong themmo changlou diu ahi.   
\c 35  
\s1 Thudih Tanna Dia Elohim Pathen Henga David Taona  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai, eidou ho hi nangin kidoupin, ei kisatpi ho jong nangin kisatpin.   
\p
\v 2 Nalum leh naumpho hin kipat in. Galmun a din kigon lang neihung kithopin.   
\p
\v 3 Eihin delkhum ho dounan natengcha leh nateng muh chu hin lam tan. “Keiman gal kajopeh ding nahi!” ti neijah sah tan.   
\p
\v 4 Eithat goho chunga hin jumnale jachatna lhun sah in, eigimbol a eisumang go hohi jumson lang nungno jeng tan.   
\p
\v 5 Huilah a changvai alenmang bangin lenmang sah in, Yahweh Pakaija kon a vantil banga hung chu semmang sah in.   
\p
\v 6 A lam lhah nao thimsah inlang lhonalsah in, Yahweh Pakai vantil chun nungdel peh u hen.   
\p
\v 7 Keiman amaho kabol sepoi, ahin amahon kei matna dingin kotong eilai khum un ahi! Ken amaho kabol sepoi ahin amahon keimat nadin kotong alai uve.   
\p
\v 8 Hijeh chun amaho chunga hetman louvin mathahna hunglhung hen! Kei ona dia asem u kotong chu amaho manthahna hijo tahen.   
\p
\v 9 Chuteng keima Yahweh Pakai akakipa ding ahi. Eilhatdoh jeh a keima kipa thanom ding kahi.   
\p
\v 10 Katahsa chunga kagu kachang jouse pum a Yahweh Pakai kathangvah ding ahi: “Yahweh Pakai koiham nangtoh kitekah theiding? Koidang ba ham mihatpa thaneina a kona panpi beipa huhdoh a chu?”   
\p
\v 11 Engbolna dih louvin eithemmo sah un. Kahetphahlou jouthu a monna eikichan e.   
\p
\v 12 Amahon kathil phabol jengjong thilsen eile thuh un lung lhahnan kangui heltai.   
\p
\v 13 Ahijeng vangin amahon anat tenguleh keiman amaho kalainatpi jin khaodip pon kakisil in anngol in amaho kataopeh jin ahi. Hinla kataona donbut louvin ahung kinung le jitai.   
\p
\v 14 Ka golpha le insung mi monga kagel jeh in kalungkham pin, eihinga kanu kalainatpi bang bangin kalainat pi jin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hinlah ken tunia boina katophat in amaho akipah un keidounan thanom tah in akiloi khomun, hiti chun kahetkhahlou miho kisan in tujeng in jong eino khum un; phat tin in eihouse jing jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Amahon einuisat un eitam seovin noise tah in eihagel khum un ahi.   
\p
\v 17 O Yahweh Pakai itih changei pi neivet a donlouva neikoi ding hitam?   
\p
\v 18 Chutengleh mipi tamtah ki khom te lah a kipathu kahin seiding ahi. Mipi ho jouse masanga nangma kahin thangvah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Kajolel nachung a hin eidou te kipa thanop sah hih beh in. Kamuiset nachung in jong ajeh bei a eivetda ho kitai sah hih beh in.   
\p
\v 20 Amahon chamna thu aseipouvin, amahon thepmona neilou atoh dingdol bep tongho dounan thilse agong jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 21 “Aha! Aha! ipi bol kigo nahi kamit tah un kamudoh taove!” tin asam uve.   
\p
\v 22 O Yahweh Pakai nangin hicheghi namusoh kei in nahesoh e, donlouvin koihih beh in O Yahweh Pakai. neidalha hihbeh in O Yahweh Pakai.   
\p
\v 23 Hungthoudoh in! eihuhdoh dingin hung dingdoh jengtan! Yahweh ka Pakai le Elohim ka Pathen kachung thuhi neitan peh in.   
\p
\v 24 O Yahweh Pakai ka Pathen Elohim, kamo louna neiphon doh peh tan, ajeh chu nangma thudih a thutan nahi. Kaboina chung chon a kadougal te nuisat in neium sah hih beh in.   
\p
\v 25 “Veovin itup uchu imutaove! Tua hi ahingsan a inehchai diu ahitai!” tisah hihbeb in.   
\p
\v 26 Kahahsatna nikhoa kipah ho sujum inlang jachat sah in. Kachunga hanla samhohi jumnaleh minsetnan lhuh khumin.   
\p
\v 27 Ahin koi hileh keima ei huhdia hung ho jouse chu kipanalentah pen. “Yahweh Pakai aloupi e aman asoh hi lunglhai tah in phatthei aboh in lungmon na apei!” tin tanglouvin samjingu hen.   
\p
\v 28 Chuteng keiman nathutan adihji samphong ingting niseh a nangma kavahchoi ding ahi.   
\c 36  
\s1 David In Elohim Pathen Lungsetna Longlou Aphondoh  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia Elohim Pathen soh David labol  
\p
\v 1 Chonsetnin miphalou ho lungthim gilsungah thu aseijin ahi. Amahon Elohim Pathen ginna him him aneipouve.   
\p
\v 2 Akihisah naovin amaho le amaho akijou lhepmun ichan geija gilouleh phamo hiuvam ti akihet pouve.   
\p
\v 3 Athusei anatohna hou jousehi adihlou leh kijou lhepna ngen ahi. Chingthei tah a natoh leh thilpha bol dinghi adatthei pouve.   
\p
\v 4 Jankhosot in ahah un thildihlou tohgon tamtah agong jiuvin ahi. Atohdoh uhi apha khatcha aum poi. Thilsea konna kiheidoh ding angaito mong mong pouve.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai nami ngailutna longlouhi van bangin aki hohjale, nakitahna hin meilom kaina mun hohi akho khel e.   
\p
\v 6 Nadih na jong muolsang vum tobang ahi. Nathutan dihdan jong twikhanglen thuhtah abang e. Nangin mihemleh ganhing hojong kibanga nangailut ahi.   
\p
\v 7 O Elohim Pathen nami ngailutna longlou hi eti mamtam hitam! Mihem jousen nami ngailutna lhaving limnoija chun choldo na anei ui.   
\p
\v 8 Nainsunga nehkemlou ann a chun navah van, kanglou nalui a twi chun nadon sah e.   
\p
\v 9 Ajeh chu nangma mihem hung kondohna twinah nahin, keihon kamu u vahjonghi nanga kon ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai nangma ngailuho chung a nami ngailutna longlou chu londoh sah in, milung thengho chunga thu adih in tanpeh in.   
\p
\v 11 Mi kiletsah ho neichotpha sah hih in, ahilouleh miphalouho sot tol le neihisah hih in.   
\p
\v 12 Ven! Thildihlou bolteho alhugam taove! Amahochu kithoudoh kit loudinga sot lhuh ahitaove.   
\c 37  
\s1 Mikitahte Le Migiloute Dinmun Kibah Loudan  
\s1 David Labol  
\p
\v 1 Mikitahlou te chung a lungkham dan, thildihlou bolte jong thangse hih in.   
\p
\v 2 Ajeh chu amaho khu hamhing banga molloi diu, nipilai pahchaho banga goplha loidiu ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai chu tahsa inlang thilpha bollin. Chutileh gamsunga lungmongin chengin natin nakhan touding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai a kipah jingin, chutileh aman nalung sunga nangai chatchan napehding ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Nabol natoh jouse Yahweh Pakai a pelut jengin, ama chu tahsanin chutileh aman nakithopi ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Aman nathem na chu khovah banga muthimlah a avahdoh sahding ahi. Chuleh nachanchin jong sunlai nisa banga avahdoh sahding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai masangah lungneng chan ngahhat in Aman ahintoh ding chu ngah hat in. Mi giloute ahaotheiukhu lungkhampi hih un, athilse gon ujong lunghimo peh hih in.   
\p
\v 8 Lungchom lunghan bolhih in! Lung sat a kon in jong kihei mangin. Nalung lhaso hih in hichun thilse lamma bou napui lut ding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Ajeh chu migiloute kisumang ding ahin, amavang Yahweh Pakai tahsan a dingdet ho chun gamsung alodiu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Migilou hohi gangtah a mangthah diu ahin, amaho chu hol le jonglechun mangthai ding ahitaove.   
\p
\v 11 Kisunem tah a umhon gamsung alodiu ahin, lungmong tah leh ninglhing tah a inchengdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Mi gilouten Elohim Pathen ngaisah miho douna ahinbol diu; Amahon engset sanna ahin nelpehdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hinlah Yahweh Pakai in amaho chu ahin nuisat in, ajeh chu aman achung thu kitanna ding nikhou ahunglhun chu amui.   
\p
\v 14 Mi-engsen hon mivaicha ho leh suhgam theija umte that dingin achemjam u hin asatdoh un, athalpiu hin loisal uvintin, thilpha bolte chu ahin suhmang gotdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hinlah achemjam un amaho lungchang asutpai johding chuleh athalpiu chu bong ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ase bola thil tampi neisangin Elohim Pathen mite hia lhomcha nei aphachomjoi.   
\p
\v 17 Ajeh chu migiloute hatna chu kisumang ding, Pahen mite vang Yahweh Pakai in avenbit jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Ani ania Yahweh Pakai in themmona neilou hochu avetsui ding, chule amahon tonsotna mang louding gou chu alodiu ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Amahochu hahsat nikho jongleh kijumso loudiu kel lhah nikho jong leh angaichat ho anei teidiu ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Migiloute mangthai diu ahi, Yahweh Pakai dougal miho jong loulaija pahcha tobang ahiuve-mei banga hung mang loi diu ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Migilouten asumpa lah u anungsah ngaipouvin, Elohim Pathen mite vang hongphal tah a peh jeng ahiuve.   
\p
\v 22 Yahweh Pakai phatthei changhon gamsung alodiu ahin, aman asapset ho vang mangthah diu ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Elohim Pathen mite, Yahweh Pakai in akalsondan avetpeh in, ahinkho mandan jouse aman akipapin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Amaho chu kipal jongleu lhupai loudiu, ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in akhut in atuh jing ui.   
\p
\v 25 Phat khat lai chun khangdong kahin tun kateh tai, ahin Elohim Pathen mite paidoh a aumlam kahepon, achateo jong khutdon apangkhapouve.   
\p
\v 26 Elohim Pathen miten khotona neitah in sumpa ahomjiuvin, chuleh achateojong phatthei achang jiuve.   
\p
\v 27 Thilse akonin kiheidoh in thilpha bol in, chutileh tonsot a gamsunga nachen ding ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in thudih bou adei in, Elohim Pathen in acha teu jong donlou a akoi louhel ding ahi. Aman ahoibit jing ding, Gitlou bol chate vang mangthah diu ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Elohim Pathen chaten gamsung alodiu ahin, tonsotna cheng jingdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Elohim Pathen mite kamsunga thudih apotjin adihle adihlou ahilthem jiuve.   
\p
\v 31 Elohim Pathen Dan chu amaho changval din akisan un, hijeh a chu Ama lampi a konna vah lonle loudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Migilou ten Elohim Pathen mite achanglhi leuvin, suhmang nading lampi ahol jiuve.   
\p
\v 33 Hinlah Yahweh Pakai in migiloute alolhin sah louhel ding Elohim Pathen in mikitah te patepna a aum tengu le themmo achan louhel ding ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Yahweh Pakai ah kinem jingin. Alamlhong achun ching thei tah in lamjot in. Aman nadopsang a agam leiset nalosah ding ahi. Migilou te manthahvang namu ding ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Keiman migilou le khotonabei te Lebanon gama Ceder thingphung phatah banga akhantouvu kamui.   
\p
\v 36 Ahin kanungvet kitle, ana beisoh taove! Ken kahol le vang in kamudoh joutapoi!   
\p
\v 37 Milungtheng holeh miphaho khu veovin, chamna adei hochu amakhouva thilphatah in angah jing ui.   
\p
\v 38 Hinla thilse bolte suhmanga umdiu ahi; amahon khonung hinkho aneipouve.   
\p
\v 39 Yahweh Pakai in mikitah te chu ahuhdoh jin; boina nikho hoa jong Amahi akulpiu ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Aman amaho chu akithopin, migiloutea kon in ahuhdohjin ahi. Aman amahochu ahuhdoh in, amahon ama a lungmon na anei un ahi.   
\c 38  
\s1 David Lungheiya Elohim Pathen Henga Ataona  
\s1 Elohim Pathen in asuh mil lou nadia David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai lung phatmo nan neilethuh hih in, nalunghan jeh in jong neijep hih in!   
\p
\v 2 Nathal changho kasunga akikam dentan, nakhuttum in neivo lhutan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Neilunghan khum jeh in katahsa pumpi hi anan, kachonset naho jeh in katahsa achip soh tai.   
\p
\v 4 Kathepmo nan eilon khum in, agihdan poh jouhoi ahitapoi.   
\p
\v 5 Ngolhoi tah a kana chonset jehin, kamaha anasetan auidoh leotai.   
\p
\v 6 Kathoh gimna hin ei kong konsah tai, lung gim tah in nilhum kei in kavah len ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Khosih pi kasunga meikong bangin a allin, eidammo sahtai.   
\p
\v 8 Keima kalhasam in kapum in kagoi lhatai. Kalungthim natna a kon in kapeng pengin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai nangin ipi kangai chat ham nahei, nangin ka khoisatna jouse najai.   
\p
\v 10 Kahaina hu alhasam tan katha beitai, chule kamit in jong kho amu tapoi.   
\p
\v 11 Kangailut chengle kagol kapaiten kahivei hi akichaovin eidalha taove. Ka insung mite jengjong achomin aumtaovin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hiche jeng a jong chun kagalmi ten kathi nading thang akam nalai uve. Kaman thahna ding toh gon anei un, nilhum keijin kathi nading agong taovin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hinlah ken eikigih naho jouse chu kakijah mosah in, chuleh amasang uvah apaomo bangin thipbeh in kaumtai.   
\p
\v 14 Imacha jahlouding kanom in chuleh donbutna jong donbutlou ding kanom e.   
\p
\v 15 Ajeh chu O Yahweh Pakai nangma ngah jinga um a kahi. Nangin kataona neidonbut tei ding ahi O Yahweh Pakai Elohim ka Pathen.   
\p
\v 16 Keima katao in, “kadougalte noise tah in eivetsah dan, kalhuhna a jong kitaisah dan.”   
\p
\v 17 Keima tanglouva kathohgim na-ah akichaipai ding kahitai.   
\p
\v 18 Hinlah kachonset naho kaphong-doh in, ka nachonna ho chu kakisih behseh jenge.   
\p
\v 19 Keiman dougal khohtah tah ho kanei e; amahon ajeh beihel in eidou ui.   
\p
\v 20 Amahon thilpha kabol chu thilsen eilethuh un, chuleh thilpha kachepi jing jeh in eidouvun ahi.   
\p
\v 21 O Yahweh Pakai neidalhahih in Elohim ka Pathen kei a kon in um gamla hih behin,   
\p
\v 22 O Yahweh Pakai eihuh hingpa hungloi in lang nei kithopin.   
\c 39  
\s1 Chomkah Louva Hinkho Kikhel  
\s1 Jeduthun lalamkai pa dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 “Katohna chunga chingthei tah in thil bol ing kating, kathusei doh chenga chonseponge. Kavel a Elohim Pathen ginglou ho aumteng kalei kakituh tang ding ahi” tin kei le kei kakihou ve.   
\p
\v 2 Hinla hitia thipbeh a kaum a thupha jeng jong changkhat cha seilouva kaum chun kalung sunga lung gimna akhoh secheh in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Kalunga kagelbe chan in kalung gimna akhoh cheh in, hiti chun seilou in kaum theipon ahi:   
\p
\v 4 “Yahweh Pakai leiset a kahinkhohi ichan a chom hitam neihin hetsah jing in, kahin nikhohi akisim jinghi neigeldoh sah in, kahin kho iti chom hitam?   
\p
\v 5 Nangin kahinkhov hi ichangeija chom a nasem hitam kakhut phang sangin jong asaojo poi. Nang dingin kahinkho lhum kei jong hi haikhat bou ahi soh tan, Mihem hinkho khat cheh jong hi haikhat cheh bou ahi.”   
\p
\v 6 Mihem hinkho hi milom kitol bang bep bou ahin, kisah lunggim naho jong hetman lou kah in akichai loi ji tai. Gou ikhol khom un, kon ahin manding ham jong ihe doh ji pouve.   
\p
\v 7 Hijeh chun Yahweh Pakai hoi a kinep na kakoi ding ham? Nanga bou kakinep na aum e.   
\p
\v 8 Kaset bolnom na a kon in neihuh doh in, mingol ho neinoise sah hih in.   
\p
\v 9 Keima na ansung a thipchet in kaum e; imacha jong kasei louding ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ahinla Yahweh Pakai nei engbol hih in! Nakhut gu dounan kachao lhagam tai.   
\p
\v 11 Kachonset u suhdih na dia neijep tengu le, kasah lut u chonsetna chu nget in aneh bang in ajun lhaji tan ahi. Tahbeh in mihem khat cheh hi haikhat bou ahi.   
\p
\v 12 O Yahweh Pakai kataona ngai in lang panpi ngaija kataona neingai pih in! kamit lhi lon nah sah mon koi hih in, ajeh chu keima hi namaljin bou kahin, kema masang a kapu kapa teu bang a kholjin vahle kahi bouve.   
\p
\v 13 Hiche leiset hinkho hi kadalhah a kahin kho abei masang kakipa a kanui kit na din nalung han na, nagim bol na ho toh neichom khen in.   
\c 40  
\s1 David In Lungneng Tah'a Elohim Pathen Anga  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Panpi ding ngai in Yahweh Pakai chu lungneng tah in kangah jing e, aman kahenglam ahin ngan kataona eisanpih tai.   
\p
\v 2 Aman lunglhah nathei kotong a kon in eikai doh in, buol sung a buon ngan lah a kon in eikai doh in tolgo chung a eidin sah in kakal sonna jong eisuh dih pih e.   
\p
\v 3 Kasah ding lathah khat eipen, I Pathen u Elohim vahchoi na ding la khat eipen ahi. Mitamtah in ana toh hin mu un tin adatmo ding u ahi. Hitia chu amahon Yahweh Pakai chu atah san diu ahi.   
\p
\v 4 O Yahweh Pakai tahsan na a ding det ho iti akipah tadiuvem, amahon mikiletsah ho chung a tahsan na anei pouvin ahilouleh semthu pathen limhou ho jong atahsan pouve.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen, nangin keiho ding in thil kidang tah tah neibolpeh taove. Neigon peh u thilho hi simjou sutjou hoi ahipoi. Nangto kibang ding koima cha aum poi. Na kidang natoh doh ho hi sim ding kagon, achaina gei kalhun lou ding kahei.   
\p
\v 6 Nangman pumgo thilto ho a hin kipana nanei poi. Nei ngaisah thu ho chu tun kahechen tai, nangin chonset thoidam na thilto leh pumgo thilto jong nangeh poi.   
\p
\v 7 Hichun keiman kaseijin, “Ven keima kahung e. Elohim Pathen lekhabu a kisun bang in:   
\p
\v 8 Nangma lungdei lam bolding hi katha anop na ahi, O Elohim Pathen, ajeh chu kalung sung a nangma Danthu hohi akisun lut tai.”   
\p
\v 9 Namite jouse lah a nathutan dih je hi kaphongdoh tai. O het themna nei Yahweh Pakai, nangma bang in kichaloubeh in kasei doh tai.   
\p
\v 10 Nadih jedan kipana thupha hi keiman kachang a din kalungthim a selguh in kakoi poi; Nakitah na le nami huhhing na thu kasei e. Nahoubung mithengte lah a namingai lut na long lou le nakitah na chu tanglou in kasei phong jinge.   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai nangin tanglou vin neingailu jing jeng in. Nangailut nale nakitahna chu neihoi bit jing sah in.   
\p
\v 12 Boinan eibom in sim a simjou hoi ahipoi! Kachonsetna akikhol sang in kalampi jong kamu thei tapoi. Kalujang a kasam sangin atamjo tan hansan na him him kanei jou tapoi.   
\p
\v 13 Yahweh Pakai lungsettah in neihuhdoh in! hung vah in Yahweh Pakai neipanpin.   
\p
\v 14 Eisumang gohohi jumson lang kisuhboi sah in, kahahsat nikho a kipah ho lungdong in nungjam sah in.   
\p
\v 15 “Aha tun akimaikhah tai” ti a asei jeh un, jum nan kichao hen.   
\p
\v 16 Nangkom hinbel jouse kipa nale thanop nan dimset uhen. Nami huhhing na kipapi hochun “Yahweh Pakai chu aloupi e” tin sam jing u hen.   
\p
\v 17 Keidin vang gentheile vaicha kahi jeh in, Yahweh Pakai in alung sung a eihoi jing hen. Yahweh Pakai nang chu eikithopi le eihuhhingpu nahi. O ka Pathen Elohim khongai sot hih in.   
\c 41  
\s1 Elohim Pathen In Gentheite Akhohsah  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Mivaichate khoto ho chu anunnom ahi! Amaho chu Yahweh Pakai in boina ato nao a kon a ahuhdoh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in amaho chu ahoibit in ahinghoi jiu ve. Aman amaho chu gamsung ah phatthei aboh in galmiho akon na ahuhdoh ji e.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai in adam mo naova panpin tin adamdoh sahding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 “O Yahweh Pakai”, katao ahi “eilungset in, neidamdoh sah in ajeh chu nangma dounan kachonsetai.”   
\p
\v 5 Ahinla kadougal ten keima dounan thilse jeng asei un ahi. “Itih tah le athin suhmil in aum tadem?” atiu ve.   
\p
\v 6 Kagol kapai bang in eihung vil jiuvin, hinla chomloukah in kachungchang guhthim thu asei khom leuvin, eidalhah tengu le muntin in aphonjal ji taove.   
\p
\v 7 Eihot bolten keichung chang a thilphalou ngan aseijun, kachung a thilse ahung lhun dingbou adei un ahi.   
\p
\v 8 “Amahi thina thei hiveija na ahi” atiuve. “Amahi damdoh joulou ding ahitai!” atiuve.   
\p
\v 9 Katahsan pen kagol phapen, an kaneh khom pipa jeng jong keima eidouvin apang tai.   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai neilungset in. Neidamdoh sah kitin amahohi kalethuh jou nadin!   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai nangma kachunga nalung lhaije ti kahei ajeh chu nangin kamelmate kachungah gal nalel sahtai.   
\p
\v 12 Nangin kahinkho neihing hoipeh tai, ajeh chu keiman lhamonna kaneipoi, chuleh nangin atonsot a din na-angsung a neipui luttai.   
\p
\v 13 Israel Elohim Pathen Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah in umhen, Tonsot tonsot a hingjing pa chu. Amen chule Amen!   
\c 42  
\s1 BU NINA 42-72  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Ngaicha'a Dangchah  
\s1 Lalamkaipa henga Korah chilhah te labol  
\p
\v 1 Sakhi sitwi chimset ngaichat dangchah bangin, kahin ngaicha e O Pathen Elohim.   
\p
\v 2 Hingjing Elohim Pathen chu dangchah in kalha ngai e. Itih tahle kache a a-anga kachibai theiding ham?   
\p
\v 3 Sunle jan in lonlhi bou ann in kanei tai, kagal miten phat tin in ei enghouvun “Na Elohim Pathen hoija umham atiuve?”   
\p
\v 4 Kalung thim analheh ji e thil umdan hochu kageldoh ji teng: Elohim Pathen houin a mihonpi chutoh kilhon a, tanggol a Elohim Pathen inlam jon a kitol a thangvah la kisa a mihonpin golvah kibolji hochu!   
\p
\v 5 Ibol a kei lunglha dah kahim? Ibol a kalung hibanga hesoh a ham? Keiman Elohim Pathen a kinepna giltah kanei in! Ken ama kathang vah kit ding ahi ka huhhing pu Elohim ka Pathen.   
\p
\v 6 Tun keima kalung alhadah lheh jengtai, hinlah Jordan hung kondoh na, Hermon molsang lang hijong le kahin gel doh jing ding nahi.   
\p
\v 7 Nang man twipibang nakinon a naki ho twikhanglen gin chu kajai, nangma twipi kidilleh twipi kitol chun eihin lonvuh in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ahinlah niseh in Yahweh Pakai in angailutna longlou chun eiphung vuh jingin, chuleh janseh leh ama vahchoila kasajin hinkho eipe a Yahweh Pakai komma chun kataojin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 O Yahweh Pakai kasongpi keima kakapme, ipi dinga neisuhmil hitam? Ipidinga kadougal te bol hesoh jeh a lunggima kavale jingding ham?   
\p
\v 10 Eihou setnao hin kagep lhatan ahi, “Na Pathen hoija umham,” tin eidong jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ipi dinga keima hiti lungkham kahin, epidinga hiti lungboi kahim? Keiman Elohim Pathen nah kakinepna koijing ting chuleh eihuhhing paleh ka Pathen chu avellin thangvah kit inge.   
\c 43  
\s1 Them Chansah Ding Le Huhdohna Dinga Taona  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen themmona bei kahi neiphongdoh in! Elohim Pathen ginglou hoa kon in nei vengdoh in, chutengleh mikitah lou holeh joupan hoa kon in neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 2 Ajeh chu nanghi kakiselna Pathen Elohim nahi, ibol a neipaidoh hitam? Ibol a keima kadougal ten eibolset jeh a lunggim a kava lele dingham?   
\p
\v 3 Nadih na le navah na chu neihinsol peh in, hichun eilamhil hen. Hihochun nangma chenna muol theng chu eilhut hen.   
\p
\v 4 Hikomma chun keima Elohim Pathen maicham achu kasemjang puma kathang vahding ahi, O Pathen Elohim.   
\p
\v 5 Idia lungkham kahim? Ipidinga kalung lhadah ham? Keiman kakinepna Elohim Pathen a koi inge! Eihuhhingpa le Elohim ka Pathen keiman nangma thangvah kit inge!   
\c 44  
\s1 Masanga Elohim Pathen Mi Huhdohna Ho Chule Tua Gentheina  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia Korah chapate labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen, phat sottah masanga kapu kapateo khanglai a nanatoh nathil bolho eina seipeh u chu keiho tah in kanakol un kanajaove:   
\p
\v 2 Nangin nangma helou namtin vaipi ho naban thahat in nana deljam in agam leiset uchu kapu kapateo nanapen ahi. Nangin agalmiteo nana suhlhuh peh in kapu kapateo chu nana chamlhat sah in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Amahon achemjam uva gal anajouva gam analah u ahipoi; aban thahat uva jong gal anajou ahipoi. Amavang nangma ban thahat leh namaivah chun gal nana jopeh ahibouve ajeh chu nangin amaho chu nana ngailun ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nangma kalengpa le Elohim ka Pathen nahin nangin Israel te dingin gal nana jo peh tai.   
\p
\v 5 Nangma thahatna jal a bou kagal miteo kanungno jouvu ahin naming a bou keihon eidouhou kachotphao ahibouve.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman kathalpi kasongpoi, kachemjamin eihuhdoh dingjong kakinempoi.   
\p
\v 7 Nangma bouvin kagalmi teo chunga galjona neipeh u ahibouve, hitihin nangin eihotbol teo chu jumna napejin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 O Elohim Pathen naloupina ho hi tantih neilou va ka samphon jing diu, chule a kumkho a ka thangvah jing diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Ahinla tunvang nangin jumthetna neipaidoh u ahitai. Nangin ka sepia hou jengjong neilamkai peh tapouve.   
\p
\v 10 Nangin kagalmi teu va kon in neinung jamsah un chuleh eidou houchu kagamsung u nalosah tai.   
\p
\v 11 Nangin kelngoiho bangin eikisat chen chen sah gamtaovin chitin vaipi lah a neithe thang gamtaove.   
\p
\v 12 Nangin nasahlut namitehi manbai tah in najohdoh in man neilouhel toh nabah sahtai.   
\p
\v 13 Nangin kaheng kakomhou noise neichansah taovin kavelluva mite taitom le houset dingbep in neikoitaove.   
\p
\v 14 Nangin amaho totthang hoina bepseo neihisah taovin isahlou tah in alu eihih khum taovin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Ki taitom jingna a konhin kakile doh jouta pouvin kamai uva jumleh jachat mel kapu den taove.   
\p
\v 16 Kajah uhi eitaitomteo housetna thucheng ngen ahin, kamit uva kamu houhi ahileh kachunguva phula nom dougal mite ngen ahiuve.   
\p
\v 17 Hichenghi kathoh jeng vangun keihon nangma kasumil deh pouvin ahi. Kitepna thuchengho jong kasukeh deh pouve.   
\p
\v 18 Kalung thim un nangma kanuse deh pouvin nalampia konin jong kajam mangdeh pouve.   
\p
\v 19 Hinlah nangin sial chenna neldi gam anei suchipden taove, nangin thina le muthim neikhu khum taove.   
\p
\v 20 I jemtia keihon Elohim ka Pathen u min kasuh mil uva ahilouleh gamdang semthu pathen houna a kakhut u kalhandoh khah uva ahileh,   
\p
\v 21 Elohim Pathen in ahet teiding ahi ajeh chu Aman mihem lungthim a thuguh jouse ahet ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Ahin, nangma jal in niseh in eiki thatnun; kelngoi bangin eiki that taove.   
\p
\v 23 O Yahweh Pakai hung thoudoh in ibol a na imut ham? Hung thoudoh in! neipaidoh pai pai hihbeh un.   
\p
\v 24 Ipidinga namai naheimang ham? Kathohgim naoleh eibolset naohi nanahsah lou hitam?   
\p
\v 25 Keiho leivui lah a kalhumat gam taove, bonlhoh lah a akhupbon kakijam taove.   
\p
\v 26 Hung kipatdoh inlang! Neikithopiuvin! Nami ngailutna longlou chun neihung lhatdoh taovin.   
\c 45  
\s1 Lengpa Jineina'a Sah Ding La  
\s1 Lalamkai pa dia Korah chapaten joldei la “Lilies” lakai a sah dia abol'u.  
\p
\v 1 Kalungthim in thu hoi tah ahung kilang e. Keiman lengpa chungchang hiche jaila ngeitah hi lungchin in sei inge, ajeh chu kalei hi jaila themtah pa mol jap tobang ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nanghi mihem jouselah a ahoipen nahi, nalei a thungei tamtah ahung potdoh e. Elohim Pathen amatah in tonsotna din phatthei naboh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 O galhatpa! nachemjam chu hin kipoh in! nangmahi naloupi in nathupi e!   
\p
\v 4 Nathupina a chun hung kivon in lang galjou dingin hung kondoh tem in, thutah leh thudih chuleh kisuhnemna hohi chejom sahdingin kondoh inlang datmo umtah tah thilho chu hung tongdoh tan!   
\p
\v 5 Nathal muh hochu ahem in nagal mite lungsung asunvang jeng tai. Namtin vaipi nakengto noija aumtaive.   
\p
\v 6 Vo Elohim Pathen nalal touna hi tonsot tonsot a chejom jing ding ahi. Naleng tengol a chu thudih tah a vai nahomding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Nangin thudih tah a thutan nadeijin thilse nathet ahi. Hijeh chun Elohim Pathen, nangma Pathen Elohim chun thao nanu ahitai, lengdang sanga nang chungahi kipale thanopna thaotwi chu nasunlhah khum ahitai.   
\p
\v 8 Myrrh, aloes, chuleh cassia hon navon anamtui sel e. Saiha a kisem khopia chu tumging ngaitah a nakilamto ding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Leng Chanute chu na numei nunnem te lah a aum un. Najet langa ophir sana hoipen ho a kijem lengnu ading e.   
\p
\v 10 O leng chanu te kathusei ngai un; amapa hi jabol un ajeh chu ama hi na Yahweh Pakai pau ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ajeh chu sahlut tah naji hi namel hoinan alunglhai sel e; jabol in, ajeh chu amapa hi na Pakai pa ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Tyre lengpa chanuten jong kipa thilpeh tampi nahung pehdiu ahi. Mihaoten nalung lhaina ding ahin holdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Mounu, leng chanu, chu kivon na sana a kisem sangkholchol a chu iti vet loupia hitam.   
\p
\v 14 Hiche avon loupi tah kivon in lengpa kom lam a ahin pui un, anunjui nungah hochutoh apuilut un ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Kipah tahle thanom tah a leng inpi sunga ahung akijot lut uchu iti lou a loupi hitam!   
\p
\v 16 Nachate jong apa tobang a leng hung hicheh ding ahiuve. Nangin amaho chu gam tamtah a lenga napan sah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Khang jousea na min thanna kahin pohlut pehding ahi. Hijeh achu namtin vaipin tonsot a nahin thangvah ding ahi.   
\c 46  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Hi Eiho Dinga Kiselna Le Thahatna Ahi  
\s1 Korah chapa ten lalamkai pa heng a O chung hoa sah dia ala bol u.  
\p
\v 1 Elohim Pathenhi ikiselnao leh isongpiu ahi, boina nikho hoa eipanhu diuva kigosa ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Hijeh achu ling kihot henlang molle lhang chim henlang twikhanglen a kilehlut jongleh kicha tapouvinge.   
\p
\v 3 Twikhanglen hi kinong henlang kitum jeng hen. Twikhanglen kinong a ahung letdoh jeng bang in muolle lhang jong kihot chimlha jeng hen.   
\p
\v 4 Vadung khat in iPathen u khopia chun kipa thanopna ahin polut e.   
\p
\v 5 Hiche khopi achun Elohim Pathen achengin kisumang thei lou ding ahi. Nikho kipat a pat Elohim Pathen in avenbit jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Leiset chung namtin vaipihi aboitan lenggam hojong akiling sohtan ahi! Elohim Pathen ahung kisen in ahileh leiset ajunlha gamtan ahi!   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai hatchungnung hi ilah uva aum in, Israel Pathen Elohim hi ikulpiu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hungin Yahweh Pakai thil loupi bolhi hungvetan, Hunginlang aman vannoi leiset asuhmang hi hungve tan.   
\p
\v 9 Aman vannoi leiset pumpia galho hi atuhtang in athalpiu leh ateng chau heboh peh gamtan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 “Thipchet un, chule Elohim Pathen kahi hi heovin! Vannoi leiset pumin eijabol cheh diu ahi. Leiset pumpia a hi dopsanga kaum ding ahi.”   
\p
\v 11 Hatchungnung Elohim Pathenhi ilah uva aumme; Israel Pathen Elohim hi ikulpiu ahi.   
\c 47  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Hi Leiset Pumpi Lengpa Ahi  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga korah chapa te labol  
\p
\v 1 Mijouse hungun! Nakhut benguvin! Elohim Pathen kom a kipah tah in thangvahna sam un!   
\p
\v 2 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai Hatchungnung chu gimneitah ahi. Amahi leiset chunga leng thupitah ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Aman imasang uvah namtin vaipi hi asonkun in eidougalteo jong ikengto noi uvah eikoipeh taove.   
\p
\v 4 Gamtep gam chu, angailut Jacob chilhahate, kithang at tah a kijot eiho lodinga alhen ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Elohim Pathen chu gimnei tah in akal tou in, Yahweh Pakai chu sumkon gin kithong pum'in akal tou in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Elohim Pathen thangvah la sauvin, thangvah la sauvin; ilengpau thangvah la sauvin, thangvah la sauvin!   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu Elohim Pathen hi leiset chung pumpi chunga leng ahi lasah pum'in thangvah un.   
\p
\v 8 Elohim Pathen alaltouna theng chunga atou in namtin vaipi lah'a vai ahom'e.   
\p
\v 9 Vannoi leiset vaihomte Abraham Pathen Elohim mitetoh atoukhom'un ahi, ajeh chu leiset chunga leng jouse hi Elohim Pathen'a ahi. Amahi vannoi leiset chung muntin a jana achang'in ahi.   
\c 48  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Hi Aloupi Tangeiye chule Loupi Tah'a Vahchoi Ding Ahi  
\s1 Korah chapate labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai hi iti loupia hitam, ichangei a pachat dinga lom hitam, i Pathen'u Elohim chu akhopia acheng'in alhangtheng'a atou in ahi!   
\p
\v 2 Hichehi asang'in ahoilamdang'e. Leiset pumpi'n mu ding atup un athanom cheh ui. Lhangtheng Zion molhoi hi leng thupipa chenna khopi ahi!   
\p
\v 3 Elohim Pathen amatah chu Jerusalem indan sung'a chun acheng'in ahi Amatah hi avengbit'a pang ahi akilang doh e.   
\p
\v 4 Vannoi mite lengho akigom'un hiche khopi dounan ahin nokhum'un ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Ahinla amahon amuchet phat'un atangchot jeng'un atijauvin ajammang gamtauve.   
\p
\v 6 Amaho chu tijatnan numei naonei hon hahsatna atobang'in akithingleu jeng'un ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Ahin nang'in Tarshishte kong thupitah ho solam huijin asuhset bang'in nasuse tan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Keihon hiche khopi loupina chu kanajaovin tunvang Elohim Pathen hatchungnung khopi chu keiho tah'in kamuchen tauvin ahi. Hiche hi iPathen'u Elohim khopi ahi; Aman tonsot a ahoi doh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 O Elohim Pathen, na houin theng sunga nangma kavahchoi lai un nami ngailut na longlou chu kagel jing ui.   
\p
\v 10 O Elohim Pathen namin ja dia kilom tah ahibang in leiset kolmong geija vahchoiya naum ding ahi. Najet lam ban thahat chu galjona a dimset ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Zion mol'a mipiho kipah uhen. Judah khopiho nathutan dihjeh hin kipah uhen.   
\p
\v 12 Vo Elohim Pathen mite cheuvin Zion khopi gakholchen'un akimvel'a kijot uvin ainsangho jong gasim'un.   
\p
\v 13 Akhopi jouse jong gachon uvin lang akulpi bang nasa tah ho jong melchih'un, chule nang hon nason nachilhah teu naseipeh thei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Ajeh chu Amahi hitobang mong Pathen ahi. Amahi tonsot tonsot geija dinga iPathen'u Elohim ahin Aman ithi tokah uva eipui hoi diu ahi.   
\c 49  
\s1 Leiset Haona Lhou Ngailou  
\s1 Lalmakai pa henga Korah chapate labol  
\p
\v 1 Nangho mipite'n hichehi ngaijuvin! Nangho vannoi mite jouse'n ngaicheh uvin!   
\p
\v 2 Milen le mineo, ahao avai in ngaisoh keijun!   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu kathuseiho hi chihna thu ahin, chuleh kalung'a kagel jong hi hetgilna dimset ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Keiman thuchih kaseiho chu giltah'in kagel'in hiti chun semjang sai a kitilkhou in thulem kaseiho suhlhap na kanei jie.   
\p
\v 5 Kagalmite'n eihin umkimvel'uva boinan eihin lhunkhum teng idia kakichat ding ham?   
\p
\v 6 Amahon anei agouhou atahsan un ahaotheinau a akiletsah ui.   
\p
\v 7 Ahijeng vang'in athina diuva kon'in amaho le amaho akihuhdoh joupouvin Elohim Pathen henga sum in ahinkhou akichoh thei pouve.   
\p
\v 8 Lhatdamna kitihi bailam tah a um ahipoi, ajeh chu koiman alhingset'in apejou poi;   
\p
\v 9 tonsot'a hingjing a lhanmun'a chelou hel nading chu.   
\p
\v 10 Michingho chu nikhat thitei diu ahi, hiche mingol le lungel neilou ho banga anei agouhou chu adalhah cheh di'u ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Lhanmol chu atonsot inn'u ahitan achen jingna di'u mun chu ahitai. Anei agouho'u chu amaho min putsah jong leu.   
\p
\v 12 Aminthan nao chu sotlou ding ganhing ho bang'a thithou thou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Amaho hi min miching dan'in geljong leu mingol bang'a thina ato thou thou di'u ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Kelngoiho bang'a lhanmun lhung thou thou di'u thina chu akelngoi chingpa'u hiding, anei agouhou a kon'a gamlatah'a lhanmun khat'a monlha thou thou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Ahin keivang Elohim Pathen'in kahinkho eilhatdoh peh'in tin, Aman lhanmun'a kon'in eihuhdoh nante.   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun migilou ho ahung hao uva, a in chen ujong ahung hoibe cheh tengu le lunglhadah hih in.   
\p
\v 17 Ajeh chu amaho athiteng uleh imacha akipoh di'u aumpoi anei agou'un lhan sung'ah juilut thei pouvinte.   
\p
\v 18 Hiche lei hinkho'a hin alolhin jeh'un vangpha le ochat um'in kigel jong leu,   
\p
\v 19 Chemasa ho bang bang'a thidiu khovah amukit louhel di'u ahitai.   
\p
\v 20 Anei agou'u kiletsahpi ho chun amaho jong ganhing bang'a phat khatleh thithou thou diu ahilam akihetdoh lou'u ahi.   
\c 50  
\s1 Katdoh Sanga Thungaina Hi Elohim Pathen Lung Lhaina Ahijoi  
\s1 Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai loupipen ama chu Elohim Pathen ahin, chuleh Aman thu asei e; Niso namun apat nilhumna munho gei in mihem te akou jing e.   
\p
\v 2 Zion mol'a kon'in Amelhoina bulhingset'in Elohim Pathen loupina chun ahinsalvah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Pathen Elohim ahung lhung tai Ama thipbeh'in aumpoi, alamlhahna a thiljouse mei in akavam gamtai, chuleh avel'ah huipi nasatah anung'in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Aman a mite chung'a athutanna ve ding'in chunglang'a van ho le leiset akou in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 “Kahenga kilhaina bol'a kitepna kasemkhom pi tahsan umtah kamite chu kaheng a hin pui lut uvin.”   
\p
\v 6 Chuleh vanho jouse'n athudihna phongdoh uhen, ajeh chu Elohim Pathen amatah thutan'a pang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 “Vo kamite kathuseihi ngai uvin, Vo Israel nangma douna kathilgon aum'e, keima hi na Elohim Pathen chu kahi!   
\p
\v 8 Kilhaina nabolna ho leh pumgo thilto nabol ho chuleh tang lou a nathilpeh jingho chung'a hin keiman lungphatmo na kaneipoi.   
\p
\v 9 Ahin keiman nabong hon lah'a kon'a hiche bongchal ahin, nakel hon lah'a kon kelcha jongchu kangaicha dehpoi.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu gammang lah'a ganhing jouse kei a ahin, chuleh mol le lhang jouse'a bong ho jouse jong kei a ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Keiman mol jouse chung'a vacha jouse kahen, chuleh gamlah'a ganhing ho jouse jong keija ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Keima hi gilkel thei anahi jeng tajong leng nangma kom'a kasei angaipoi, ajeh chu vannoi leiset chung'a thil ijakai aumho jouse hi kei a ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Keiman bongchal ho sa kaneh a, kelcha ho thisan kadon khah em?   
\p
\v 14 Nang'in thangvahna hi kilhaina in mang'in, chuleh Hatchungnung kom'a nakitepna chu nit in.   
\p
\v 15 Chule genthei nikho'n keima neihin kouvin, keiman nahuhdoh ingting nang'in neichoi-at ding ahi.”   
\p
\v 16 Ahinlah miphaloute kom'a Elohim Pathen'in hitihin asei e: “nang'in ka Dan thu kakitepna chu naboi pi khoh ham?   
\p
\v 17 Ajeh chu kahilna na la najuipon kathumop jong lahlou in nakoi e.   
\p
\v 18 Nang'in guchaho namu teng napahcha in chuleh jonthanghoi bol te nakivop pi jie.   
\p
\v 19 Nakam sunga thujou adimset'in, nalei chu thujou jengseh seinan namang'in ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Muntin in natou len nanu a kona napenpi nasopipa jengjong jouthun naheh se lei.   
\p
\v 21 Nangma hitobang'a nakimanchah sung'in thipbeh in kaum'in ahileh keiman kanahsah lou dan'in nagel'in, tuvanghin nachung'a themmo kahinchan'a hichengse pum'a hi kahingih nahitai, nangma douna kahin lhunsah diho hi kagollha tai.   
\p
\v 22 Ei sumilho jouse kisih un, achuti loule Keiman kabotel ding nahiuve, chule koiman nakithopi loudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Ahinlah kilhaina thilto khel'a thangvahna eipe'a chun eichoisang tahbeh ahi. Kalamlhahna a naumjingleh Elohim Pathen mihuhhingna chu kamusah ding nahi”   
\c 51  
\s1 David In Achonsetna Aphondoh Chule Ngaidam Channa Dia Atao  
\s1 David lengpa Bethseba to ajon jou a Nathan themgaopa ahenga ahunga alabol  
\p
\v 1 O Pathen Elohim, na mingailutna longlou jeh'in na mi khotona chu neimusah in. Na mi hepina kidangtah jeh chun ka chonset nenbeh jouse neisuhbei peh in.   
\p
\v 2 Kathemmona ho jouse'a kon'in neisutheng in lang neisoptheng in, ka chonsetna a kon'in neisuthengsel in.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu ka phatlouna ka kihet'in sun le jan'in eijui jing'in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nangma douna mong'a chonse ka hi, Nangma mitmun thilse chu ka na bol tai. Na thusei in nadihna aphondoh ding ahi, chuleh ka chung'a nathutan jong adih'in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Ajeh chu ka nu oisung'a ka ki jil'a pat'a chonset pum'a kijil ka hin chonsesa hung peng a ka hi.   
\p
\v 6 Hinla nang'in ka nu oisung'a pat'in jong atheng a ka um ding nana ngaichat ahin hiche mun jeng'a jong chu chihna lungthim neina hilpat ahitai.   
\p
\v 7 Ka chonsetna a kon'in neisutheng lechun ka then ding ahitai, neisoptheng lechun buhbang sang'in theng tang'e.   
\p
\v 8 Oh! Ka kipana neipekit in, nang'in nei hesoh sah ahin tun neikipasah kit tan.   
\p
\v 9 Ka chonsetna ho neivet peh jing hih in, ka setna nenbeh ho sumang in.   
\p
\v 10 Lungthimthah neisem peh in O Yahweh Pakai. Kasunga um lhagao hi nei thah sempeh in.   
\p
\v 11 Na angsung'a kon'in neipaidoh hih'in, chuleh keija kon'in na Lhagao Theng chu lamang hih'in.   
\p
\v 12 Nei huhhing nikho'a ka kipana chu avel'in neipe kit in lang chuleh nathu'a nung jing mi neihisah in,   
\p
\v 13 Chuteng na thua nunglou ho jong nangma deilam'a ahung chonna di'uva ka hil ding chutengleh amaho nangma kom lang'a hung kile kit ding ahi'uve.   
\p
\v 14 O Pathen Elohim mi huhhingpu, keiman thisan kaso tahjeh in neingaidam'in chutileh neingaidamna chu kipah tah'a vahchoila a ka sah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 15 O Yahweh Pakai lungnachim'a nangma ka vahchoi theina ding'in ka lei neilhap peh'in.   
\p
\v 16 Nangman kilhaina thilpeh na ngaicha pon, pumgo thilto ding khat jong na ngaicha pon ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Nang in na ngaichat kilhaina chu-Lhagaova kisuh gep ahin, nang'in lung kisuchip pum'a kisihna neiho napaidoh poi o Yahweh Pakai.   
\p
\v 18 Zion hi lungsetna mitvet in venlang hin kithopin, Jerusalem pal hinsem phan.   
\p
\v 19 Chutengleh kilhaina lungtheng sel a kipe pumgo thilto hon lunglhai in natin chule pumgo thil to pum bongchal ho avel'in hung kikatdoh tante.   
\c 52  
\s1 Kiletsah Aphatchomna Umlou  
\s1 Edom mi Doeg in Saul jah a “David Ahimelech mite to akimuto e” tia asei jou David labol  
\p
\v 1 Galhang nangman idia na thilse bol ho kiletsahpi nahim? Elohim Pathen thutan dihje hi tonsotna aum jing helou nahim?   
\p
\v 2 Nilhum kei keijin nangman manthahna ding jeng na gong e. Na leigui in jong chem hemtah in mi a-at abang'in; jouthu sei in nangma nathem lheh e.   
\p
\v 3 Nang'in thilpha sang'in thilse na deijon, thutah sangin jong jou nadeijoi.   
\p
\v 4 Nathu jou hoa chun nangman mi suhmang ding nadei e!   
\p
\v 5 Hinlah Elohim Pathen'in nangma na hin suhmanghel ding ahi. Aman na in'a kon a nahin kaidoh ding chuleh mihing chenna gam'a kon'a na hin bodoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Mi chonpha hon hichu hin muvintin ahin datmo di'u ahi. Amahon hin nuisat intin aseidi'u ahi,   
\p
\v 7 “Veuvin Elohim Pathen tahsanlou galhat ho chung'a hi ipi thil soh'a hitam? Amaho ahao nao a akisong'un, athilse bol nao a akhangtou cheh cheh un ahi.”   
\p
\v 8 Hinlah, keima vang Elohim Pathen houin sung'a keh Olive thing hing hoitah tobang kahin, keiman phat tin'a Elohim Pathen mi ngailutna long lou chu katahsan jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 O Elohim Pathen na thilpha bol jeh hin nangma thangvah jing ingting na mithengte masang'a na min ngeitah chu tahsan jing tang'e.   
\c 53  
\s1 David In Mihem Chonsetna Thudol Ahilchet  
\s1 Lungthim kiphumlut na; David labol  
\p
\v 1 Mingol honbou alungsung uva kon'in “Elohim Pathen aumpoi” ati'uve. Amaho chu mi kitahlou ahi'uvin, thilphalou jeng bol ahi'uvin khatchan jong thilpha abol pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Elohim Pathen'in van'a kon'in mihemte jouse hi ahinven, Aman mikhattou aching tahbeh um am, khat touvin Elohim Pathen ahol am tin ahinven ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ahinlah khatcha amupon, abonchaovin akihei mangsoh hel ta'uvin, aboncha'uvin akitahlou ngen ahi'uvin, koimacha thilpha bol aumpouvin khatcha jong aumpoi.   
\p
\v 4 Hitobang'a thilphalou bol ho hin ahetdohlou hel di'u ham? Amaho hin kamite hi changlhah bang'a anehchai di'u ahitan Elohim Pathen kom'a tao ding jong agelpha pouve.   
\p
\v 5 Amaho hi, tu masang'a anahetphah louhel u tijatnan ahin lokhum ding ahi'uve. Elohim Pathen'in na galmite'u gu le chang ahin thejal ding, nang'in amaho hi na ahin suhjum ding ahi, ajeh chu Elohim Pathen'in amaho hi apaidoh ahi'uve.   
\p
\v 6 Zion mol'a kon'a Israelte huhdoh dia koi hung ding ham? Elohim Pathen in amite akiledohsah tengleh, Jacob in kipah a kho asap ding Israelte kipah ding ahi'uve.   
\c 54  
\s1 David In Elohim Pathen'a Kon Panpina Atahsan  
\s1 Ziphat ten Saul jah a “David hoi a kisel ham kei hon kahetaove” tia ahung sei jou uva David in tumging to thoa sah dia alabol.  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen thaneitah in hung'in lang neihuhdoh in! Na thahatnan nei veng'in.   
\p
\v 2 O Elohim Pathen ka taona ngaijin, ka thumna hi neihin gelkhoh peh'in,   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu gamdang mite'n eihin delkhum uvin, mi engse ten tha ding'in eihol'un ahi, amahon Elohim Pathen imachan agel pouve.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinlah kei ding'in Elohim Pathen hi eipanpi ahin, Yahweh Pakai hin eihinghoi ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Ka galmi ten thilse agon jouse'u hi amaho chunga le chuh hen! Na dei dan tah in achung uva na tong'in lang amaho khu subei in.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman naheng a kiphal tah in thilpeh hinchoi ing e; Keiman namin hinthang vah ing kate Yahweh Pakai, ajeh chu hichu apha ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai nang'in ka hesohna a kon'in neihuhdoh tan, ka galmite chung'a jong galjona neimusah tan ahi.   
\c 55  
\s1 David In Akinaipi Golle Pai'a Kon Gimna Ato  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga David in tumging to thoa sah dia asem la  
\p
\v 1 Vo Elohim Pathen ka taona neingaipeh in, panpi ngehna ka taona neigelkhoh peh'in!   
\p
\v 2 Lungset tah in ka taona neingaipeh in lang neihin donbut teijin, ajeh chu kagimnan eihin lonvuh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ka galmite'n eisamseu vin, eigihna'u hi akithong le'u jeng'in ahi. Aman boi na eilhunkhum sah un lunghang tah'in eihin delkhum taove.   
\p
\v 4 Ka lung aphul lap jeng'in thina gimneitah hin eihin nokhum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Tijatna le lunggimna'n eilonvuh tan kithing louvin ka umthei poi.   
\p
\v 6 Oh, vakhu bang'a lhaving nei hitave leng o keima lengdoh ingting ga kicholdo tang'e!   
\p
\v 7 Keima gamlatah in lengdoh ingting gamthip noi olnamun gabel tang'e.   
\p
\v 8 Hitobang kivetdatona huipi kinunglah a konhin gangtah in gamlatah a jammang tang'e.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai amaho hi kisuhmosah in lang athilse gon'u jong hi suhmopeh jeng tan, ajeh chu athilgon'u hin khopi sung'a thilse tamtah asodoh sah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Akulpi bang'u jong galmi'a kon'a hoidohna ding'a asun ajan a anga'u ahi, ahinla akhohpentah chu khopi sung'a chonsetna ho hi ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Thil jouse hi asegam'a ahitai, kailhang jeng'a jong kigihna le ki joubol na adimlha tan ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Ka dougal'in eitai tomna jong ahipoi hichu ka doujou thouve, kiletsah tah'a eijumso jing'a ka kidoupipa jong ahipoi, amaho a kon chun ka ki seldoh theinan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Amavang hiche ho chu hilouvin, ka kibahpi, ka kivoppi, ka golngai nangma chu na hi.   
\p
\v 14 Phat khatna chu ichan geija ina kingailut hitam Elohim Pathen houin jeng'a jong ina kijotlutji ahie!   
\p
\v 15 Ka dougalte hi thina'n lhunkhum hen, lhankhuh in ahing'in vallhum jeng'u hen, ajeh chu setna'n alungsung'u chen nan aneitan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ahinlah keiman Elohim ka Pathen ka kou ding chuleh Yahweh ka Pakai in eihuhdoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Jingkah, sun, nilhah in ka lung hesoh jeh'in ka kap'in ahileh Yahweh Pakai in ka-o eijahpeh tai.   
\p
\v 18 Mi tamtah in eidou jing hen lang, kei douna'n gal kisat chohjeju jeng jongleh Yahweh Pakai in eilhatdoh'in ol-heuvin eiumsah tai.   
\p
\v 19 Tonsot a vaihom jing Elohim Pathen chun ka taona sang intin ka dougalte asuhnem ding ahi. Ajeh chu amahon achondan'u akhelnom pouvin Elohim Pathen jong aging pouve;   
\p
\v 20 Keima kiloipipan vang, aloihi alhem lhan akitepna asukeh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Athu cheng chu thaotwi bang'in analjet in hinlah asung uvin gal lungthim apu'uve. Athu cheng'u thaotwi nang abang'in hinlah asunglang uvah chemjam ngen aum'e.   
\p
\v 22 Na pohgih chu Yahweh Pakai chung'a seplha tan Aman na ngai jangpeh nante. Aman mi chonpha ho chu akipalsah lou ding lhuh jong alhuhsah lou ding ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Nangvang O Elohim Pathen mi gilou ho chu lhuh na kokhuh a nasotlhah ding ahi. Tolthat ho le jonpan ho jong khangdong cha na thisah ding ahi, hinla keimanvang eihuhing din nang jeng katahsan e.   
\c 56  
\s1 David In Agalmite Akichat, Hinlah Elohim Pathen Tahsan'a Tao  
\s1 Philistine ten Gath mun a amudoh nung uva lalamkai pa henga David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen, na mi khotonan neipui jing'in, ajeh chu mipite'n eidel jing'uvin eidouhon nilhumkei kei'in eidelkhum jing'un ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Eihousehon jong phattin in eidel jing'un chuleh mitamtah'in eidelkhum jing'un ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ahinlah ka kichat teng nangma tahsanna a chun ka lut ji tan ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Aman kahenga kitepna anei jeh'in Yahweh Pakai chu ka thangvah e. Elohim Pathen tahsana a ka dindet jingle kei ipi ding'a ka kichat ding ham? Hi chi mihem chun i eilo thei ding ham?   
\p
\v 5 Amahon ka thusei jouse ahilou lam in alao vin; kei suhsetna ding'in anikho ho'u jong amang jing ui.   
\p
\v 6 Amaho ahung'un eihung velhi'uvin, keima eithatheina diuvin ka chaloh ka sinsah avelhi jing'un ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Achonset pum'un jammang sah hihbeh in; na lungsah na achun O Yahweh Pakai amaho chu sumang jeng'in.   
\p
\v 8 Nang'in ka thoh gimna neihetpeh jingnan ahi, nang'in ka lengvaina mitlhi hi khon a nakhol khom in, chuleh abonchan na lekhabu'a najihlut e.   
\p
\v 9 Keiman nangma eikithopi ding'a ka kou tengleh ka galmite jammang taovin te. Hijeh'a chu keiman Elohim Pathen hi keima lang'a pang ahi ti ka het jingna ahi!   
\p
\v 10 Elohim Pathen'in kakoma kitep na anei jeh in keiman Elohim Pathen ka thangvah e; henge, Elohim Pathen in kahenga kitepna anei jeh in Yahweh Pakai ka thangvah ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Keiman Elohim Pathen ka tahsan na ahi ka din jingle ipi ding'a ka kichat ding ham? Mihem mai hon i eilo di'u ham?   
\p
\v 12 O Elohim Pathen nang kom'a ka kitepna keiman subulhit ingting chutengleh kilhaina in thangvah na peng ka te.   
\p
\v 13 Ajeh chu nang'in ka thina ding'a kon'in neihuhdoh tan kakiselhuh louna din nang in ka keng neituh peh tai. Hijeh chun O Elohim Pathen tun na angsunga hinna vah napeh na mun a chun hung lut thei tange.   
\c 57  
\s1 Suhgim'a Aumlaiya Huhdohna Dia Elohim Pathen Henga David Atao  
\s1 Saul a kon a ajam mang a songko a akisel na chunga a David labol  
\p
\v 1 Neilungset in O Elohim Pathen, nei khoton! Neivenbit jingna ding'in nang malam ka hin sang'e. Hahsatna ho abeito kahsen na lhaving lim noi a ka kisel jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Ka chung'a athilgon eisuhbulhing pehna ding'in Elohim Pathen hat chungnung chu ka kouve.   
\p
\v 3 Aman eihuhdoh ding chuleh eidel lele ho jumsahna ding'a van'a kon'a panpina eihinpeh ding ahi. Elohim ka Pathen'in angailutna longlou leh akitahna a chu eihung vil ding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Keipi bahkai hangtah hon mihem te a anchah dia achanlhih le banin galmite'n eiumkimvel'uvin, aha uhin tengcha leh thalchang bangin asunvangthei in, alei'u jong chemjam hemset tobang in asat tan thei uve.   
\p
\v 5 O Elohim Pathen nangma hi vanmun jouse chungvum sang'in hung kichoisang'in! Na loupina hin leiset chung mun jouse hi salvah hen!   
\p
\v 6 Ka galmite'n thang eikampeh uvin, keima lung gim leh lunglengvai in kaum'e. Amahon ka lampi'a kotong thuhtah alai un ahinlah amaho ma alhalut jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 O Elohim Pathen nang a lungmon na kanei e; nang a kalung among e. Nangma thangvah la ka sahthei hi thil kidang ahipoi.   
\p
\v 8 Thou in kalung! Thou in, o Semjang le tumging! Ka vahchoila'n jingninou hi thoudoh ing e.   
\p
\v 9 O Yahweh Pakai mipi ho jouse lah'a na thangvah ing'e. Namtin vaipi jouse lah'a nangma na thangvah ing kate.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu na mingailutna longlou hi vanho bang'in asang e. Na kitahna in meilomlah apha'n ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hung kichoi sang in O Elohim Pathen, van mun sangpen ho sang'in na min hi dopsang'in umjo hen. Na loupina in leiset chung pumpi hi salvah hen.   
\c 58  
\s1 Migiloute Chungthu Tanna Dia David Taona  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga David labol  
\p
\v 1 Vaihom ho nanghon thutah kiti hi ipi kisei na ahi nahet u hinam? Nang hon thu adih'a natan'u hinam?   
\p
\v 2 Ahipoi! Nang ho'n na lungsung un thudihlou na gong'un gamsung a hunam a natohna ngen na chelheh sah un ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Miphalou ho hi chonsesa peng'a ahiuvin, ahung pen'uva pat'in jou apan'un ama deidan cheh'in achon'un ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Ama hon gul bangin gu hat tah alhao vin; gulsoh bang in thuhil angainom pouve.   
\p
\v 5 Gul lam sahhon atheile'u ichan geija amut ngeisel vang un akihetmosah un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 O Elohim Pathen a-ha uhi suhbong jeng'in, O Yahweh Pakai hiche keipi bahkai ho hi a-ha'u suhgoi peh jeng'in.   
\p
\v 7 Tolgo'a twi isunlhah a agotloiji bang'in mangthah loi jeng'u hen. Akhut uva achoi u agal manchah'u chu manmo sosah jeng'in.   
\p
\v 8 Dahdeng amacham'a ajunlhah ji bang'in junlhahsah'in, naosen athisa hung peng nisa mumanlou bah sah in.   
\p
\v 9 Hampa kisatlha bang in ateh akhang Elohim Pathen in lhamlha jeng uhen, leibel meikou lah a ling le khao kigouvam sang a gang jo jeng u hen.   
\p
\v 10 Thildih lou ho akilethuh teng mi chonpha ho kipah di'u ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Chuteng achaina le mijousen asei diu ahi, “Elohim Pathen a dia hing ho dihtheina chu kipa thilpeh ahin; leiset a jong thudih a thutan Elohim Pathen aum mong e.”   
\c 59  
\s1 Galmitea Kon Huhdohna Dinga David Taona  
\s1 Saul in David thana dia a inn a asepai ho asol na chunga David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen, ka galmite a kon'in neihuhdoh in, keima eisumang ding'a hungho a kon'in neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 2 Mi sugentheiho a kon'in neihuhdoh in lang tolthat ho'a kon'in neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 3 Amahon eichanglhiuvin, Yahweh Pakai melma engsetahte hon eingah un ahi, keiman amaho dounan imacha thilse ka bol poi.   
\p
\v 4 Keiman imacha thilse kabol pon hinla keima eidelkhum ding'in akigo jing'un ahi. Hung thoudoh in thilsohho hi hung ven lang neikithopi'n!   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai, Elohim Pathen hatchungnung Israelte Pathen Elohim, ei hung thoudoh in lang mi phalou namtin vaipiho hi gimbolna hung petan kitahna neilou mi phaloute chung'a hin khotona neihihbeh in.   
\p
\v 6 Amaho janteng leh ahungdoh jiuvin, uingol hon mi angih bang'in lamlen'a akijot'un apeng le jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Akamsunguva thu thanghoi hung potdoh khu ngai in chemjam a kisat bang'a ngaithada umtah ahi. Hitobang'a ngai thaset umtah hi kon angai ngam ding ham?   
\p
\v 8 Ahinla Yahweh Pakai nang'in amaho chu na nuisat'in, mi phalou namtin vaipiho chu na hohdal'in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Nang hi kahatna nahi; eihuhdoh din nang kangah jing e, ajeh chu nang hi ka ki venbitna kulpi nahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ka Pathen Elohim in, ami ngailut na longlou achu eidinpi ding ahi. Aman ka melmate jouse chung'a agaljona a eimusah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 11 O Elohim Pathen amaho chu thatgam jeng hih'in ajole ka mite'n kihil na aman u hi sumil loi get'unte; eipanpi o Yahweh Pakai amaho khu thethang'in lang akhuboh uva dilsuh sah jeng tan.   
\p
\v 12 Akam'uva chonset thu ngen aseidoh jeh uleh, alei uva thilse ngen aseidoh jeh'un, akiletsahna'u, ahansetna'u chuleh ajouseina'u vin manchah jeng uhen.   
\p
\v 13 Na lunghan nan amaho chu sumang'in lang abonchauvin sumang jeng'in! chutengleh vannoi leiset pumpin Israel chung'a vaihom Elohim Pathen na hi chu ahetdi'u ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Ka melmate jan leh hungdoh'un tin uichangol hon mi angih bang'in akisen le leuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Amaho neh ding an holna'n avahle leuvin oivana kham amulou jeh'un gilkel pum'in alum jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Hinla keiman vang na thaneina chu vahchoila'n sangnge. Na mi ngailutna longlou chu jingkha she leh kipah tah'in vahchoila'n sangnge. Ajeh chu nangma ka kulpi, ka hahsat teng leh ka kiselna na hi.   
\p
\v 17 O ka hatna Yahweh Pakai, nangma thangvahna'n la'n sangnge, O Elohim Pathen nangma ka kiselna na hin, na mi ngailutna longlou chu neimusah jing'e.   
\c 60  
\s1 Israel Huhdoh'a Aumna Dia David Taona  
\s1 David in Aram-naharaim le Aram Zobah akisat pi a Jaob ahung kile a chiputna phaicham a Edom mite mi 12,000 atha jou a, Kihil nathei tah dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen nang'in keiho hi neipaidoh tauvin ka kiselna'u jouse jong neisuh chimpeh tauve, nangma keiho chung'a analunghang jong leh chun na lungsetna neimusah tauvin.   
\p
\v 2 Ka gamsung'u na hotling in chuleh na pokehsah ji'n ahi, tun vang akehlai mehbit tan, ajeh chu gamleiset akithing'in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Keiho hasatnatah nahin pen, jukham a lon lele ho nei sodoh jeng u ve.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinla nang'in nangma ginna neiho ding'in ponlap khat neina dopsang peh'un, hichu min eihin nokhum teng'uleh eikipunkhom sah'in anapang'in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Tun na ngailut na mite hi huhdoh tan, ka taona ngai in lang na ban thahat'in neihuhdoh tauvin.   
\p
\v 6 Aloupi na in Elohim Pathen in, “keima kichoisangna a hiche kitep nahi ahin sem tai. Shechem hi kipa na a kakehso ding ahi. Sukkoth phaicham hi ka mite ka hoppeh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Gilead hi keija ahin, chuleh Manasseh jong ahi. Ephraim ka thih lukhuh hin galhat miho ahinsep doh ding, chue Juda ka leng tenggol hin leng tamtah hinsepdoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ahin Moab vang hi ka kisilna kong ahin ka sohna ahin toh ding ahi chuleh Edom a hi ka kengto kathehngim ding chutengleh Philistia chung a ka galjona ka hin sapdoh ding ahi.”   
\p
\v 9 Koi pen'in kul kigetkhum khoipi'a hi eipuilut ding ham? Koi pen in Edom chung'a hi galjona eihin pohlut peh ding ham?   
\p
\v 10 O Elohim Pathen nang'in neipaidoh'u hitam? Nang'in ka sepaite toh galsatna a neihung lhonpi lou ding hitam?   
\p
\v 11 O lungset tah in ka galmiteuva konin neipanpin, ajeh chu mihem panpina hi aphachom aumpoi.   
\p
\v 12 Elohim Pathen panpina jal'a hi thil loupi tah tah tohdoh'a um ding ahi, ajeh chu Aman imelmate'u achotpha ding ahi.   
\c 61  
\s1 Elohim Pathen In Eihong Jinge Tia David Kinepna  
\s1 Semjang to thoa sah dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen ka kana neingaipeh in! Ka taona hi ngai in!   
\p
\v 2 Lungsung lunghemnan eilonkhum teng leiset kol kimvel a kon'in panpi ngaichan ka hin kou e. Hoidoh na songpi sang chung'ah neipuitou in,   
\p
\v 3 ajeh chu nangma hi ka kiselna mun olna pen chu na hi, ka melmate'n ahin phahjoulouna kulpi chu nangma na hi.   
\p
\v 4 Na mun theng'a tonsot'in neichensah in hilai chu na lha limnoi kiselna chu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 O Elohim Pathen ka kitepna chu nei jahpehtai, nangma gingte chan dia na gonpeh na goulona mun chu neipeh ahitai.   
\p
\v 6 Lengpa hinkho hi kum tamtah pehben! Khangkit geiin jong hinghoi in!   
\p
\v 7 Elohim Pathen hoidam na achun vai hom jing hen. Na mi ngailutna longlou le na kitahna chun kaihoi jing hen.   
\p
\v 8 Hiteng chuleh nitina ka kitepna suh bulhit ingkating tonsot'in na min thangvah jing tang e.   
\c 62  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Bou Kiselna Detpen Ahi  
\s1 Jeduthun lalamkaipa henga David labol  
\p
\v 1 Elohim Pathen ang a thipbeh chan ka ngah e, ajeh chu Ama a kon a ka galjona hung kipan ji ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Ama bou hi kasongpi le kakihuhhing na ahin, longlou hel a kaum thei kakingai na kulpi ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Mi khatseh douding melma tamtah ahiuvin-abon'un keima eithat gouve. Amaho ding hin keima hi bang chimsa le tho kigen achimsa tobang ka hi bouve.   
\p
\v 4 Amahon munsang a kon a sotlhah di eigouve. Ka chung chang a jouthu sei athanom un ahi. Amahon kamasanga eipahchao vin alungsung uvah eigaosap un ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Keiman ka hina jouse pum in Elohim Pathen angsung a thipbehchan ka ngah e, ajeh chu ama a hin ka kinepna aumjing e.   
\p
\v 6 Ama bou hi ka sochatna leh ka kulpi chuleh ka songpi ahin keima sotlinghoi ka hi tahlou ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 7 Ka galjona leh ka minphatna Elohim Pathen a kon jeng bou ahi. Ama hi ka kiselna le ka songpi ahin, ka melma hon eihin maiphah lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 O ka mite phat tinin Ama bou tahsan jingin na lungthim a na pohgih ama chuga sung lhan, ajeh chu Ama hi ikiselna u ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Milham ho hi hainahu khat hui bap a phachom lou ahibou uve, chule mithahat ho jong alim u va amelsou toh akibang deh pouve. Amahokhu lepton lang vele chun hainahu khat sanga jong jangjo ahibou uve.   
\p
\v 10 Nang in na inchen na hinkho hi hunam a lah le guhchat in kivah hih in. Na nei na gou ahung punbe a ahijongleh hiche a chun kisong hih in.   
\p
\v 11 Elohim Pathen in ol heuvin thu asei in hichu keiman phat tin in ka na jajin ahi. O Elohim Pathen thaneina jouse hi nang a ahi.   
\p
\v 12 O Yahweh Pakai ngailutna longlou hi nang a ahi, tahbeh in nang in mijouse hi atoh dungjui cheh a na lethuh ahi.   
\c 63  
\s1 David Lhagaova Dangchah, Elohim Pathen In Adang Anousah  
\s1 Judah a kon a vahlon lea aum chung David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen nang bou ka Pathen na hi; ken lungil tah in nang kahol e. Kalhagao in nadangchah in; twi veilouna mun gotna gamgo ahin ka tahsa pumpin nang ka hin lhangai e.   
\p
\v 2 Na mun theng'a kon'in ka hin mun na loupina leh na thaneina chu ka hin mun ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Na mi ngailutna longlou chu mihem hinkhoma ma sang a phajo ahi; nang ka hin thangvah chim theipoi.   
\p
\v 4 Hinkho ka nei laisen nangma thangvah ing kating, nahenga taonan ka khut teni hin domsang ing kate.   
\p
\v 5 An twipen ka neh sang'in nang'in neihin lunglhaisah jon. Kipah tah in nangma thangvahnan la sangnge.   
\p
\v 6 Kalupna mun a limgeh chan nang kagel gel jin, janteng jongle nangma lungel ho kangaito ji e.   
\p
\v 7 Nangma eikithopi nahijeh in, na lhaving lim noi ah kipah tah in vahchoila ka san ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Na ban thahat tah jet lang in det tah in neituh in ahileh keiman nang ka tuhchah in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Keima eisumang goho chu hung mangthah diu ahi. Amaho chu leikotong athuhlai pena chu lhalut ding ahiuve.   
\p
\v 10 Amaho chu chemjam a thidiu sial ho anchah a pang diu ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinla lengpa chu Elohim Pathen a kipah ding ahi. Koi hileh Ama tahsan chan chun athangvah ding, mijouho vang suhthip a umdiu ahi.   
\c 64  
\s1 Hetthei Louva Kiselguh Melmatea Kon Hoidohna Dinga David Taona  
\s1 Lalamkaipa heng a David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen, ka kiphinna hi neingaipeh tei in. Ka melmaten eigihnauva kon hin neihuh doh in.   
\p
\v 2 Hiche engset lungput a tohgon nei mipiho a kon'in neiselmang in, hiche thilse bol hon hoa kon in.   
\p
\v 3 Amahon chemjam kinolhem bang'in alei'u anolhem'un thalchang kikap doh bang'in thucheng ngaimo tah tah in mi adoi leleu ve.   
\p
\v 4 Themmona neilou miho chu akiselnauva kon in ahin kap un kichatna neilouvin gangtah in anokhum jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Thilse bol ding in amaho le amaho akitilkhou un chujongle aguh a iti thang kam ding ham, tichu agong'un ahi. “Hiche hi kon amudoh ding ham?” atiuve.   
\p
\v 6 Athilse gonpat'u chun hitin aseijun, “Hiche hi thilgon hoipen ahitai!” atiuve. Henge mihem lunggel le lungthim vang hi aphalou mong ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Ahinla Elohim Pathen amatah'in athalchang ahin kap ding gangtah a akaplhuh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Amaho tah kampao in ahin thagam diu ahi, koi hileh amaho muchan chun alunghan khum uva alu ahihdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Chujouteng mijouse kicha diu, Elohim Pathen thil boltheina kidangtah chu aphondoh diu, chuleh athilbol datmo umtahho chu ahin hetchen diu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Mi chonphaho Yahweh Pakai a kipah thanom diu chuleh Ama chu kiselna ahin neidiu ahi. Koi hileh thilpha bolho jousen Elohim Pathen ahin vahchoidiu ahi.   
\c 65  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Hongphalna Jeh'a David In Avahchoi  
\s1 Lalamkai henga dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen, vahchoina thupitah chu Zion'a um nang'a dinga ahi. Keihon nang kom a ka kitepnau chu ka molso diu ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Ajeh chu nang'in ka taona'u na sang'in, ka bonchauva nang kom'a ka hung di'u ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ka chonsetnauvin eilonvuh jong le'u nang'in abonchan na ngaidam sohkei tan ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai, na muntheng a um nangkom naiding go ho iti akipa tadiuvem. Na houintheng sung a chu itobang kipana golnop in eingau hitam!   
\p
\v 5 Kataona hou natoh hoitah in neidonbut peh uve, O Elohim Pathen eihuhingpau. Nangma hi leiset mite jouse kinepna nahin, gamlatah twikhanglen chung'a kongtolho geiyin nang chung a kinepna anei u ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Thahatna thupitah a na kivon a, na thahatna a mol le lhang jong hi na sem ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Twikhanglen kinong le kitum jong hi nasuthip in chuleh namtin vaipi kithong lellul jong na suthip tan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Leiset chung kolmong gei a chenghon jong na kidanna hi adatmovin ahi. Nisa sona langa pat nilhum na mun geiya umho jong kipah a asaple diuva na tildoh ahitai.   
\p
\v 9 Leiset hi na gelkhoh in gon nachapnou in, leithao leh leipha na sodoh sah in ahi. Elohim Pathen vadung a chun twi nengchet in aum in; hichun louga chang le mim aput sah e, ajeh chu hiti dinga nangman natep sah ahitai.   
\p
\v 10 Lou kikhoiho gotwi in na chap kot jin, leilhangho na su nang in, changkongho jong na kibah sah in, gotwi in leiset na noudoh sah in hiti chun chang le mim nengchet a aumnadin phatthei na boh in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Kumlhung keiya neh le chah ding nengchet in na gongtoh in leitah lah jeng jong leiphatah na so sah tai.   
\p
\v 12 Gam golai gammang jeng jong hamhing dongset lah a sohdoh in, molpang jeng jong kipah tah in apahlha jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hamhing lah a kelngoihon adimset un chule phaichamho jong chang le mim adimlha jeng tai. Hi hojousen thong jejun asam un kipa la asaove.   
\c 66  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Natoh Thilbol Kidang Ho  
\p
\v 1 Leiset mite jousen Elohim Pathen vahchoi cheh uhen!   
\p
\v 2 Amin loupi chu vahchoilan saohen! Aloupina ji vannoi a sei leu vin.   
\p
\v 3 Elohim Pathen henga sei in, “Na thilbol ho hi iti hoia lamdang hitam! Na melmate jeng jong na thaneina thupitah masang a akun jeng uve.   
\p
\v 4 Leiset chung thil jouse jong na angsung a dilsu cheh untin, nathangvahna la asahdiu, naming hi thongjenju a asahdiu ahi.”   
\p
\v 5 Hung in lang ven Elohim Pathen in ipi atohdoh hitam, mipite dia itobang thil kidang atohdoh hitam!   
\p
\v 6 Aman twipisan a jong lamgolai asem in, chule amite chu akeng'uva ache galkai ui. Hea chun eiho Ama ah ikipah un ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu Aman athahatna thupitah a chun tonsot in vai ahom e. Aman namtin vaipi chaloh sinsah aboncha ave lhisohkei in; koimacha Ama dounan hung kon da jeng hen.   
\p
\v 8 Vannoi leiset mihemte jousen iPathen u Elohim thangvah cheh u henlang avahchoina la choh jejun sauhen.   
\p
\v 9 I hinkhou hi Ama khut a um ahin, Aman ikipallouna diuva ikeng u eituhpeh u ahi.   
\p
\v 10 O Elohim Pathen neipatep tauve; dangka bang in neisuhtheng taovin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Na thangkol a neimat u ahitan chuleh ka tungtun uva sohchanna pohgih chu neipoh sah u ahitai.   
\p
\v 12 Ka chunguvah midangho lam na jotsah in hiti chun keiho meilhum leh twisohlah neipal galkaisah uvin, hinla nehding nenna mun a neipuilut tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Tun nahenga kakitepna subulhit din pumgo thilto pum in na houin ka hinjon e.   
\p
\v 14 Henge, lunggim le kakhoisat nikho hoa nakoma kitepna ka na nei chu ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hijeh a chu keiman kanei ho lah ka kelngoichalho hi namtwi pen ding le, ka bongchalho le ka keltahchalho hi pumgo thilto a ka hin katdoh ahitai.   
\p
\v 16 Elohim Pathen gin le jana neijouse hung un lang ngai un, Yahweh Pakai in ipi eibolpeh am na seipeh ung ka te.   
\p
\v 17 Ajeh chu keiman Ama thangvah pum in panpi thumnan ka tao in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Keiman ka lunsunga um ka chonset phongdoh lou hile Yahweh Pakai in ka taona eingaipeh louding ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hinla Elohim Pathen in eingaipeh e! Aman khohsah tah in ka taona eingaipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Ka taona eigelkhohpehjeh le amingailutna longlou kei a kon a eilahdohpeh lou jeh in Elohim Pathen chu thangvah in um hen!   
\c 67  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Choi'an Dia Mihemte Tilkhouna  
\p
\v 1 Elohim Pathen lungsetthem hihen lang phatthei eiboh u hen. Amaivah chun eisalvah u hen.   
\p
\v 2 Leiset pumpi a nadeilam kilang hen, muntin a mihemten na mihuhhingna thahat chu heuhen!   
\p
\v 3 O Elohim Pathen namtin vaipin na thangvah u hen. Henge, namtin vaipin na thangvah u hen.   
\p
\v 4 Vannoi leiset pumpin nangma thangvah la sauhen, ajeh chu namtin vaipi chung a hi thudih a vai hom nahin vannoi leiset pumpi hi na puihoi hoi le jinge.   
\p
\v 5 Namtin vaipin na thangvah u hen O Elohim Pathen. Henge, namtin vaipin thangvah u hen!   
\p
\v 6 Hiteng chuleh leiset in chang le mim gasosah intin chuleh Elohim Pathen, iPathen'un nengchet a phatthei eibohdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Henge, Elohim Pathen in phatthei eiboh un tin, chule vannoi leiset mihemte jousen Ama chu agindiu ahi.   
\c 68  
\s1 Bitna Le Thil Jouse Pepa Elohim Pathen, David In Jana Apeh  
\s1 Lalamkai pa heng David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen hung kipat inlang namelmate hi thethang jeng in, Elohim Pathen doumah bolte jouse akihuhdohna diuvin jam uhen.   
\p
\v 2 Amaho khu meikhu bang in mut mang in, meisalah a khoilu ajollhah bang in jollhahsah in, Elohim Pathen ansung a kon in migiloute mangthah jeng uhen.   
\p
\v 3 Hinla miphaho chu kipah u hen. Amaho chu Elohim Pathen angsung'ah kipah u hen. Kipa thanopnan dimset u hen.   
\p
\v 4 Elohim Pathen le amin thang vah la saovin! Meibanglom puile pa thangvahla chohthet in sauvin. Amin chu Yahweh Pakai kiti ahi–a angsung a kipah un.   
\p
\v 5 Pa neilou te dia Pa nahin, meithaiho hoidam jing nahi-hiche hi Elohim Pathen ahin aumna chu muntheng ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Elohim Pathen in changkhatpu hinkho chu insungmi lhingtah in akoi in; Songkul a tangho chamlhat na apen akipa sah tai. Ahinlah thuanunglou ho chu nisan akahgepna neldigama achensah e.   
\p
\v 7 O Yahweh Pakai na mite Egypt gama kon a na hin puidoh a chun, gamgo lah'a na hin puigalkai chun,   
\p
\v 8 Israel Pathen Elohim, Sinai Pathen Elohim nangma masang'ah leiset akithing in vanhon go ahin juhlhahsah in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 O Elohim Pathen nang man leigo chapnousah din go nengchet in neihin peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Akhon nan hichea chun na mite na chensah in, neh le chah nengchetnin na pen, na mite ngaichat jouse jong na pe tai.   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai in thu chengkhat agahseileh mitamtah in hiche kipana thu chu apoleuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Melmate lengho le asepaite ajamgam tauvin Israel numeiten athilkeo u achomgam peh taove.   
\p
\v 13 Kelngoi hong a chengho jeng in jong nei le gou tamtah-alhaving teni dangka le amul sana a kisem vapal akimu uvin.   
\p
\v 14 Hatchungnung chun Zalmon molchung'a buhbang kithejal bang'in melma lengho chu athejal gamtan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Bashan a molho hi athupi thei lheh jeng uve, mol monghem tamtah'in vanthamjol a kilhungdoh jenge.   
\p
\v 16 O molsang gumtahho ibolba thangthip tah a navet uham, Zion molsang Elohim Pathen in alhen na mun, tonsot a achen nading chu?   
\p
\v 17 Sakol-kangtalai simjoulou hon akolkhum Sinai mol a kon a hung'a amuntheng a lut ding ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Nangma achung sang a na kaltou tengleh galhing a kiman tamtah na puitou ding, mipiho'a kon'a kipaman tamtah na san ding, nangma na douho a kon'a jong na san ding ahi. Hiche'a chu Yahweh Pakai eiho lah a cheng ding ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah in umhen; eihuh hingpau Elohim Pathen chu thangvah in umhen! Niseh a aman abanjang a eikai u ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Eiho Pathen hi mihuhhing Elohim Pathen ahi. Yahweh Pakai lengchungnung hin thina a kon a eihuhdoh u ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Elohim Pathen in amelmate luchangho asuhchip ding ahi, thilse jeng bolna a kipeho chu alugu u asuhchip ding ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Yahweh Pakai in asei e, “Bashan a kon'a ka melmate ka hinpui lhah ding ahi; twikhanglen lailung a kon'a ka hin puidoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Ka mite, nanghon athisan uva chu na keng u na kisoptheng diu, chuleh na uichahou jengin jong chan aneidiu ahi.”   
\p
\v 24 O Elohim Pathen gal nahin jaova na hung kijot u chu muthei in ahung kilangdoh tai, Elohim ka Pathen le ka lengpa muntheng a na kijotlut u chu.   
\p
\v 25 La saho amasang a aum un, tumging saiho a nung a aum ui; alai lunga chun nungah hon vohging theiho avouve.   
\p
\v 26 Israel mipite Elohim Pathen thangvah un; Israel hinkho hungkondoh naho Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah un.   
\p
\v 27 Ven phung neocha Benjamin in ahin lamkai e. aban'ah Judah a kon a vaihomho, chule Zebulun le Naphtali a kon in vaihom tamtah ahung uve.   
\p
\v 28 O Elohim Pathen, na ban thahat chu jedoh in. Achesa nikho ho bang chun na ban thahat chu nahat na hung kilangdoh hen.   
\p
\v 29 Jerusalem a na houintheng ah leiset lenghon na hunglutna u thilho ahinchoijuve.   
\p
\v 30 Na melma namtin vaipiho, pang lah'a kisel gamsaho, ahatmo bongnouho lah a bongchalho hi phohsal in. Kisunem tah a ahunglutnau thil in sumlhonho hinchoisah in. Galbol'a thanom namtin vaipiho thethang in.   
\p
\v 31 Egypt a kon'in kipa thilpeh ding'in thil mantamho hinchoi u hen, Ethiopia mite Elohim Pathen a akipehlutna uvin bohkhup uhen!   
\p
\v 32 Leiset gam lengho'n Yahweh Pakai, Elohim Pathen kom'ah vahchoila sauhen.   
\p
\v 33 Vanlaijol'a kon'a ogin hat tah hung kithongdoh a, masanglai vanho lah a ki tollepa vahchoila'n la sauvin.   
\p
\v 34 Elohim Pathen thuneina hi mijouse hetsah un, aloupina chun Israelte ahinsalvah in athahatna hi vanho chung'ah akilang jing'e.   
\p
\v 35 Elohim Pathen hi amuntheng'ah gimneitah in aumjing'e. Israel Pathen Elohim'in amite chu thuneina le thahatna ape'n ahi. Elohim Pathen chu thangvah in umhen!   
\c 69  
\s1 Gammitea Kon Kihuhdoh Ding David In Angaichat  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga dia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Eihuhdoh in, O Elohim Pathen, twisoh hin ka ngong gei achuptai.   
\p
\v 2 Bonlhoh lah a hin ka lhalut cheh cheh tai; pansatna ding ka mujou tapoi. Keima twithuh lah a ka lhalut tan twisoh hin eichup tai.   
\p
\v 3 Panpi ngai a kaka na katha achollha tai; ka lolhomsung jong agolha tai. Ka ka kanan ka mit jong apomtan, Elohim Pathen in eipan pi ding kangah e.   
\p
\v 4 Ajehbei hel a eivetdaho hi ka lujang a ka samjang sang'in atamjouve. Ka melmate hin jou thu jeng a suhmang ding eigouvin, hitihin ka guh louhel thil chu kanung peh din athum uve.   
\p
\v 5 O Elohim Pathen ichangei a ngol kahi nahenai; Ka chonsetnaho hi nang'a kon'in akiselmang theipoi.   
\p
\v 6 Keijeh in, nangma tahsan ho chu jumsah hih beh in, O van a lengchungnung Yahweh Pakai, kei jeh in nang ma houmi tehi kisuh jum na nei hisah hihbeh in, O Israel Pathen Elohim.   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu nangma jal a housetna ka thoh ahi; jumna le jachatna kamai a adimset tai.   
\p
\v 8 Ka sopiho tah jeng'in jong eikihetmosah tauvin gamchommi bangin eibol tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Na houin a ding a ka tompan jeh in eichaideh tan ahi, nangman na housetnau jouse chu ka chunga achu tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Kappum a an kangol a chun, noisetah in eihou un ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ka genthei phondohna a khaodippon ka kisil'a ahileh einuisat un ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Keima hi khopi sung a jalhang a kihoulim nopna bep ka hitan jukhamhon kei chungchang thu totnopnan anei tauve.   
\p
\v 13 Hinla Yahweh Pakai naheng a katao jingin, tuchung beh neihin khoto ding kakinem e. O Yahweh Pakai na mingailut longlou chun katao nahi huhing na tahbeh a chun nei donbut in.   
\p
\v 14 Bonlhoh lah a kon hin neihuhdoh in; athuh jep a neilhahlutsah hihbeh in, eivetdaho lah a kon'in neihuhdoh in lang hiche twithuh lah'a kon hin neikaidoh in.   
\p
\v 15 Twisohhat lai neichupsah hih in, ahilouleh twithuh gillai jong nei vallhum sah hih in, ahilouleh thina lhan kotong jong nei nehmang sah hih in.   
\p
\v 16 O Yahweh Pakai ka taona neingaipeh in, ajeh chu na mingailutna longlou hi kidangtah ahin, neikaihoi jing in, ajeh chu na mikhotona hi lolhingtah ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Na sohpa a kon hin kisel mang hih in; gangtah in neidonbut in ajeh chu keiman boina nasatah ka toh tai.   
\p
\v 18 Hung'in lang neihung lhatdoh tan; ka melmat a kon'in neilha-ong tan.   
\p
\v 19 Nang'in eiki houset na eikijum bolna le ei kijachat sah naho jouse na hesohkei in ahi. Ka melmaten abol jouseu na hesohkei e.   
\p
\v 20 Ami taitomnauvin ka lungthim asukeh in, kadailheh jeng tai. Mikhat seh hijong le lungset na eimusah um hen lang; Khattou hung kiheihen lang eihin lungmonsah le kanom e.   
\p
\v 21 Ahinla chutimalah in amahon ka nehdin gu eipeuvin amahon ka don ding'in juthuh eipeuve.   
\p
\v 22 Amasang uva neh-le-chah dimset dokhang chu akipal nao soh henlang, ahaonau chu amaho ding'in thangkol hisah jeng tan.   
\p
\v 23 Kho amutheilouna diuvin amit u chojeng henlang atahsao kithing thing in umsah jeng in.   
\p
\v 24 Na lunghanna chu achung uvah sunglha jeng'in; na lunghanna meikong achun amaho chu kavam jeng in.   
\p
\v 25 A-in'u chu ahomkeo soh doh jeng henlang aponbuh u jong kihoh doh jeng hen.   
\p
\v 26 Gotna napeh mi chun, akisuhkhah na chung uva jumbol na akoibe uve; akisukha ho chu natna abelap peh uve.   
\p
\v 27 Achonsetnau setvum peh unlang, khatcha ongthol'in lha hihbeh in.   
\p
\v 28 Amin u chu hinna lekhabu a konin thaimangpeh in; michonpha ho lah a kisimtha sah hihbeh un.   
\p
\v 29 Keima natna thohgim in ka um e, O Elohim Pathen, na mihuhhingna thahat chun neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 30 Hiteng chuleh keiman na min pachatna la'n sangting chule thangvahna pum'a jana ka peh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Ajeh chu hichun kilhaina bongchal ki katdoh sang'a Yahweh Pakai chu alunglhaisah ding ahin, bongchal thaotah le akeng tin hoitah thilpeh kipe sang in jong aphajoi.   
\p
\v 32 Mi kineosah ten a Elohim Pathen'u natoh muo vintin kipahdiu ahi. Apanpi dia Elohim Pathen holte jousen kitilkhouna neicheh uhen.   
\p
\v 33 Ajeh chu Paka in ngaichageova umte taona angai in; Aman sohchang'a umho donlouvin akoi jipoi.   
\p
\v 34 O van-le-lei in Elohim Pathen vahchoi u henlang twikhanglen le asung a cheng jousen jong vahchoi u hen.   
\p
\v 35 Ajeh chu Elohim Pathen in Jerusalem ahuhdoh ding Judah khopiho asemphat ding ahi. Hiche'a chun amite cheng untin gamsung chu alodiu ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Ama thu nitjing chaten gamsung chu louvin tin, chule ama ngailuho jouse hiche mun a chu lungmong a cheng diu ahi.   
\c 70  
\s1 Huhhingna Dia David Atao  
\s1 Elohim Pathen in agel doh jing nadia David labol  
\p
\v 1 Elohim Pathen lungsettah in neihuhdoh in! Yahweh Pakai, gangtah in hung in lang neihung kithopin.   
\p
\v 2 Tha dia eiholten jumna toh uhenlang jachatsah in. Ka gentheipet a kipahho jachat thohpum in kinunglesah tan.   
\p
\v 3 Amaho chu tijat le jachat thohsah in, ajeh chu amahon “aphai tun ama ikhut uvah aumtai” atiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Hinlah koi hileh nangma holte jousen nang a kipa-le-thanopna dimset muo hen. Koi hileh na mihuhhingna ngaichaho jouse chun “Elohim Pathen hi aloupi e!” tin samging'u hen.   
\p
\v 5 Hinla keidin vang vaicha le lhasam ka hi; O Elohim Pathen lungset tah in eipanpi din hung loi in. Nanghi eipanpi le eihuhhingpa na hi; O Yahweh Pakai geisang hih in.   
\c 71  
\s1 Tehsepu Taona  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai eihuhdoh ding ngaichan na kom kahinbel e.   
\p
\v 2 Neihuhhing in lang neihuhdoh in, ajeh chu nangma adih na hi, na kol hinsung'in lang ka sei neingaipeh in, chule neichamlhatsah in.   
\p
\v 3 Ka kisel jing theina din kahoidam na songpi hijing in. Keima huhhing ka chan theina ding'in thu peh chu pen, nangma ka songpi le ka kiselna na hi.   
\p
\v 4 Ka Pathen Elohim, miphalouho thaneina a kon'in neihuhdoh in, eibolse a mi engbolseho'a kon'in neihuhdoh in.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai nangbou ka kinepna na hi, O Yahweh Pakai nangma hi ka chapan laiya pat'a ka hin tahsan na hi tai.   
\p
\v 6 Henge, ka pen'a pat nang'in neina umpi jing in, ka nu naobu sung'a ka kijil'a pat'a neina chintuppat ahitai, hijeh a nangma ka thangvah jing hi datmo ding ahipoi.   
\p
\v 7 Ka hinkho hi mitamtah din kihilna thei ahi, ajeh chu nangma hi ka thahatna le ka kiselna na hi.   
\p
\v 8 Hijeh a chu nangma ka thangvah chim theilou na hi; Nilhum kei kei a hi na loupina ka phondoh jing ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Tua, ka tehphat hin neipaidpoh hih in. Ka tha'n ajolou teng neinungsun hih in.   
\p
\v 10 Ka melmate hi keima douna di'n akihoutoh tauve. Amaho hin thadoh ding eigo tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Amahon, “Elohim Pathen in anungsun tai che'u hitin gaman'u hite ajeh chu tuahi koiman apanpi lou ding ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 12 O Elohim Pathen, munchom a potdoh hih in, Pathen ka Elohim neihung panpi loi in.   
\p
\v 13 Keima eihehseho hi sunem'in lang sumang jeng in, keima eibolsenomho hi sujum'in lang jachatsah in.   
\p
\v 14 Keima vang neikithopi ding'a kinem jing ding ka hi; Keiman nangma ka thangvahbe jing ding na hi.   
\p
\v 15 Keiman nangma chonphatnaho hi mijouse ka seipeh ding ahi. Keima thusei them hihih jong leng na mihuhhingna thahatna hi nilhumkei kei a ka phondoh jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 O Yahweh Pakai thaneichungnung, keiman na thilbol nasatah tahho jeh a ka thangvah ding na hi. Thudih choija nangma bou na hi hi keiman mijouse ka seipeh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 17 O Elohim Pathen nang'in ka chapanlai a pat'a neinahil ahitai. Ken jong na thilbol kidangho hi midangho ka seipeh jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Tunvang keima ka tehtan ka sam akang tai neinungsun hih in. Tu khangthahte lah a hin na thaneina hi samphong lengnge. Kei nung'a hung ding miho lah a jong na thilbol datmo umtahho jong phongdoh ing kate.   
\p
\v 19 O Elohim Pathen na chonphatna hi van sangpenho lah jong aphapeh e. O Elohim Pathen na thilbol kidangtahho hi koitoh na kitekahpi thei ding ham?   
\p
\v 20 Hahsatna nasatah tah neithohsah in ahinlah nang'in ka hinkho na kiledohsah ding ahi'n chule lhan lah a kon'in jong neikaidoh in.   
\p
\v 21 Nang'in lolhinna sangjo cheh a jong neikiledohsah ding avel'a neihin lhamon ding ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Hiteng chuleh keiman semjangsaito tho'a nangma ka thangvah ding ahi, ajeh chu O Elohim Pathen nangma na kitepna a na thon ngaipoi.   
\p
\v 23 Keiman nangma thangvahna la hi kipah tah'a thongleuva ka sah ding ahi, ajeh chu nang in neihunglhatdoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Keiman nangma thilphabolho hi sun nilhum a ka seiphongle ding ahi, ajeh chu keima eibolsego chun jachatna le jumna atoh tauvin ahi.   
\c 72  
\s1 Israelte Leng Dinga Taona  
\s1 Solomon labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen nang'in na ngaisang thutan dihna chu lengpa hinpe jing'in, chule na chonphatna chu lengpa chapa hinpe tan.   
\p
\v 2 Na mite chung'a thu adih in tansah in; genthei lengvaite jong aphalam achan dingdol chang jing u hen.   
\p
\v 3 Molsang dung hon jong mijouse ding'in haodohna sodohsah hen chule thinglhang in jong gapha sodohsah hen.   
\p
\v 4 Genthei lengvaite panhusah in lang alhasamho chate huhdoh hen chule misugentheite chu sumang jeng hen.   
\p
\v 5 Vanlai jol'a nisa le lha avahjing laise'n tonsot in amahon nangma naging jing'u hen.   
\p
\v 6 Lengpa chu amite lah a go'n leiset chung achapnou bang'in hamdongho tobang amite chapnou hen.   
\p
\v 7 Ahinkho lhumkeijin chonphatna hinkho chepi jing hen. Chule lha'n vah aneilaisen khangtou jing hen.   
\p
\v 8 Alenggam in twikhanglen khat a kon'in twikhanglen langkhat hoppha hen lang chule Euphrate vadung'a kon'in leiset mong langkhat gei hop hen.   
\p
\v 9 Neldigam a ganchaching mite'n chibai aboh diu ahi; amelmate jong amasang a um nen le boh lah a chun lhu cheh unte.   
\p
\v 10 Tarshish le gamlatah a cheng lhumlam lengte'n kai hin peuhen. Sheba le Seba a kon solam lengte'n kipa thilpeh hinchoiju hen.   
\p
\v 11 Leng jouse a ang'a kun'untin namtin vaipi alhacha hung pang di'u ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Aman genthei lengvaite chu akom'a atao teng'uleh hin huhdoh intin, min abol genthei panpibeiho chu ahinpanhu ding ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Aman milhasamte neiloute akhoto'a ahin huhdoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Pumhat a kibol thohgimna noija umho chu alhatdoh ding ahi, ajeh chu Aman amaho chu alainatpi ding ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Lengpa chu hingsot hen! Sheba sana chu ama kipe hen, amite'n taopeh jing'u hen chule nilhumkei in phatthei boh uhen.   
\p
\v 16 Agamsung'uva chang-le-mim nengchet hen, thinglhangvum geiyin chang-le-mim kehdoh hen. Thei gana thingphungho jong Lebanon thingphungho bang'in keh dimset'u hen. Chule mipite jong hamphung phat bang'in hinhoi u hen.   
\p
\v 17 Tonsot in lengpa minthang hen, nisa asat laisen chejom jing hen. Namtin vaipi amajeh in phatthei chang'u hen.   
\p
\v 18 Yahweh Pakai, Israel Pathen Elohim chu thangvah in um hen, Amabouvin thil kidang aboldoh thei ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Amin loupi chu tonsot in thangvah in umhen! Vannoi leiset hi Ama loupina dimset hen, Amen, Amen!   
\p
\v 20 (Hiche hi Jesse chapa David taona achaina ahi).   
\c 73  
\s1 BU THUMNA  
\s1 Thenna Chun Malam'a Kipaman Ahin Lhut Ding Ahi  
\s1 Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu Isreal te din aphai, hitobanga lungthimtheng ho dinga chun.   
\p
\v 2 Keima din vang, kalamjotna beikoncha bou ahitai. Kalamlhong anal in lhulham pai ding kahitai.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu keiman mikiletsahho gitlou bol pum hijong leu akhangtou u kamuteng ka otchalheh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Amaho hi atahsa'u aphatheiyin, adamthei un, ahattheiyun lungkhamna imacha neilou dan'in aum jiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Amaho hin midang bang'in boina imacha aneipouvin midangho'n aneiyu lunggimna amahon imacha aneipouve.   
\p
\v 6 Amahon kiletsahna songmantam a kisem khivui bang'in aki ouvin, gitlouna chu pon bang'in akisil'un ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hiche miboltheiho hin alungsung uva angaichat chan'u anei un ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Amahon mi jahda dingngen aseijun kiletsah tah in midang chu suhmang ding ago uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Amahon van douna'n thu asei uvin a-o cheng'un leiset pumpi asamsesoh jeng'un ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hiti chun mipiho'n athusei u hi ajah uleh akicha uvin akisulungdong gam tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Elohim Pathen'in ipi ahet am? “Hatchungnung in thilsohho hi ahena dem?” atiuve.   
\p
\v 12 Hiche migilouho hi veuvin hinkhonom amang un ahao tultul jeng'un ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Imacha phachomlou ding'a lungthim theng ka put ham? Themmona beihel'a hinkho ka man hi mohseh ham?   
\p
\v 14 Nilhumkei in imacha phatchomna ka mupon hahsatna ngen ka mu jo'n ahi, jingkah seh in lunggimna ngen in eilonvuh in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Keiman hitiahi ka seikhah a ahileh na mi ka hilou hijeng inte.   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun keiman miphalouho hi i-atileh khangtou cheh cheh u ham ti hetchet ding'in ka khol'in ahi. Ahinla iti hahsat hitam?   
\p
\v 17 Hichun O Pathen Elohim, nangma muntheng'a ka lut'in ahileh ajona in migiloute akhankho diu chu kahin hedoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Tahbeh in nang'in amaho hi lhuh nathei munjeng a nakoi ahin alhuh gam nadiu a kiling gih geh songpi chung a nakoi joh ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Chomkah lou in amaho amahthahgam tauvin ahi, tijatna'n alhohmang gam tauve.   
\p
\v 20 O Yahweh Pakai nangma na hung kipatdoh tengleh nang'in amaho ngolna chu na nuisat ding ahi, mikhat in jingkah lang'a amang anuisat tobang bou ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hijouchun ka lungsung analheh jeng'in, hiti chun ka sunggil lang achiplha jeng'in ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Keima vang mingol le thilhethemlou kana hi-Nang a ding chun khohephalou gamsa tobang bep ka na hi bouve.   
\p
\v 23 Henge keima nang'a ka hi jing'e, nang man ka jetlang na tuh jingnai.   
\p
\v 24 Na chihna'n eikaihoi jing in, munloupi tah chu neilhut ding ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Van a nang tailou koidangba ka nei ding ham? Leiset chung'a thildang jouse sang'in jong kalung in na ngaicha joi.   
\p
\v 26 Ka tahsa bei henlang ka lhagao lhadai jongleh, Elohim Pathen chu ka lungthim'a ka hatna ahijing'in Amahi tonsot a kei a ahijing'e.   
\p
\v 27 Ama dalhaho jouse chu mahthah ding ahiuve, ajeh chu nangma dalhaho jouse chu nangman na sumang jin ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Ahinla keima ding'in Elohim Pathen kom nai hi iti phat a hitam! Keiman vang Yahweh Pakai Lengchungnung chu ka kiselna ahijing e, chule keiman na thilbol kidangho hi mijouse ka seipeh ding ahi.   
\c 74  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Mite Douho Manthahna Dinga Taona  
\s1 Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen, idia hitihchan pi neipaidoh u hitam? Ipi ding'a na kelngoite douna a hichangeihi na lunghan ham?   
\p
\v 2 Khang masalai peh a nalhentum chate kahiu neisumil hih beh un, hiche nam nagoulu tum dia na ngeh jing chu kahiuve! chule hiche lei a na inn Jerusalem jong sumil hih beh in.   
\p
\v 3 Hiche khopi kisumangsa a hin hungvahlen lang, na melmate'n na houin hi ichanggei a asuhset'u hitam hinven.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche mun a hi na melmate'n haan la anasap u hitam, hiche mun a hi aponlap u ana khaisang'u ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Amahon gammang lah a thingtuhna a heicha analap u bang'in,   
\p
\v 6 Heicha le chempong toh tho'n anakhenchip'un ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Amahon namuntheng a na mintheng kitahdohho chu asuboh un,   
\p
\v 8 Chuban in jong “abonchan suseu hite” akitikit uvin, Elohim Pathen houna mun jouse jong anahallhah u ahitai.   
\p
\v 9 Keihon melchihna thil kidangtahho chu ka mudohjou tapouvin ahi. Themgaoho jouse la aumgam tapouvin, chule hiche hi itihleh kichai ding ti chu koimacha ahe aumpon ahi.   
\p
\v 10 O Pathen Elohim ka melmate'u hi itihchanggei na kihousetsah ding ham? Namin theng hi tonsot a nasuh molphou sah ding hitam?   
\p
\v 11 Ipi dia na banjet thahatna hi na chalohsah lou ham? Na khut thahattah chu mangcha'n lang amaho khu sugam tan.   
\p
\v 12 O Elohim Pathen nangma hi khangluilai a pat a leiset chung'a huhhingna hinpolut a ka lengpa na hi.   
\p
\v 13 Nang man na ban thahat'in twikhanglen jong na lhehkhen in, twikhanglen a cheng sahemho luchang jong navohchip soh hel e.   
\p
\v 14 Nangman Leviathan luchang jong nasuchip in atahsa neldigam a um ganhingho vahnan na mangtai.   
\p
\v 15 Nang man leiset a kum nakihei sah in leiset a kon'in twi tamtah na putdohsah in chule a-itih a kang khalou vadungho jong na sukang jin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Sun le jan jong nang'a ahin: nangman vanlai jol'a avahho jouse le nisa jong na sem in ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Nangman leiset gamgiho jouse jong na lhehkhen in chule nipilai le phalbilai jong na gongtoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Ven Yahweh Pakai hiche melmaho hin ichangei a nangma hi na houset'u hitam, ima hetkhenna neilou nam miten na min hi asuminseuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hiche gamsa tobang miphalouho hi vapal tobang miphaho hi suhmangsah hihbeh in, na mite gentheina hi itihchan'in jong sumil hihbeh in.   
\p
\v 20 Na kitepna kinep umtahho chu sumil hihbeh in, ajeh chu gamsung hi muthim le pumhat a natohna adimset e!   
\p
\v 21 Noise le chotpha a umte hi jumna tosah kit hihbeh in, amavang mivaicha le tahlelte na min choi-at sah in.   
\p
\v 22 Na melmate'n na housetnaho le na doumah mah asap a saptho jenghou hi nahsahmon koihihbeh in.   
\p
\v 23 Namel ten aseidoh uchu nungvet kit hih in ahiloule amaho phunchel jing na chu.   
\c 75  
\s1 Elohim Pathen In Mikitah Ho Adopsang  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen nangma kahin thangvah e! Yahweh Pakai nangma nailama naumjeh in kahin thangvah uve. Muntin a um mipiten nathilbol kidangtah ho aphongdoh un ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Elohim Pathennin asei e, keiman thutanna phatkhat kagong e, keiman dihtah a thu katanding ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Leiset hi kihot linghenlang mihemte tija jongleu leiset bulpi tuhchah jingding chu kahi.   
\p
\v 4 “Keiman mikiletsah ho kagih-in ‘kiletsah datan!’ Migiloulou ho komachun, ‘nakhut tumjel hihin!’   
\p
\v 5 Vanho dounan nakhut tum jel hihin, ahilouleh nahsah loutah in thu seihih in” kati.   
\p
\v 6 Ajeh chu, leiset chunga koimacha solam a kon hihen lhumlam-a kon hijongleh chuleh gamthip noi a kon hijongleh kihisah tah a akhuttum ajel louding aphai.   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu thutan vaihom-a hi Elohim Pathen Amabou ahin, Amahin koipen ding doh ding ham ahi louleh koipen lhuding ham gonga Amabou ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in juphon gimnam twitoh kihal chu akhutna khonkhat in achoiye. Aman hiche ju chu thutan na mun a sunglut in, hichu migilou cheng in adon teitei diu adontheng heldiu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hinla keima vangin, Elohim Pathen thil bol ho hi kaphondoh jengding; Jacob Elohim Pathen henga vahchoila kasha jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu Elohim Pathen in asei e “Keiman miphalouho thahatna laichu kasuhchip ding ahinla michonphaho thahatna kahatsah beding ahi” ati.   
\c 76  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Bou Gin Ding Ahi  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga tumging to tho dia Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 Judah a Pathen Elohim hi akijabol in, Israel a Amin hi aloupin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Jerusalem hi achenna ahin; Zion molchu a inn ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hicheachun agalmite meikong tobang thalchang chu asubong in, a umphou le achemjamhou chuleh agalmachah houjouse jong asuhchip pehin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nangma hi tonsot a umjing mol ho sang in jong naloupi in nalamdang deh e.   
\p
\v 5 Eidou u galmi hangpenho jouse jong akisugep gam tauve. A imumil bang in kamasang uvah akijamdel tauve. Galmi koiman kamasang uvah akhutnu alamp ngapchat lou diu ahitai.   
\p
\v 6 O Jacob Elohim Pathen nakam sunga nahaina hu chu ahung gindoh chun asakol jouse leh akangtalai jouseu akolchah sah soh jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Nangma hitobang tah-a ginle ja naumhi datmo ding ahipoi. Ajeh chu nalunghan ahung deujah leh koiham na-anga ding ngam dingah?   
\p
\v 8 Vanna konin nagalmite chunga thu nahin tan in, leiset hi akithingin na-ang sungah adingin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 O Yahweh Pakai nangma nadingdoh-in mi engsete thu natan in leiset abol genthei a umte nahuhdohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Mihemte hi nangma doumah a achonteng hichu naloupina kilandohna ahijon ahi, ajeh chu hiche chu nangma manchah-a pangbep ji ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Na Pakai Yahweh, na Pathen Elohim heng a kitepna neiyin lang hichu nit'in, mijousen kichat umtah Elohim Pathen kom a pehdingdol hinpecheh hen.   
\p
\v 12 Ajeh chu Aman leng chate kiletsahna avochip in, lengten jong Ama ginle jana aneiyun ahi.   
\c 77  
\s1 Masanga Elohim Pathen Hepina Geldoh In  
\s1 Jeduthun, lalamkai pa henga Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 Keiman Yahweh Pakai kakouvin; henge, kasaptho jengin ahi. Oh, Elohim Pathen in eingaipeh tei inte!   
\p
\v 2 Keiman hahsatna kato teng Yahweh Pakai chu kaholjin ahi. Jankhovah in vanlang sangin kakhut katungin kataojin ahi. Ahinla kalhagao in olna amujoupoi.   
\p
\v 3 Keiman Elohim Pathen kagelin apanpina ngaichatnan eilonvuh-in kamaojin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nangman jankhovah in nei imutsahpon ahi, ajeh chu keima kalung ahesoh behsehin kataotheipoi!   
\p
\v 5 Keiman phat sottah chetasa hinkholui nopsahna chengchu kageldohjin,   
\p
\v 6 kipana dimsetna vahchoina la ana kisahna janhochu kalhagao lungthim a kakholchil tengleh tuhin masangtoh akibah louna kageldohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai hin aitih a dia eipaidoh mong hitantem? Amahin khotona eimulou mong mong ding hitam?   
\p
\v 8 Angailutna longlouchu chemang monga hitam? Akitepna hochu lolhing lou mong ding hitam?   
\p
\v 9 Elohim Pathen in eihepina chu asuhmil mong hitam? Eihepina kotchu akha mong hitam?   
\p
\v 10 Hitihin keiman kaseijin, “hichehi kachanding mongchu ahi, chungnungpen'in ei engbol ahi,” kati.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinla O Yahweh Pakai nanatoh hohi kahin geldohin, tuma sang peh-a nanatoh kidangtah hochu kageldohin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hicheho chu kalung sunga amil theipon ahi. Nanatoh loupitah hochu gellouvin kaumthei jipon ahi.   
\p
\v 13 O Elohim Pathen nalampi hi atheng e. Nangma tobang patheng dang um mong nantem?   
\p
\v 14 Nanghi datmo kidangtah Elohim Pathen chu nahi ahi! Nangin chidang namdangte lah-a nabol theina gimneitah chu nakilandohsah ahitai.   
\p
\v 15 Naban thahatna a nami Jacob leh Joseph chilhahte chu nahuhdoh ahitai.   
\p
\v 16 O Yahweh Pakai twikhanglensan chun namuphat in twichun nahinven akithingtan ahi! Twikhanglen chu asunglang ho ngeiyin akithingin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Meilhang in go ahin juhlhahsah in, van gin kithong chun vanthamjol chu agin akithonsah in ahi. Nakolphe thalchang chun ahin salvah in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Chimpei lah-a kon chun van gin ahung kithongin kolphe chun vannoi leiset ahin salvah in ahi! Leiset chu akithingin akihot-e.   
\p
\v 19 Nalampi chu twikhanglen'ah akilhunglutnin ahi, Nakeng nung twilah ajong akigollut e, ahinlah nakhonung koimachan amudoh joupoi!   
\p
\v 20 Nangin kelngoi chingpa hina in Mose le Aaron mangcha in namite hi kelngoi honbangin napuilen ahi.   
\c 78  
\s1 Israelte Thusim  
\s1 Asap labol  
\p
\v 1 O kamite ho, kathuhil hi ngaiyun. Kathusei a hin nakol'u hinsungun,   
\p
\v 2 ajeh chu keiman thulem a nahenga thu kaseiding ahi, keiman achesa thilsoh ho-a kon a kahin hilding nahi,   
\p
\v 3 eihon thusim ijahsa houleh ihetsahou, thusim ipu ipateuva kon a hung kiseilhapeh ho ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Eihon hiche thutah hohi icha inaoteu i-impeh loudiu, Yahweh Pakai natoh loupi tahtah hohi, athaneinale akidanna hohi ikhangthah houhi iseipehdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Ajeh chu Aman Jocob kom a Dan anapeh-a, Israel kom a thuhil ho anapeh ahi. Aman ipu ipateu atu achateu ahil diuva thupeh anapeh ahin,   
\p
\v 6 hitiachu ahunglhung ding khangthah ten ahet nadiuleh ahung pengloulai chapang ho dinga, chuleh aman amaho chapangte ahilsonna diuva ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hitiachu khangthah ahunglhun channa Elohim Pathen a kinepna thah aneisah nadiu, Yahweh Pakai natoh kidang thil loupi hochu asuhmillou nadiu chuleh athupehho anitjing nadiuva ahiljing diu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hiteng chuleh ipi iputeu tobang talou a lungtahna, kiphinna, kitah louna Elohim Pathen a alungthim'u pehnom louna anei lou diu ahitai.   
\p
\v 9 Ephraim galsat hon thalchang akipoh vangun akinung hei un galmun a konin ajam tauve.   
\p
\v 10 Amahon Elohim Pathen toh akitepnau ajuitapouvin ama thuhil dinpi ding anom tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Elohim Pathen in ipi abolpeh uham thil kidangtah tah anabol hochu,   
\p
\v 12 napu napateu dinga thil kidang anatohdoh ho, Egypt gamsungle Zoan phaicham chunga, atohdohho asumil tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ajeh chu Aman twikhanglen ana homkhen in twichu bang bangin aki khen in amaho anapui galkaiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Sunleh meilhang in anapuijin, janleh meikong in anapuijin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Aman gamthip gamm a songpia kon in adondiu twi anaputdoh sah-in ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Aman songpia konna twichu vadung bangin analondohsah in ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Ahijeng vangin neldi gam achun amahon chonset anabol'un hatchungnung dounan ana kiphin'un ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Amahon alungsung uchu lungtahna neipumin Elohim Pathen ana patep un nehding anathumun ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Amahon Elohim Pathen Amatah dounan thu anaseiyun “Elohim Pathen in gamthip gammah an eipejou pouve” atiuve.   
\p
\v 20 “Henge, songchu ajep'un twichu aputdoh nai, ahinla amite changlhah le sa me eipejou pouve” atiuve.   
\p
\v 21 Elohim Pathen in hichehi ajahdoh phatnin alunghang lheh jengin, Jacob dounan alunghan na mei akoudoh jengin ahi! Hitihin Israel douna alung hanna ahung koudoh jengin ahi,   
\p
\v 22 ajeh chu amahon Elohim Pathen atahsan pouvin chuleh amaho akhoukhah diuvin jong ana tahsan pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Elohim Pathen in chungleng vanthamjol thu apen vankot jouse jong ahongdoh in,   
\p
\v 24 Aman aneh dingun van a konin Mana gojuh in ahin juhlhah sah in van changlhah chu ahinpen ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Amahon vantil buchu aneuvin, Elohim Pathen in alungna chimsetnun apen ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Aman solam huichu ahin nunsah in, Athahatnan lhanglang huijong anunsah in ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Aman aneh dingun sachu vutdi jat ahin juhlhah sahin, vachaho chu twikhanglen panga neldi jat ahin,   
\p
\v 28 Aman vachaho chu aponbuh sungu leh avel uvah ahin lenlhah sah in ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Amahon oivasetin aneuvin ahi. Angaichat dungjuitah in apen ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Hinla amahon angaichat dungjuija anehva masangu, akam sung uva sa aumpet jeng jong chun,   
\p
\v 31 Elohim Pathen lunghana achung uvah ahung lhungtan ahileh Aman alah uva ahatpen pen hochu athat tan ahi. Israel khangthah anasapen hochu athat gamtan ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Ahijeng vangin mipiho chun chonset aboljom jingun ahi, thilkidang ijat abol vangin atahsan dehpouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Hiti chun ahinkhou chu lhuhgam na ahitan akum khouchu kichatnan adimtai.   
\p
\v 34 Elohim Pathen in amaho ahin thapat phatnun amahon ajona langin Amachu ahin holtauvin ahi. Kisihna ahin neitauvin Elohim Pathen ahin holtauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Hiti chun Elohim Pathen chu asongpiu ahi chuleh Elohim Pathen chu hat chungnung le ahuhhing pao ahi ahin geldoh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Ahijeng vangin hichu kamnal a anaseijiu ahibouvin alei u mangchan jou anaseiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Alung sungu chu Elohim Pathen a ana petheng pouvin Elohim Pathen toh anakitep nauva jong ana dingdet pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Hinla lungsetna dim Elohim Pathen chun achonsetnau anangai damun amahochu ana sumang deh pouvin ahi. Phat atamjon alunghan na anatuh tangin hiche bangchun ima ana tongdoh pon ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Tahsa mihembep ahiuve ti ahejingin, hui anun leh heikhat kahbou ahin ahung kiletapoi ti ageldoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Gamthip sunga ijatvei Ama douna ana kiphin jengu chuleh alungsung anatsah vangin,   
\p
\v 41 Avel vel in Elohim Pathen thohhat nachu apatep jiuvin Israel Pathen Elohim chu asulunghang jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Amahon athahatna in agalmi houva kon a anahuhdoh u hi ageldoh joutapouve.   
\p
\v 43 Egypt gamsunga thil kidang ijat abolu hitam chuleh Zoan phaicham a athil kidang bol hochu ageldoh tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Vadungho thisan asosah a don mohella alha, vadung twi donmo hella alha jengchu.   
\p
\v 45 Elohim Pathen in amaho lah a thousi vaibong alansah a, uphohte alansah a agam ujong a suh set peh chu ahepha tapouve.   
\p
\v 46 Aman achang jouseu khongbai aneh gamsah in alousoh jouseu jong khaokhopi anehgam sah e.   
\p
\v 47 Alengpithei jouseu gel avohlhah sah sohkei in, atheipiu phung jouseu jong daibang athagamsah in ahi.   
\p
\v 48 Agancha jouseu gel lah a dalhah in aumsah in, akelngoi houjong keh alhah lihsah sohtai.   
\p
\v 49 Achung uva nasatah in alunghangin, alung dammona alung hanna, mi sumang vantil hon tamtah alhahkhum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 50 Aman alunghanna achung uvah achuh sahtan, Egypt mite hinkho anahing hoipon, amangthah gamtan ahi,   
\p
\v 51 Egypt insunga achapa tahpen cheh athat in Egypt gamsung pumpia khangdongte pahcha amolsahtai.   
\p
\v 52 Hinla Aman amite chu kelngoi honbangin apuiyin gamthip noija bitkei in apui galkai tan ahi.   
\p
\v 53 Aman mongtahin apuilen hijeh chun amahon kichatna aneipouve, chujongleh twikhanglen in agalteu alhoh mangpeh gamtai.   
\p
\v 54 Amaho chu Elohim Pathen in agamtheng abanjetna atundoh, molsang vum achun ahin puilut in,   
\p
\v 55 Amaho masangah namtin vaipi adelmang peh sohkeiyin, abonchauvin achan dingu gam ahoppeh chehin, Israel phung namtin abonchauvin ama ama ponbuh cheh a achensah tai.   
\p
\v 56 Ahijeng vangin amahon hatchungnung Elohim Pathen dounan thil abol jingun athupeh ho khatcha anitpeh pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 57 Apu apateu bangin avah mang-uvin jou jengin na atonguvin ahi. Amaho chu thalpi janglou bangin akitah pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 58 Amahon pathen dangho doiphung aphutdoh un Elohim Pathen alunghan sah uvin, chuleh semthu pathen ahoujeh-un Elohim Pathen athangthip sahtauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 59 Elohim Pathen in ajahdoh phat in hatah'in alunghangin Israel chu pumpai in apaimangtan ahi.   
\p
\v 60 Elohim Pathen in Shiloh achenna mun adalhan mihemte lah a aumna ponbuh chu adalhatai.   
\p
\v 61 Aman aloupina le athaneina hetna kitepna thingkong chu galmiho khutna apehdohtan ahi.   
\p
\v 62 Ama amite chunga alunghan jeh-in agalmiteu athasah gamtan ahi.   
\p
\v 63 Gollhangho galah athigam tauvin, nungah ho akichenpidiu aumtapon ahi.   
\p
\v 64 Thempute athat gamtauvin ameithai houvin alhasetpi thei tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 65 Ajonan Yahweh Pakai chu a-ihmua ahung khangdoh bangin ahung thoudoh in mihatpa hung kiltildoh bangin ahung kitildohin,   
\p
\v 66 Galmi hochu anungno in a-itih a ding jumna atosah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 67 Ahinla Joseph chilhah hochu apaidohin, chuleh Ephraim phungchu alheng tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 68 Aman akhellin Judah leh angailut Zion molchu alhengin,   
\p
\v 69 hichea chun vanho san banga sang, leiset banga chah a-itih a umjing dingin houin khat atungdoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 70 Aman asohpa David chu akelngoi chinna a konnin anakoudoh'in analheng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 71 Aman kelngoipi le anou achin laijin akoudoh'in amite Israel Jacob chilhah hochu kelngoi chinna ching dingin anapansah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 72 David in amaho chu lungtheng tah leh chingtheitah in analamkaiyin ahi.   
\c 79  
\s1 Jerusalem Kisuhmang Jeh'a Kana La  
\s1 Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen chiding namdangten nanga dinga nanakilhendoh nagamchu ahinlo tauvin, na Houin theng asuboh'un chuleh Jerusalem chu khogemsa abahsah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Amahon nasohte tahsa chu vantham jolla lengle vachate adalhahpeh tauvin, pathen mi thengte tahsaphe chu gamlah a ganhingho an le chahin apangtan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Jerusalem kimvellah thisan hi twilon in along jengin mithi vuiding koimacha aumpoi.   
\p
\v 4 Kaheng kakomho noise dingleh kajet kavei a umho dingin noise le taitomin kaumtauve.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai phat ichangeija kachung uva nalunghan ding hitam? Tonsot geijin em? Phat ichan geija nathangthipna chu meikong banga aljeng dingham?   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai nalunghanna chu nang na donnom loute chidang namdang holeh naminpan nomloute lenggam hochungah bunglhatan.   
\p
\v 7 Ajeh chu amahon namite Israelte hi avallhum gamtauvin chuleh gamsung hi gamgem asodohsah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Kapu kapateu chonset jehin keiho neithep mosah hihbeh un! Nami khotonan gangtah'in kangaichatnu neisuh bulhitpeh un, achutilouleh kakinepnau beiding ahitai.   
\p
\v 9 O Pathen Elohim kasochatnau, neipanhu loiyun! namin loupina dingin neipanhuvin, kachonsetnau ngaidam inlang neihuh doh'un namin loupina dingin.   
\p
\v 10 Ipi dinga chiding namdangte hin eihouset uva “A Pathen u Elohim hoilai a umham?” natisah nahlai dingham? Hiche chiding namdangho chunga naphulahna chu neimusahih in, ajeh chu amahohin nasohte thisan aso u ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Sohchangho lhasetna hi ngaipehin, thidinga athu kitansa hohi huhdoh inlang nathaneina chu neivet sah'un.   
\p
\v 12 O Yahweh Pakai kaheng kakom hon noise tah a nahousetnao hi ajat sagin lethuh tei in.   
\p
\v 13 Hiteng chuleh keiho namite nangailutna ankonga kivah nakelngoiten akhang khangin nang vahchoi ungting, vahchoijing taovinge.   
\c 80  
\s1 Israel Semphatna Dinga Taona  
\s1 Lalamkaipa henga Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 O Israel neingaipehun, nangma Joseph chilhahte gancha hon ho banga puihoija kelngoi chin a chingpa. O Elohim Pathen Cherubim chunga laltouna a toupan naloupinavah hoi chu hin kimudoh sah in.   
\p
\v 2 Ephraim, Benjamin leh Mannaseh chungah hintah langin, nathahatna gimneitah chu neimusah unlang neihung huhdoh tauvin.   
\p
\v 3 O Elohim Pathen nangma komah neihoilutnun, namaivah chun neihin salvah un, chuteng boule huhhing kachandiu ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen, phat itihchan gei a kataona sanlou a nakoi dingham?   
\p
\v 5 Nangin lungkhamna a ichan gei a neivah uva chuleh khondimset a mitlhi neilonsah diuham?   
\p
\v 6 Nangin hengle kom chiding namdangte taitomna neichansah tauvin kagalmi teuvin totnan einei tauve.   
\p
\v 7 O Elohim Pathen hatchungnung nangma kom neingatsah un, namaivah chun neisalvah'un chuteng lebou huhhing kachandiu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Nangin lengpiga twi bangin Egyptma kon in neihin puidohun, nangin chiding namdangho nadel mangna nagamsunga neipuilutnu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Nangman keiho ding amun neisuhtheng pehun chuleh hichea chun keiho kajung khouvin gamsung chu kadimset tauve.   
\p
\v 10 keiho len molsangho atomjouvin, kabah houvin Cedar thingphung lentah tahho atomjouvin,   
\p
\v 11 keihon kabah hou lhumlam Mediterranean twikhanglen gei in kathejalun chuleh kajungun Euphrate vadung gei ka thejallun ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hinla tunvang, kabangu ipi dinga neivoh lhahpeh uva, hilang lampia hinhopa jousen kagao akiguh u hitam?   
\p
\v 13 Gammanga kon in ngalchang hangin avallhum in, gamlah ganchahon kivahnan anei un ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hungkile kit in O Elohim Pathen hatchungnung, kahung tao un ahi. Van a konnin neihin veuvin kahahsatnau neihin vetpeh un, hiche lengpigui hi hin khoukhah'in.   
\p
\v 15 Nangma tahin nanatu ahi. Hiche chapa hi nangma tahin nangma dinga nahin khoukhah ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ajeh chu keihohi thing banga eikitan bong bonga kagal miteuvin eihal lhah'u ahitai. Nangman navetsah chu amuteng uleh manthahnan juiju hen.   
\p
\v 17 Mihem nangailut nacha nadeilhen chu hatsah-in,   
\p
\v 18 Chutengleh keihon itihchan injong nanungsun pouvinge. Nei suhal kit un chutileh namin avella kahin koukit theidiu ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Nangma komlang nei ngatsah kitnun, O Yahweh Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen hatchungnung namaivah chun neihin salvah'un, chuteng lebou huhhing kachandiu ahi.   
\c 81  
\s1 Egypt'a Kon Potdoh Golvahna  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 Ei thahatsah u Elohim Pathen thangvahnan la sauvin, Jacob Pathen Elohim vahchoinan la sauvin.   
\p
\v 2 Sauvin! tumging tothon avahchoila sauvin voh gingthei vouvin, semjang kisai ginleh selangdah gin to thouvin,   
\p
\v 3 Lhathah janle sumkon mut-uvin lang, lhalih janle lhalih nikhoa golvah bolteng sumkon mut uvin.   
\p
\v 4 Ajeh chu hichehi Israel dinga chondan thupeh ahin Jacob Elohim Pathen thugahsa ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Egypt gam a kon a ahungdoh uchun Aman Joseph komma hettohsah khat anaphutdoh tai. Keiman kahetchetlou thukhat kajan,   
\p
\v 6 Keiman apohgih kangai jangin akhut a jong thilgih kangai jangin akhut a jong thilgih hahsa kathamsah tapoi.   
\p
\v 7 Nagimna a kon in neihin kouvin keiman kahuhdohtai. Meivom lhangkhat kiheh chetchut laha kahin houjin, Meribah a twi umloupet in natahsah kapatepjin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ngai uvin O kamite, nangho gihna nasatah kapeh pet-hin, Vo Israel kaseihi nangai poupou uleh,   
\p
\v 9 Nanghon imatihchan ajong gamchom mit pathen koipouvin nate, pathen lhem masanga kun pouvin nate.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu Egypt-a kon a nahin puidoh uva Yahweh Pakai na Pathen'u Elohim keima kahi. Nakam hakatnin ka-in keiman thilpha tamtah adimsetna kahin sunlut pehding ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinla kamiten angainom pouvin, Israel'in Keima eingaicha pouve.   
\p
\v 12 Hijeh chun Keiman alouchallu dungjuijin amaho deilam lam a chondin kalha kangtai.   
\p
\v 13 O kamiten kaseihi ngaipou pouleu, O Kamite Israelte hin eijuiju henlang kalampia hin chenom poupouleu!   
\p
\v 14 Ichan geija gang in agalmiteu kajopeh tadiuvem! Ichan geija gangtah'in akidoupiteu chunga kakhut kalha tadem!   
\p
\v 15 Koi hile Yahweh Pakai nahsah loute chu a-ang sunga kisuchipdiu atonsotna mahthahdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ahinla keiman nehthei aphapen a kavahding nahin, keiman songpia kon a kimu khoijua kavahdiu nahi.   
\c 82  
\s1 Elohim Pathen In Migiloute Chunga Thu Atan Ding  
\s1 Asaph labol  
\p
\v 1 Van a thutan na chunga Elohim Pathen in vai ahomin Van mite chunga athutan na aphondoh e.   
\p
\v 2 Nangman itihchan hi miphalouho napanpia thudihlou ho nachelhah sah dingham?   
\p
\v 3 “Chaga leh vaichate chungah thudih chepin lang; tahlel tele engbolla umte chungah thudih phongdoh in.   
\p
\v 4 Panpi bei tele engbolla umte huhdoh in, miphalouho khut a konin huhdoh-in.   
\p
\v 5 Hinla mibolse ten imacha ahepouve; ama hokhu hetna lhasam ahiuve. Muthim noi a avah leuvin, leiset sungil lamgei in ahotling tai.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman kasei in, ‘Nang ho Pathen nahiuve; nangho hatchungnung chilhah te nahiu ve.   
\p
\v 7 Hinlah nangho mihem tabang bep a nathi diu, thunei vaihom dang ho banga nalhuh tei diu ahi.’”   
\p
\v 8 Hung kipatin, O Elohim Pathen vannoi leiset hi athu tannin, ajeh chu chiding namdangho jouse jonghi aboncha nanga ahi.   
\c 83  
\s1 Leiset Chunga Elohim Pathen Bou Asang Pen Ahi  
\s1 Asap labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen, thipbeh in umhih'in! Na-ngong in umhih'in. O Pathen Elohim thipsan jeng hih in.   
\p
\v 2 Nagalmite cho leng lung khu najahlou ham? Kiletsah tah nagalmiho ahung kipatdoh khu nahet louham?   
\p
\v 3 Amahon namite douna dingin aguh in thil agong uvin, nangin napanhu mite dounan thilphalou agong uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Amahon aseijun “Hungun hiche nam mite hi sumang uhite akitiuve, chutileh Israel hi isuhmit heldiu ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Hiche tohgon ahi amaho akinop to uvin nang dounan kiloikhomna khat anei taove.   
\p
\v 6 Ama hohi Edom mite, Ishmael mite, Moab mite, Hagrit mite,   
\p
\v 7 Gebal mite, Ammon mite, Amelek mite chuleh Philistine leh Tyre akon mipiho ahiuve.   
\p
\v 8 Assyria miten jong ajopmun ahin, Lot chilhah hoto jong kiloikhom ahiuve.   
\p
\v 9 Amahohi Midian, Sisera, Jabin mite Kishion vadunga nabol bang bangin boljengin.   
\p
\v 10 Amaho chu Endor lah nasumang in chuleh atahsa'u monlha chu leiset leipha sosahnan akimang in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Nang in alamkai hochu Oreb le Zoab nabolna bang in sumang in lang chuleh avaipo ho chu Zebah le Zalmunna nabolna bang in thatdoh tan,   
\p
\v 12 ajeh chu amahon hitin aseijuve, “eihon hiche Elohim Pathen gam hohi eiho phatchom na dingin lahpeh-u hite” akitiuve.   
\p
\v 13 O Elohim Pathen amahohi huilah a changvai akithejal bangin thejaltan!   
\p
\v 14 Meijin gammang ahal bang in chuleh meikong in molle lhang ahal lhah bang in hallha jengin,   
\p
\v 15 Huile gon melse tah a adelmang bang in delmang'in, nakhopi huijin kichat sah in,   
\p
\v 16 Nasatah in sujumm in O Yahweh Pakai, namin a ahung kipehlut tokah un.   
\p
\v 17 Amaho hi tonsotna jum ding leh kicha jing dingin melsetah'in thisah tan.   
\p
\v 18 Hiteng chuleh amahon nangbou hi Hatchungnung leiset chunga thunei chungnung nahi hi hin hetau vinte.   
\c 84  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Hou'in a Kikhom Ding Ngaichat  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai hatchungnung nahou in hi iti kangailut hitam?   
\p
\v 2 Hiche a chu iti kaum nom hitam! Yahweh Pakai Hou inn chu kangaicha lheh jenge, kahina apumpin hingjing Elohim Pathen ah kakipana lan sange.   
\p
\v 3 Inva jengin jong abuh akisah in, chuleh pengpalep injong intum akison e. Vo Yahweh Pakai hat chungnung, kalengpa le ka Pathen Elohim! Vachan jong namaicham kom a anou kicholdo nading abuh akisem ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nahou inn'a chenghon ichangei a hinkho nopna anei'u hitam phat tin in nangma vahchoila asauve.   
\p
\v 5 Athahatna Yahweh Pakai a kon a kimuho hinkho iti nop a hitam, alungsungun Jerusalem'ah akholjing jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Beca phaicham ajot tengu jongle, twisam putna twinah tampi umna bangin abol'un, gotwi hunglha masapen in jong twikul tampi ahinsemdoh pehjiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Amaho akalson chan uva ahetbe cheh chehjingdiu ahin, amahon Jerusalem a Yahweh Pakai chu amudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 O Yahweh Pakai, Ka Pathen Elohim hatchungnung kataona neingaipeh'in, O Jacob Elohim Pathen.   
\p
\v 9 O Elohim Pathen kalengpauhi phatthei boh'in, amahi kaluum u ahi, nathaonusa nalhen pahi khotona musah jingin.   
\p
\v 10 Munchom a ni sangkhat umsangin na Houin a nikhat um aphajoi. Miphalou inna chen sangin ka Pathen Elohim inn'a kotngah a pan aphajoi.   
\p
\v 11 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai, Elohim Pathen hi eiho dia nisa le umpho ahi. Aman khoto nale loupina eipeuvin ahi. Yahweh Pakai in thildih jeng bol mihoa kon in thilpha alamang pon ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Yahweh Pakai hatchungnung nangma tahsan mihohi iti kipa um a hitam?   
\c 85  
\s1 Hepina Le Huhhingna Dia Taona  
\s1 Korah chilhah te labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai nangin nagamsung'ah phatthei bohna nasunglhan ahi! Hiti chun nangin Israel phatthei naboh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nangman namite chonsetna nangaidam in hichun achonsetnau jouse nalekhu peh e.   
\p
\v 3 Nangin na lunghan na natuh tang'in, nalung hanna deujah jengchu naki kham jie.   
\p
\v 4 Ei suhal kit uvin, eihuhhingpau O Pathen Elohim! kachung uva nalunghan na tolmang kittan.   
\p
\v 5 Kachung uva nalunghan jing jeng dingham? Nalung hanna khang jouse chung naumsah jing jengding hitam?   
\p
\v 6 Nei suhhal kit loudiu hitam? Namite kipa le thanom a aumjing thei nading a.   
\p
\v 7 Vo Elohim Pathen nami ngailutna longlou chu neimu sah'in nami huhhing najong neipe uvin.   
\p
\v 8 Elohim na Pathen chun ipi asei am, chingthei tah'in ngai in ajeh chu Aman mi kitah ho kom ah chamna thu asei e. Ahinla amaho angolna lampi uvah kilekit dahen.   
\p
\v 9 Tahbeh'in Ama gingte dingin huhing na naicha um a ahi. Chuti leh igamsung u jong aloupina dimding ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ngailutna longlou leh thutah akimuto'in chonphat nale chamna akichopto lhon e.   
\p
\v 11 Kitah nahi leiset a kon a hungdoh ahi. Chuleh chonphatna chu van'a kon a mai lhaisel'a hung kumlha ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Adih'e, Yahweh Pakai in phatthei boh hi ahin lonlhahsah ahin gam leiset a hi ninglhing tah'a ahin gadoh sah'a ikisan ji u ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Chonphat nahin Yahweh Pakai hung nading semtoh nading nikho asap masat ji ahi.   
\c 86  
\s1 David Tahsanna'a Akibul Phu  
\s1 David Taona  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai hung kisunem'in lang kataona neingai peh'in, neidonbut in ajeh chu napanpi ngaicha jing kahi.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai nanga dinga kiphaldoh jing kahi neihuhdoh'in ajeh chu nangma hi ka Pathen Elohim nahin, keima hi nakinbol kahin chuleh nangma hi katansan jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai nami khotona neimusah jingin ajeh chu keiman Nangmahi ka koujing nahi.   
\p
\v 4 O Yahweh Pakai kipana neimusah jingin ajeh chu keimahi Nangkoma kiphaldoh jing kahi.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai nangma hi naphatna jalla eingaidam jing nahi, nakomma panpi ngaichaho dinga longlou ngailutna dimsah nahi.   
\p
\v 6 O Yahweh Pakai kataonahi khotonan neingaipeh'in gangtah a kap kahi neingaipehin.   
\p
\v 7 Kahahsat channa nangma kakouding ahin nangin neidonbut jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 O Elohim Pathen! Semthu pathen ho nang tobang khatcha aumpoi, nabolthei ho bolthei jong aumpoi.   
\p
\v 9 Naemsa chitin namtin ho jong na ang a hungdiu chibai naboh cheh diu ahi Yahweh Pakai; amahon na mintheng avahchoi diu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu nangma bou Elohim Pathen nahin naloupin, nangin bou thil loupiho naboldoh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 O Yahweh Pakai, na lampiho neihil in, nathudih dung jui a hinkho kaman theina dingin, nangma loupina kadopsang jingna dingin lungtheng neipen.   
\p
\v 12 O Yahweh ka Pakai, Elohim ka Pathen! kalungthim pumpin nangma nathangvah ingkate, phattin'in naloupina domsang jing tange.   
\p
\v 13 Ajeh chu nei ngailut na hi akidange. Nangman thina kulkhuh a kon in nei huhdoh tai   
\p
\v 14 O Yahweh Pakai mijumso hatho keima dounan ahung ding doh un; misunoh phah a pang hon thading eigouve. Amahon nangma hi imachan nagel pouve.   
\p
\v 15 Ahinlah Yahweh Pakai Nangma hi khoto naleh ngailutna nei Elohim Pathen nahin lunghang vahlou chuleh kitahna leh tang theilou lungsetna dim a nahi.   
\p
\v 16 Nami lungsetna chun noilang hinven lang nasoh hi tha neipen, nasohpa chapa kahi neihuhdoh'in.   
\p
\v 17 Nei hepina melchih na chu hin tahlang'in chutileh eivetda hohin jumna amudiu ahi. O Yahweh Pakai neipanpin nei lungmonsah jingin.   
\c 87  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Khopi Loupi  
\s1 Korah chilhah te labol  
\p
\v 1 Moltheng chunga chun Yahweh Pakai tundohsa khopi chu aum e.   
\p
\v 2 Aman Jerusalem khopi hi Israel khopi dangho sangin angailu joi.   
\p
\v 3 O Elohim Pathen khopi, nangma chungchang ahi itibang thuloupi tahtah kisei a hitam!   
\p
\v 4 Keima eiheho lah'a hin, Egypt le Babylon chule Philistine leh Tyre chuleh gamlha tah Ethiopia jong kasimtha e. Amaho hi Jerusalem khomite ahitaove.   
\p
\v 5 Jerusalem chungchang a hitiahi kisei ding ahi, “amijousen nammi hina a thaneina chu akipapi cheh uve”, chule hatchungnung ama tah in khopi chu phatthei aboh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai in chitin namtin hi ajihlut teng, aseiding, “amaho jouse hi Jerusalem khomite ahitaove” atiding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Mipi hochun theile amut'uva la asahdiu, “Kahinkho hung kipat nahi Jerusalem ahi” atidiu ahi.   
\c 88  
\s1 Thina Kona Lhatdohna Dinga Taona  
\s1 Hesoh genthei lakai a sah dia Ezrahite mipa Heman in lalamkai pa henga dia alabol.  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, eihuhhing'a ka Pathen Elohim, sunleh nangma kakou in, jan leh nakom kahin nailut ji e.   
\p
\v 2 Tun kakouna neijah peh'in lang katona neisan peh'in.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu kahin khohi boina adim in, thinan eikainai chehcheh e.   
\p
\v 4 Athisa bang bep kahitai, mithahat tah khat athahat na bei nungsang bep kahitai.   
\p
\v 5 Amahon mithi lah'a eidalha uvin lhan ah mithi lup'in kalum e. Keima hi suhmil in kaum tai, nami kaihoina a kon in eiki lamang tai.   
\p
\v 6 Nang in kotong noinung pen athim pen ah neison lha e.   
\p
\v 7 Nalung han na gihtah chun eidelphan, hichu twi kinong bangin akinong'in eichup tai.   
\p
\v 8 Keima hi doumah in neisem in kagol kapai ho neidelmang peh gamtai. Keima hi thang'ah ka-oh in kitoldoh theilouvin kaum e.   
\p
\v 9 Kamit lhin kamit achupmin kho muthei louvin kaum e. O Yahweh Pakai niseh'in na panpina kathum in nami lungsetna ngaichan kakhut teni kahin sange.   
\p
\v 10 Nathil kidang bol hohi mithi dinga phachom ding hinam? Mithi hungthodoh a nathangvah theiding hinam?   
\p
\v 11 Lhankhuh a kon in amahon nami ngailutna longlou hi ahin phongdoh theina diuvem? Suhmangna mun'a umhon nakitah nahi aphongdoh theina diuvem?   
\p
\v 12 Muthim'in nathilbol kidang hohi aseiphong nadiuvem? Thil suhmil delna gama umhon na chonphat na hochu aseiphong theina diuvem?   
\p
\v 13 O Yahweh Pakai nangma kakouve, niseh-a nakom a katao jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 O Yahweh Pakai, ibolla kei nei paidoh hitam? Ibol a kei a kon a naki heimang hitam?   
\p
\v 15 Kakhang don lai a pat a, kanatna hin thina komcha eina lhutsa ahitan, nagim neina masanga hin thabei leh lungkham tah'in kading e.   
\p
\v 16 Nalunghan na tijat umtah chun eilonvuh'in, tijat naumna chun eithabei sah e.   
\p
\v 17 Hiche hochun sun nilhum in twisoh bangin kavel a eilon khum un ahi. Muthimhi kakinai pipen kagol in apang un ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Nang man ka mite le ka ngailut cheng neilahpeh tai, Thimjing hi kaki naipi pen ka loi chu ahi tai.   
\c 89  
\s1 Akitepna Asem Jeh'in Elohim Pathen Thangvah In Umhen  
\s1 Ezrahite mipa Ethan labol  
\p
\v 1 Keiman Yahweh Pakai mingailutna longlou thuhi vahchoilan sajing tange, khangdong hole tehse hon nakitahna hi ajauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nami ngailutna longlou hi itih hijongleh umjing ding ahi. Nakitah nahi vanho bangin aumjinge.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai in hitin asei e “kalhendoh kasohpa David toh kitepna kanabol ahi. Hiche kitepna a hi kana kihahsel ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Keiman nachilhahte chu lenga katun jingding ahi. Amaho nalaltouna a chu tuapat tonsot gei a toujingdiu ahi.”   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai van mite jousen nakidan nahohi navahchoi diu ahi. Nakitahna ho jeh'a hi simjoulou vantilten navahchoi diu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ajeh chu van gam a umho jouse koipen tah hi Yahweh Pakai toh tekah thei umbeh am? Vantil thupipen ho jengjong Yahweh Pakai toh tekah pithei um'am?   
\p
\v 7 Vantil thaneipen hojong Elohim Pathen ang'a kithing thinga ahibouve. Amahi alaltouna vel a dingho jousen jong agimnei na aphapouve.   
\p
\v 8 O Yahweh Pakai hatchungnung sepai ho! Hoilai mun a nang tobanga thanei a umbeh am Yahweh Pakai? Nanghi kitahna lhingset nahi.   
\p
\v 9 Twikhanglen jong nathanei na noia umma ahi. Nangin huipi le twipi kithoa twi kinong jong nasutang'in,   
\p
\v 10 twikhanglen'a um sa lenpen hojong na sugep in, Naban thahat in nagal mite jong nahocheh jitai.   
\p
\v 11 Vanho jouse jong nanga ahin, leiset jong nanga ahi, vannoi a um thiljouse jong aboncha nanga ahin nangin nasem ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Nangin sahlang lhanglang jong nasem ahin, Tabor Mol leh Hermon mol'in jong naming athangvah ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Nabantha hi iti hat hitam! Nakhut hi iti hat hitam! Najetlang jonghi nathahat loupitah'in adomsange.   
\p
\v 14 Chonphat nale thudih chu nalaltouna khombul ahi. Longlou ngailutna le kitahna chu nalhachate bangin na ang sungah avahlen ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Elohim Pathen houna dinga kipa umtah kouna jaho chu anunnom ahiuve, ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai amahohi na umpina vah a chu lhalediu ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Naminthan na kidangtah hohi amahon nilhum kei keija akipapi diu ahi. Amahon nachon phatna hi akithang atpiu vin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Nangma hi amaho dinga thahatna loupitah chu nahi. Keiho thahat sah dinghi nangma kipana ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Ahi, keiho hoidohna hi Yahweh Pakai a kon ahi. Chuleh Israel Elohim Pathen hin lengjong eipeh u ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Masang lai in kitah tah a nangma jui namipite lah-a gaothu nana seijin ahi. Nangin nasei in, Keiman galsat ding kanalhengdoh'in keiman milhamho lah a kona lengding jong kanalhendoh ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Keiman kasoh David kana mudoh'in chuleh kathaotheng kana nun ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Keiman kakhut a kana dindoh sah a, kaban thahatna kahatdoh sahding ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Agal miten ajoloudiu ahilouleh miphalou honjong athajou loudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Keiman akidoupi hohi amasang tah a kasuhlhuh ding ahin chuleh ama douho jouse jong kasuhmang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Kakitahna leh kangailutna longlou hin aumpi jingding kathuneina jalla amahi atha kahatsah jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Keiman twikhanglen chunga jong athaneina kalhunlut ding vadungho chung jenga jong vai ahomding ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Chutengleh aman eihin kou intin, “Nangma kapa nahin ka Pathen Elohim, kasongpi le kasochatna nahi” atiding ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Keiman Amahi kachapa masapen, leiset chunga leng thaneipen kahisah ding,   
\p
\v 28 Kangailut ding chuleh tonsot gei a kakhoto ding, amatoh kaki tepna hi angahtih umlouding ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Keiman ama dinga ason apah ho kahoibit pehding, vangam'a nikhon beitih aneilou banga alaltounan jong beitih aneilouding ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Ahinlah achilhahten kathuhil hohi apaidoh uva, kachedan hi ajuilou uva,   
\p
\v 31 ka Dan semhohi anit lou uva chuleh kathupeh hi angailou uleh,   
\p
\v 32 keiman achonsetnao chunga gambol na mol kalap ding, chuleh athungailou naojeh-a kavoh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Hijeng jongle kangailutna chu beideh louding kakitepna jong achunga kasuhmil deh louding ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Ahipoi, kakitepna chu kasuhkeh louding ahi; keiman kana seidoh saho chu changkhat jong kanung lahdoh louding ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Keiman David kommah kihahselna khat kana nei in chule atheng kahi jeh in jou seiponge.   
\p
\v 36 Ama chilhahte itihchan hijongleh chelha jingding alenggam jong nisa banga chelhumding ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Vantham jolla kahettohsah nachu lhavah banga kikheltih aneitah louding ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Ahinlah nangin tuhin amachu nakahdoh tan chuleh napaidoh tai. Tuhin Nangma nathaonu lengpa chungah nalunghang tan,   
\p
\v 39 nangin Ama toh nakitepna napaidohtan, nangin alal lukhuh jong vutvai lah-a nasep lhatai.   
\p
\v 40 Nangin akhopiu bangho navohlhah pehtan chuleh akulpiu jong khogem nasodohsah ahitai.   
\p
\v 41 Koi hileh ahin hopa jousen athilkeu u akichomgam hellun aheng akomho jousen anuisat'un ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Nangin agal miteu galjona namusahin, abonchauvin nakipasah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Nangin agal manchah u manmo naso'in chuleh galmunnah gal nalelsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Nangin aleng tenggol nalahpehin chuleh alaltouna tolsenan naneipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 45 Nangin aphat achang louvin natehset sah'in chuleh jumthet in nalhan ahi.   
\p
\v 46 Yahweh Pakai nangma hi hitiahi kisel jing jingding nahi hitam? Ichangei nalunghanna meikong jing jeng dingham?   
\p
\v 47 Kahinkho hi itihchom a hitam geldoh'in, keihohi thitei dinga neisem'u ahi ti geldoh'in!   
\p
\v 48 Mihing koihi athi theilou ding um'am? Mihem koipen ham lhan a kon a ahoidohthei dingah?   
\p
\v 49 Yahweh Pakai tumasanga neingailutnau chu ahet theina mudohthei ipi umam? David komma nakitepna hohi hoilang geija hitam?   
\p
\v 50 Nasohpa keimahi ichan gei a jumna kato hitam? Hiche nangma hedohlou mitehin eisapsetnau ichan gei a kathoh hitam?   
\p
\v 51 O Yahweh Pakai nadeilhen nalengpa hi nangma dou miten nahsah loutah'in abollun ahi! Achena chan a asujum un ahi.   
\p
\v 52 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah in umjing jenghen! Amen, Amen!   
\c 90  
\s1 BU LINA  
\s1 Nam Mite Dinga Mose Taona  
\s1 Elohim Pathen mipa Mose taona  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai, akhang khanga nangmahi kachennao inn nahijenge!   
\p
\v 2 Moul le lhang ho pen masang, vannoi le leiset hi natundoh masangin, thiljoue kipat a pat ajo na chen in jong, nang ma Elohim Pathen nahijing e.   
\p
\v 3 Nangin mihemhi anahina masa-a kile kitding'in nasollin leivui nalesosah kitjin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nangdin Kum sangkhat jeng jonghi achejing tunikho bangbep ahin, jan phat chomcha tobang bou ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Nangin twisoh bangin neilhohmang jiuvin mang sangin asot jodeh poi. Keihohi hampa jingkah langa hung pahdoh tobang bou kahiuve.   
\p
\v 6 Hichu akhangdoh loijin ahinla nilhah langle agop lhajin athijitai.   
\p
\v 7 Keihohi nangma lunghan nan eisumang jitauvin chuleh nalung satnan eikichatsah'un ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Nangin kachonsetnao namasangah natahlang jin ahi, aguh a kachonset nauhi nakilandoh sahjin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Nalungsat na noi a higjing kahinkhou ahin, kakumkhou jong lungsat nan abeiloi jitai.   
\p
\v 10 Kei hohi kum 70 hingding bep kahiuvin, kahat tah'uleh kum 80 bep hingding kahiuve, ahinla hiche sunga chun natna le boina bou ahin; amang loiji taovin, chule keiho kaleng mang taove.   
\p
\v 11 Nalunghanna thahat koiham ahe thei dingah? Naging a nalungsat khohje gelkhoh a koi ham?   
\p
\v 12 Kachih theina diuvin kahinkhou chomdan hi neihetsah taovin.   
\p
\v 13 O Yahweh Pakai, kaheng lam uva hung kile kit tan! Itihchan neikho ngai diu hitam?   
\p
\v 14 Jingkah seh le nalungset longlou chun kalungthim kipasah in, chutile kahinkhou lhumkei a navah choi la kasha jing diu ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hesoh genthei kana thoh hou chuga kon in lunglhai na themkhat beh nei peu vin! Kakhoisat nao kumho jong kipana neisoh doh peh un.   
\p
\v 16 Nasohte hi nathilbol kidangtah hochu neimusah'un; kachilhah teuvin nathaneina loupitah chu mu uhen.   
\p
\v 17 Chuteng Yahweh Pakai ka Pathen Elohim un namalsom nauchu eimu sah uhen lang katohna jouseuvah lolhinna eipetao hen. Henge, katoh gao neiso peh un.   
\c 91  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Venbitna Noiya Um Ding  
\p
\v 1 Chungnungpen cholngah na noi a um chan chun hatchungnung lhalim noi a choldo na amu ding ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai chungchang a hiche hi kaphong e: Ama bou eivengbit ahin, kahoidam na mun ahi; Amachu ka Pathen Elohim ahin, keiman ama katah san e.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu aman thangkol jouse a kon in nahuh doh intin thinathei hivei hoa kon a nahuhdohding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Aman alhavinga nale khu ding ahi. A lhalim noi a nahoidoh ding ahi. Kitah tah a akihahsel naho chu nading a galvon le ompho ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Jan a misu lung linglao ho kichat dan, sun lai a thalchang leng le ho jong kichat dan.   
\p
\v 6 Jan noi a donthah nantna hivei gimnei tah ho kichat dan, sun lai a nadelkhum hesoh na jong kicha hih in.   
\p
\v 7 Nasih langa sangkhat lhu henlang, navel a sangsom thijongle, hiche boina hon nangma natoh khah lou ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Namit hah in lang vejeng in, itilom a migilou te chung a got na lhung hitam?   
\p
\v 9 Nangin Yahweh Pakai chu napanpi ding a nakisem le, Yahweh Pakai chu nahuhdoh ding a nakigon ahi le,   
\p
\v 10 Setna imachan najo lou ding ahi; natna hivei khatchan jong na inn ahinphah louding ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Chuteng le Elohim Pathen in navale nachan a navengbit din avantilte thu pen tai.   
\p
\v 12 Nakeng chu songa nakisuhkhah louna dinga vantilten akhut uva nadopdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Nangin keipi bahkai ho nasuh goi a; gul hang ho chuleh gunei gul ho nalhonat gamding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai in hitin ati, “keima eingailu ho kahuh hing ding ahi. Kamin a tahsan na nei ho chu kahoi dam ding ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Amahon eihin kouteng uleh keiman kadonbut ding chuleh hahsatna ato tengu leh keiman kaumpi ding ahi, keiman amaho chu kahuhdoh a jabolna kachan sah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Keiman hinkho sotna kapehding chuleh kavenbit jingdiu ahi” ati.   
\c 92  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Hi Vahchoi Dia Lom Ahi  
\s1 Sabbath nikhoa sah ding la  
\p
\v 1 Thangvah na Yahweh Pakai peh a, chung nungpen vah choi ding hi thil pha ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Jingkah le nami ngailut na longlou sap phong a, nilhah le nakitah na sap phong hi thil pha ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Tumging jangsom to tho a lyre gin ngai tah to tho dia pha tah ahi.   
\p
\v 4 O Yahweh Pakai nei bol peh thil loupitah hochun kalung lai atong kha in, natohdoh ho jehchun keiman kipa la kasan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai nanatohdoh hohi iti loupi hitam! nalunggel ngeito ho jong iti gil a gil jeng hitam.   
\p
\v 6 Mihem mai mai het jou hoi ahipon, chih na a lhasam hon jong hedoh jou pouvin te.   
\p
\v 7 Migilou hochu hamhing bangin khangtou'un tin, thilse bolho chu pungthei jong leu, tonsot a suhmanga umdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hinla Yahweh Pakai, nangma vang, tonsot a dopsang a naum jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Namel ma te jouse mangthah tei diu ahi; chule gitlou na bol jouse suh chat vai a um diu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Nangin keimahi bongchal bangin neihatdoh sahtan, chuleh nangin kipanan neimalsom tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Kamit hin kagal mite lhuh amun; kana kol in jong eidou a migiloute gallel na thu ajai.   
\p
\v 12 Michonphate chu chahthing bangin khangtou untin, Lebanon a Cedar thing banga hat tah khangtoudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Amahohi Yahweh Pakai inn a kehdoh thingphung likeh ahiuvin, iPathen'u Elohim angsung a khangtouva ahiuve,   
\p
\v 14 Teh nung jeng a jong ga aso nalai diu; chuleh phattin'a noujingleh hatjing diu ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Amahon aphon doh uva hitia hi asei diu ahi, “Yahweh Pakai chu adih jingin! Amachu kasong pi ahi! Ama a chun set na aumpoi!”   
\c 93  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Vaihomna  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai hi lengpa ahi! Ama loupi na in a kivon e. Hiti chun Yahweh Pakai chu loupi na le hat nan akivon e. Leiset hi ading det in suh ling hoi ahipoi.   
\p
\v 2 O Yahweh Pakai nalaltouna chu phat kisim masang a pat a umsa ahitai. Nangma jeng jong phat kipat masanga aumjingsa nahitai.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai twikhanglen akikhan tou e. Twisoh hi van gin abang tai; twisoh in gih tah in akinon sah e.   
\p
\v 4 Hinlah twikhanglen kinong ging dem dum sang a nasa jo le, twipi pang a twinong kivoging sang in jong Yahweh Pakai thilbol thei na anasa joi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai na Dan thu sem hohin kikhel tih anei poi. Navai hop na jong Yahweh Pakai, tonsot a theng jing jeng ding ahi.   
\c 94  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai in Amite Dinga Phu Alah Ding  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, phulaji Elohim Pathen, O phula ji Elohim Pathen nathutanna dihtah chu loupitah chu hung kilang doh hen.   
\p
\v 2 Hungthou doh in, vainoi thutan pa. Mi kiletsah hochu achanding dol u chansah in!   
\p
\v 3 Miphalou hohi itih chanpi kipah diuham, ichan gei in em Yahweh Pakai?   
\p
\v 4 Itih chan kiletsah tah a thu asei diu ham? Hiche migilou hohi itih chanpi kihatsah diu ham?   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai amahon namite asuchip gamtauve. Nangma mite hohi amahon asugenthei'un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Amahon meithai hole gamdang mi chule chaga ho athat gam un ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Amahon asei un, “Yahweh Pakai in eive pouve chule, Israel Elohim Pathen in anasah poi.”   
\p
\v 8 Kigel pha kit un, mingol ho! Itihleh tahle nahin hethei diuvem?   
\p
\v 9 Na nakol sempa chu a nangong ham? Namit sempau chu amitcho a ham?   
\p
\v 10 Aman chitin namtinte ana engbol in ahi, nangjong na engbol louding ham? Aman imajouse ahesoh kei in ahi, nangin ipi naboljong ahetsohkei louding ham?   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai in mitin lunggel ahesoh kei e, imacha phatchomna neilou ahi ahesoh kei e.   
\p
\v 12 Yahweh Pakai, nadanthu a nahil hole nasuhdih ho chu iti kipah u hitam?   
\p
\v 13 Migilou te kimat nading leiko tong akilai kah sen nangman amaho chu boina akon in lung ol na nape e.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai in amite nungsun ponte; Aman ami deitumte donlou in koi ponte.   
\p
\v 15 Thutan na mun a thudih kimu ding chuleh michonpha ho jousen apanhu diu ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Gitlou na akon a koiham eidal ding? Miphalou ho masang a ei din peh ding koi ham?   
\p
\v 17 Yahweh Pakai in eina kithopi lou hile, keima thina lhankhuh mun a thipchet a ana kicholdo tading kahi.   
\p
\v 18 “Keima kalhutai” tin kakap jah in, O Yahweh Pakai nami ngailutna longlou chun eiphong dingin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Keima lungdon na a kadim teng, nami lungmon nachun kinep nale kipa na eipe ji e.   
\p
\v 20 Dandih lou a natong lamkai ho chun Yahweh Pakai kalang a pangding hi ati ngam nadiu vem?   
\p
\v 21 Themmo nabei ho dou din amaho akipun khom un mona neilou chungah thina chan in athepmo sah uve.   
\p
\v 22 Ahin Yahweh Pakai, ka Pathen Elohim hi kakisel na songpi kakulpi chu ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Elohim Pathen in migiloute achonset nau chu ale thuh ding ahi. Achonset nau jeh a asuh gam ding ahi. Yahweh Pakai, iPathen uvin asuh gam ding u ahi.   
\c 95  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Vahchoi Dia Nagilut Kouna  
\p
\v 1 Hungun, Yahweh Pakai vahchoiyu te! Eihuhdoh uva Elohim Pathen ah kipah tah'in vahchoila sau te!   
\p
\v 2 Thangvah pum in a angsung jon u hite. Avahchoina la sau te.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai chu loupitah Pathen Elohim ahin, pathen dang chung a leng loupi ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Mollen penle leiset laigil athuhlai abon'a Aman akhut a atuhchah ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Twikhanglen hi Ama a ahi, ajeh chu Ama sem ahi. Ama khut in leigo jonghi asem ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hungun, eisempau Yahweh Pakai angsungah dilsu-u hitin ama hou u te,   
\p
\v 7 ajeh chu Ama iPathen'u ahin, eihohi aman achinjing amite ihiuvin akaihoijing akelngoihon ihiuve.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in asei e, “Israelten gamthipnoi masah a abol bangu leh Meribah a alungtah bang bangun nalung tahsah hih'un.   
\p
\v 9 Ajeh chu hilai munna chun napu napateuvin kathilbol ho chengse hi amu uvin chule eipatep'un ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Kum somli sunga hin keima achung uva kana lunghang'in chuleh Keiman kasei in ahi, ‘amahohi keija kon a kinung heidoh mipi chu ahiuvin, keiman kasei dungjui a chon nomlou ahiuve.’   
\p
\v 11 Hijeh chun kalunghan jehin kana kihahsel'in: ‘amahohi kachol ngahna munna hunglut theilou heldiu ahi!’”   
\c 96  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Din Lathah La Sauvin  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai kom ah lathah sauvin! Leiset pumpin Yahweh Pakai vahchoila sauvin!   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai vahchoila sauvin amin thangvah un. Ami huhhingna kipa umtah chu niseh'in samphongin.   
\p
\v 3 Chitin namtin holah a athilbol kidangtah hohi samphong'in, Aman thil loupi tahtah abol hohi mijouse seipeh'un.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai hi aloupi e! Amahi vahchoi dinga lompen ahi! Amahi pathen jouse sanga kichat umpentah ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Chidang namdang ho pathen hohi semthu pathen ngen ahiuve hinla Yahweh Pakai hin vanho asem ahi!   
\p
\v 6 Gin na le jana-in aumkimvel ahi, thahatna le melhoina hin muntheng alosoh ahi.   
\p
\v 7 O chitin namtin vannoi mite ho, Yahweh Pakai hethem un Yahweh Pakai ahat nale aloupina hohi hethem un.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai chu achan dinga lomtah loupi nale jana chan sah'un! Nathilpeh ding kichoiyin lang a-angsunga lut in.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai chu athenna loupina vah chutoh kitohin chibai boh'un. Vannoi leiset pumpi hi a-angsungah kithing jenghen.   
\p
\v 10 Chitin namtin hi seipeh un, “Yahweh Pakai in vai ahom e!” Vannoi hi adingdetna ahitan holingbut ahitapon ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Vanho kipah hen chuleh vannoi leiset kipah-u hen! Twikhanglen leh asunga um jousen thangvah'un.   
\p
\v 12 Loujao holeh asunga kehho jouse jong kipahtah in hung gadoh sohkei uhen, gammang sunga thingphungho jousen jong   
\p
\v 13 Yahweh Pakai angsungah thangvah la sauhen, ajeh chu Ama ahungtai! Leiset chungthu tan dingin ahunge. Aman vannoi mite le chitin namtinhi kitahna-a achungthu atanding ahi.   
\c 97  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Thaneina Le Alengvaipoh  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai hi leng ahi! Vannoi mite kipah hen! Twikhanglen akimvelle agamla penna um miho jong kipah uhen.   
\p
\v 2 Amahi meilhang thim in atomin, chonphatna le thudih chu alaltouna khombul ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Amasang ah meikong aleng'in akidoupi ho ahallih gamin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Akolphe vah in vannoi leiset asalvah'in ahi. Leiset in amun akithing thingin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Molle lhangjong Yahweh Pakai masanga khoilu bangin ajunlha jengin ahi. Leiset pumpi Yahweh Pakai masanga hitiahi thil soh-a ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Vanhon adih nale akitahna aphongdoh'in namtin'in aloupina amu'uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Milim semthu doihou ho jouse, pannabei semthu pathen kiletsahpi hojouse jumle jachat athoh'un ahi, ajeh chu semthu pathen hojouse a-anga kun teidiu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Jerusalem in ajauvin akipah un chuleh Judah khopiho jouse jong athanom'un ahi. Ajeh chu O Yahweh Pakai nangma thudih nahi.   
\p
\v 9 Nangma hi O Yahweh Pakai vannoi leisetna athupipen nahin, semthu pathen ho jouse chunga dopsang'in naumin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Nangho Yahweh Pakai ngailuhon thilse nahot bollun ahi. Aman ami chonphate ahinkho-u ahuhdohjin ahi, chuleh miphalouho thaneina a konnin ahuhdohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Michonpha ho vah-in asalvah'in, chuleh milungdih ho akipah jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Koi hileh michonpha ho jouse kipah henlang amintheng chu thangvah'u hen!   
\c 98  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Adihna Vahchoina  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai ah lathah sauvin, ajeh chu Aman thil kidangtah tah aboldoh tai. Aban jet in gal nasatah ajou tai; Aban thengin huhhingna thahat amusah e.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in galjona aphongdoh tai, chuleh adihna leh akitahna chitin namtin lah a aphongjal tai.   
\p
\v 3 Aman Israelte dinga ngailutna le kitahna nei a akitep nachu ageldoh'in ahi. Leiset kolmang gei in jong iPathen'u Elohim galjona hi amudoh tauve.   
\p
\v 4 Leiset mihemten Yahweh Pakai ah kho sam'un; thangvahna bunglhauvin kipah tah'in thangvah la sauvin!   
\p
\v 5 Tumging toh thon Yahweh Pakai vahchoi la sauvin, tumging tothon langai chu sauvin.   
\p
\v 6 Sumkon toh kelngoi ki gin kithong tohthon iPakai u Yahweh le ilengpau masanga chohjejun la sauvin.   
\p
\v 7 Twikhanglen leh asunga um jousen athangvahna samphongun! Leiset chunga hinna nei jousen jom un.   
\p
\v 8 Vadung jousen kipah'in akhut beng uhen! Thinglhang gam jousen kipah'in la sauhen,   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai masangah. Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai chu leiset chung thu tandinga hungding ahi. Vannoi hi thudih a athu atanding chitin namtin thuhi dihtah a atanding ahi.   
\c 99  
\s1 Zion Dinga Yahweh Pakai Kitahna  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai hi leng ahi! Chitin namtin kithing thingjeng hen! Ama Cherubim teni kikah a laltouna a atouvin ahi. Vannoi leiset pumpi kithing hen.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai chu Jerusalem ah loupitah'in atouvin ahi. Chitin namtin ho jouse chung vum a dopsang'in aum e.   
\p
\v 3 Amahon namin gimneitah chu thangvah uhen, naminhi athenge!   
\p
\v 4 Lengloupi thudih ngailua, nangin thildih hi nadomsang'in, thudih in kal nasong'in Israel lah-a thudih nachelhah sah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai iPathen'u Elohim hi dopsangin umhen! A-ang sungah bohkhup un, ajeh chu Amahi atheng ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Mose le Aaron jongchu thempu ahilhon e, Samuel injong Amin anakouve. Amahon Yahweh Pakai kom ah panpi ngaichan anakouvun ahi, chuleh Aman anahouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Aman meilom lah a kon in Israel ho lah-a thu anasei in, amahon Yahweh Pakai in apeh-u Dan le thupeh hochu anajui un ahi.   
\p
\v 8 O Yahweh Pakai ka Pathen'u Elohim! nangin amaho nana donbut in ahi. Nangma hi amaho ding a mi ngaidam jing Elohim Pathen nahi, ahinla amaho achekhel teng uleh nagim boljin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai, iPathen'u Elohim hi domsang'un chuleh Jerusalem a moltheng achun chibai boh'un ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai, iPathen'u Elohim hi atheng ahi.   
\c 100  
\s1 Thangvahna Le Tikhouna La  
\s1 Thangvah na la  
\p
\v 1 Leiset pumpin Yahweh Pakai a kipana samphong'un,   
\p
\v 2 kipah tah'in Yahweh Pakai chu chibai boh'un vahchoila sapum pumin a-angah hungun   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai, Elohim Pathen ahi tin hettohna phongdohun, Aman eisem uva eiho Ama a ihiu ahi. Eiho Ama mite ihiu vin a-an a kivah akelngoite ihiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Thangvah pum in akulpi sungah lut un, vahchoi pum in ainsungah lut in, Akom a kipa thu sei un, amin thangvah'un.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai phatna jehchun, ami ngailutna longlou hi tonsot in aumjinge, chuleh akitah nahi akhang khangin aumjinge   
\c 101  
\s1 Lamdih'a Hinkho Manna Dia David Taona  
\s1 David labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai keiman nami ngailutnale nathudihna lan sange. Keiman nangma thangvah nahi lan sange.   
\p
\v 2 Keiman monabei hinkho kaman theina dingin chingthei tah in um inge, itihleh eipanpi dinga nahungding hitam? Keiman ka insungah kitahna hinkho kaman jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Keiman ipi hijongleh athenglou chuleh vet hoilou ho veponge. Thil adihlouva kitongho jouse kathet ahi, hichengse hitoh kaki timat louhel ding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Keiman dei umlou thil ho jouse hi kapaidoh sohkei ding thilgilou hojousea kon a kakidalse ding ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Aheng akom aseiseho jouse kadeplou helding ahi. Keiman akiphatsei leh akiletsah ho kadeplou ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman tahsan um miho kaholdoh ding amaho chu kakivoppi ding ahi. Koi hileh oimothei hilou miho bouchu kakivoppi ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Keiman milepche ho ka insunga kamanchah louding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Aniseh'a katohding chu mi jonchih ho deldohding chuleh khopi hi hitiho tobanga konna hoidoh sahding hi kakin ahi.   
\c 102  
\s1 Gim Le Hesoh Pet'a Taona  
\s1 Boina hahsat nan atom mikhat in taona a Elohim Pathen heng alhut  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai kataona ngai in! Ka ngeh nahi neisanpeh in.   
\p
\v 2 Kei a kon in kiheimang hih'in, kahahsat phatleh khohsah tah'in neingaipeh in, kangaichat phatleh neihin gelkhoh in,   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu kahinkho hi meikhu bangin abeipai jitai, kagu kachang hi asadohji tai.   
\p
\v 4 Kalungsung hi anadohjin hamhing bangin agolha jitai, chutengle chun kagilkel jong abeipaiji tai.   
\p
\v 5 Ajeh chu lunggim a kakhoisat sat jeh'in kavun le kagu hobou kahitai.   
\p
\v 6 Keima neldi gam a sumbupi toh kabangtai, gamlatah gamthip gam a sumbupi noutoh kabangtai.   
\p
\v 7 Keima kahah khovahjin, inting vumma vacha changkhat seh lunghel tah-a um kabange.   
\p
\v 8 Kagal miten sun nilhum in eitaitom jingun, amahon eisamseuvin eitaitom jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Keima buneh jong vutvai jeng ahitai. Kadon na sunga jong kamitlhi alonglut tai.   
\p
\v 10 Nalunghan na le nagimbol nachun eidom sang in eipaidoh tai.   
\p
\v 11 Kahinkho hi nilhah lang nilep bangin achemang loijitai. Keima hampa bangin kagop lhaloi jitai.   
\p
\v 12 Ahinla Yahweh Pakai nangvang nalaltouna a natoujing ding ahi. Naminthan na akhang khanga chelhajing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Nangma hung kipat in natin Jerusalem hi nahin khoto ding ahi. Tuahi nangnam na khohsah phat ahin, tuhi na kitepna dungjui a mi kithopi phat ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Ajeh chu namiten bang'a song jouse angailu uvin chuleh lamlenna vutvai hojeng jong angaisang'un ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Chujouteng leh chitin namtin ten Yahweh Pakai ang-a kithing thingding ahi,   
\p
\v 16 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in Jerusalem ahin thahsem kitding chutengle Ama aloupina-a hung kilang ding,   
\p
\v 17 Aman tahlelte taona ahin sanding Aman angaichat hou asanpehding ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Khonunga khangthahho dinga kijihlut pehding hitiachu tua pengloulai hon Yahweh Pakai chu ahin thangvah dingu ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Yahweh Pakai in van muntheng a kon a ahin vetsuh ding, Aman van a kon a leiset hi ahin vetsuh ding   
\p
\v 20 songkul tangte khoisatna ajahding thidinga themmo kichanho alha doh dinga,   
\p
\v 21 hiteng chuleh Yahweh Pakai minthanna chu Zion a lopna umding, chule Jerusalem a kithangvah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Mihonpi tamtah chu ahung ki khopkhom teng leh leng gam hojouse chu Yahweh Pakai chibai boh a hungdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Aman kaban thahat akim laitah avolhun kahinkho asuchomtai.   
\p
\v 24 Hinla keiman Ama kakouvin, Oh Yahweh Pakai tonsot a hingjing kakhandon laitah ahin kahinkho lahih'in.   
\p
\v 25 Kum tamtah achetai, nangin hiche leiset leibul nana lhungdoh'in, vanhohi nakhut tah'in nanasemdoh in,   
\p
\v 26 hihojouse hung mangthah ding ahinlah nang tonsotna nahinjing ding ahi, amaho ponlui bangin hungvui lhantin, Nangin amaho chu von banga nakhelding chujouteng napai mangdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Hinla Yahweh Pakai nangvang abang chu nahijingin ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Nangma mite chate jouse lungmong a umdiu ahi. Achate chateho chu na-anga hung khanglen diu ahi.   
\c 103  
\s1 Yahweh Pakaiya Kon Phatchomna Jeh'a David In Avahchoi  
\s1 David labol  
\p
\v 1 Kahinaho jouse pum'in Yahweh Pakai chu thagvah ingkate. Kalungthim pumpin amintheng choian inge.   
\p
\v 2 Kahinaho jouse pum'in Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah ingkate. Keidinga thilpha eibolpeh ho itihchan hijongleh sumil ponge.   
\p
\v 3 Aman kachonsetna jouse angaidam tai, chuleh kadam mona hojouse le kahivei hojouse eiboldam pehtai.   
\p
\v 4 Aman kathina dinga kon in eihuhdohtai chuleh ngailutna leh khotona dimset in eiphungvuh tai.   
\p
\v 5 Aman kahinkho hi thilpha dimset in eiphungvuh tai, Muvanlai bangin kakhandon hinkho akiledohsah tai!   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai in chonphatna leh dihna chu suhgenthei a umte chu amusah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Aman ahina tahbeh chu Mose kom ah anatahlang'in chuleh anatoh hochu Israel mipite lah-a anaphongdoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai hi mikhoto them tahleh mihepi themtah lunghang vahlou chuleh longlou ngailutna a dimset ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Amahin phat tinnin eithepmosah pouvintin ahilouleh lunghang jingjeng ponte.   
\p
\v 10 Aman ichonset nauva jong ei engbol pouvintin chuleh Aman eiho chanding dol hotbolna jong einei pouvinte.   
\p
\v 11 Ama gingte chunga angailutna tanglou hi leiset chunga van asan banga hi sanga ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Aman eiho chonset nahi, solam le lhumlam akigam lhat bangin gamlatah in atolmang tai.   
\p
\v 13 Yahweh Pakai hi chapangte dinga apauva panga ahin, ama gingte dinga khoto them tahle ngailutna dimset ahijing e.   
\p
\v 14 Ajeh chu Aman ihatmonau eihet thempeh'un chuleh eihohi vutvai tobang bou ihiu ageldoh jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Leiset chunga ihinkho hou jong hampa bangbep ahin, gam pahcha tobangin ipahdoh'un athi loikitji tai.   
\p
\v 16 Hui ahung nung jin aitih a aumkhlou bang in bep in eimut mang ji taove.   
\p
\v 17 Hinla Yahweh Pakai gingte din vang amingailutna nitin in aumjinge. Ami huhhing nanjong achate chateho gei in,   
\p
\v 18 hitobanga aDan thua kitahna nei ho le, athupeh jui jing ho din aumpeh jing e.   
\p
\v 19 Yahweh Pakai in vanmun hohi alaltouna in asemin; hichea kon in muntin chunga vai ahom e.   
\p
\v 20 Nangho vantilte ho, nangho mithupitahte ho, ana tongdoh a pangho Yahweh Pakai hi thangvah un.   
\p
\v 21 Ahi, nangho vantil sepaite ho alungdeilam boljinga Ama janlea pangjing ho Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un.   
\p
\v 22 Asemsa ho jousen, chuleh alengam a umjousen Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un. Keima kahina jouse pum in Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah jing ing kate.   
\c 104  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai in Athilsemsa Khohsahna Anei  
\p
\v 1 Kahina jouse pum in Yahweh Pakai thangvah inge. O Yahweh Pakai, ka Pathen Elohim, iti lom a nathupi hitam! Nangma, naloupina le nathupina toh nakivon e.   
\p
\v 2 Nangman khovah chu ponsil bangin nakisil in, Nangin vanho ahin ahsi hohi pondal bangin nadahdoh in;   
\p
\v 3 twimei chunga na iin natungdoh in, meilom chu sakol kangtalai in namangin, huihi nalhavingin namangin nalenglen ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Huihi sottol len namangin, meile meikong jong nasoh'in namangin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Nangin, itihchan hijongleh kil ling louhel dingin nangman vannoi leiset bul naphutdoh tai.   
\p
\v 6 Nangin twipi veihi leiset dingin ponsil in nasilpeh'in molsangho jong nachupsah soh hel in ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Nangin thu napehleh twipi chu alengmang jingin, na ogin ajahleh ajammang hel jenge.   
\p
\v 8 Mol ho adingdoh in phaicham atonglha jengin nangin nathupeh bang bangin akijam jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Chujouvin nangin twikhanglen hochu aphah nadiu chanbep naphahsah'in, hitiachu leiset hi avella achupkit louna diuvin nasemtoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Nangin twisamho naphuldoh sah'in kotong dunga nalonlutsah'in, vachaho chu molle lhanga konnin ahung lengsuh'in,   
\p
\v 11 ganhingho jouse dingin twi nasuhmang peh'in ahi, chuleh sangan honjong dangnou nan anei un ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Vacha hon va pang dunga buh akisem un thingbah lah'a la asajiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Nangin navan inmun a kon in molle lhang chunga go nahinjuhsah in chuteng nakhutsoh gachun leiset nasudimjin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Nangin hampa ho nakhandohsah in ganchaho, thingphungho le mihemho manchah pha nasodoh sah'in ahi. Chujongleh nangman leiset chunga amaho dingin nehpha nasodohsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Akipana diuvin adondiu lengpitwi nagonpeh in atahsauva akinu diuvin Olive thao nasosah'in, chule athaneina diuva nehding changlhah napen ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Yahweh Pakai in athingphung hohi phatah'in akhoukhah in, Lebanon ah Cedar thingphung ho akedohsah'in,   
\p
\v 17 hichea chun vachaten abu-u akison un chuleh vakang ten Cypress thing chunga inn akise un ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Molsang chungvum langa gamlah kelho achengun chuleh songpi hochu kollah saho dingin na phatah'in apangin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Nangin lha nasemmin kum kiheichin aphongdoh e, chule nisan alhumding phatjong akihetne.   
\p
\v 20 Nangin janjong nasem in, jan ahunglhung jin ahi, gammang ganchaho anunkho jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Keipi nouhon amatdiu hochu angihjiuvin, Elohim Pathen in apeh'u amaho anchah hochu matdingin agemjiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Jingpitah leh abusung uva kicholdo dingin anungche jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hichejou tengle chun mipiho chu ama ama natohna dingcheh ajon un hicheachun nilhah gei in na atong ji tao ve.   
\p
\v 24 O Yahweh Pakai nangin thilho hi jatchom chom in nasem jinge! Nachihna a hiche hohi nasemdoh ahije. Leiset hi nathilsemsa ho adimset e.   
\p
\v 25 Hiti chun twikhanglen lentah leh kiphahjal tah nasem in, asunga ganhing achatthei alen aneo nasem in ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Ven, kong inneiho akitol un, Leviathan jong twikhanglen'a kichem din nasem e.   
\p
\v 27 Amaho jousen angaichat'u an amunadiu hi ngang chunga kingaicheh ahiuve.   
\p
\v 28 Anehdiu nangin napehteng uleh amahon achomkhom jiuvin nangin nakhut a nalhangdoh in namop jin hiti chun amaho lungna chimset'in navah jin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Ahinla Nang, amahoa konna nakinunghei tengleh amaho kichadiu ahi. Nangin ahinna hu'u nalahdoh tengleh amaho thiding vutvai sohding ahitauve.   
\p
\v 30 Nangin nahu napeh tengleh hinna nasemdohji a, hiteng chuleh leiset maihi akithahsem kitjin ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Yahweh Pakai loupina hi tonsotnin umjing jenghen. Yahweh Pakai in athilsem jousea hin kipana aneiyin ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Leiset hi avetleh akithing jengin molho jonghi akhoi khahleh meikhu alengdoh jengjin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Hinkho kanei laisen Yahweh Pakai vahchoi la sange, kahai hu bei chan geijin jong ka Pathen Elohim thangvah ingkate.   
\p
\v 34 Kalunggel ngaito jouse jonghi Ama lunglhaina hihen, ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai hi kakipana ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Hiche leisetna konhin michonsete jouse mangthah gam jengu hen, miphalou ho jouse mangthah jengu hen. Kahina ho jouse pummin Yahweh Pakai thangvah ingkate, Yahweh Pakai loupina ding hitahen!   
\c 105  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Melchihna Kidang Umna Ding Angeh  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai kom a kipathu sei in aloupina samphong'un. Vannoi leiset mihemte jousen ipi abol ham heuhen,   
\p
\v 2 Aheng a la sauvin; henge avahchoila saovin. Athilbol kidangho hi mijouse seipeh'un,   
\p
\v 3 Amintheng hi domsang'un, nangho Yahweh Pakai chibai bohte jouse kipah'un,   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai athahatna chu kholchil in phattin'in amachu hol'un,   
\p
\v 5 datmo umtah tah atohdoh ho chuleh thilkidang abolho, athupeh eipeh hou,   
\p
\v 6 nangho asoh Abraham chate ho, Jacob chilhah ho alhendoh sate ho, geldoh'un.   
\p
\v 7 Amahi Yahweh Pakai, iPathen'u Elohim ahin, Ama thudih nahi gamsung jousea akimudoh sohkeijin   
\p
\v 8 Amahi akitepna itihchan hijongleh dingjing ahin, khang sangkhat dinga ana kipehdoh na,   
\p
\v 9 Abraham toh anasem kitepna chuleh Issac kom a ana kihahselna,   
\p
\v 10 Aman Jacob kom ah Dan khat apen anasuhdet in, chuleh Israel mipite dinga beithei lou kitepna ana sem in:   
\p
\v 11 “Keiman Canaan gam kapehding nahi, nang dinga jatchombeh'a kapeh natouphadiu gamchu ahi” anati.   
\p
\v 12 Aman hichehi hon lhomcha ahipet'uva, Canaan gama kholjin hon lhomcha ahipet uva anasei ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Amaho namkhat a kon a namkhat, leng gam khatna kona leng gam khat a akholjin pet'uva asei ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Aman koimacha anasuh genthei sahpon ahi. Aman amaho huhnan namdang lengho chu anagih'in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 “Kami lhentum hochu tongkha hih'un, chuleh kathemgao hojong tongkhahih'un,” anati.   
\p
\v 16 Aman nehle chah hochu akhahtan'in Canaan gamah kel analhahsah'in ahi,   
\p
\v 17 hiti chun amaho masanga Egypt gammachun mikhat anasol masan ahi, amaho soh a anajoh Joseph chu ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Amachu akengphang tenia thihkhao avouvin, angongchang'a thihkol a-opeh uve.   
\p
\v 19 Amang lolhinna dinga thil ahung sodoh tokah'in Yahweh Pakai in Joseph chu ahina tahbeh hetdohna dingin ana patepmin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hichejou chun Pharoah'in amachu agakousah'in alhadohtai; Gamsung vaipopan songkul kotchu ahonpeh tai.   
\p
\v 21 Joseph chu lengpa insunga thil jouse chunga vaihom dingin apansahtan ahi. Hiti chun lengpa thil ho jouse chungah vaipon ahung pangtai.   
\p
\v 22 Hiti chun aman adei bang tah in lengpa noi a vaihom pipuiho chu avaihop in chule lengpa thumop lea pang ho chu ahil ji tai.   
\p
\v 23 Hi jouchun Israel chu Egypt gam alhungtan, Jacob chu Ham gamsunga chun gamchom mi hinan ana chengtan ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Yahweh Pakai in Israel mipite chu hapun'in apunsah tan hiti chun agalmite diuvin kichat aumleu tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Hichun Egypt te chu Israelte vetda dingin atildoh tan hijeh chun Yahweh Pakai mite dounan tohgon aneitauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Ahin Elohim Pathen nin asoh Mose chu ahinsol'in aman ana lhendoh Aaron chutoh asolthan ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Amanin Egypt mite dounan melchihna kidangtah chuleh datmo umtah tah Ham gamsunga anatongdoh lhonnin ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Yahweh Pakai in Egypt chu mu anathimsah tan ahi. Ajeh chu amahon Yahweh Pakai thupeh Israelte soldoh dingchu ananom pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Aman twi thisan anasosah'in, ngaho dingin thina thei gu ahitan ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Uphoh honjong agamsung'u alonvuh jengin lengpa lupna dansang jenga jong alhailut jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Yahweh Pakai in thu aseileh thousiho Egypt mite chunga ahung chu'uvin, Egypt gam pumpi thousi vaibong'in alo jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Aman go khel in gel anajuhsah'in, keh in agamsung'u anasepchap jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Aman alengpithei uleh atheichang ujong asuhmangpeh'in athingphung houjong asatchap jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Aman thu aseileh khaokhote ahung kitollutnun khaokho noute jong simsenlou ahung kitollut tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Amahon gamsunga ado eng jouse anechai jengun, loulai a anche louhing jouse jong achaidoh jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Hiche jouchun Aman Egypt te insung jousea chapa tahpen ho aban thapeh'in ahi. Hiti chun aki letsah pipen ule aki panapen hou asuhbei peh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Yahweh Pakai in amite chu sana le dangka dimset pum in Egypt'a kon in ahin puidoh'in, Israel phungho lah'a khat chajong akipallhua aumpouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Egypt miten nana kichat behseh jeh'un apotdoh uchu ana kipapi lheh jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Yahweh Pakai in sunleh meilom akhu khum sah'in janleh meikong in asalvah peh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Amahon sa athum uleh vamim alhalutpeh'in a-oivana diuvin van changlhah mama chu anapen ahi.   
\p
\v 41 Aman songpi chu ahomsah'in twi ahung kiphidoh sah'in gamchai lah'a vadung bangin alondonsah'un ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Ajeh chu Aman asohpa Abraham kom a akitepna atheng chu ageldoh'in,   
\p
\v 43 hijeh chun amite Egypt'a kon in amilhendoh chu kipah tah'in ahin puidoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Aman gamsung mite Elohim Pathen helou chitin namtinte chenna chu alahpeh'in Ama mite hochu apen, hiti chun amahon mi tusa chang ga hochu aki-at'un ahi.   
\p
\v 45 Hitiho jouse anachelhah sahchu amahon a Dan thupeh leh athuhil ho dungjui a achon nadiu adeijeh ahi. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   
\c 106  
\s1 Israel Lungheiya Kisih Chule Elohim Pathen Avahchoi  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen! Elohim Pathen chu aphatna jeh'in thangvahna peuvin.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in thil loupi kidangtah atohdoh hohi kon asim jou ding ham? Kon Amahi ahina bangtah'in athangvah joudem?   
\p
\v 3 Mi ahina bangtah a pachatna pethei holeh phat tin a adih jeng bol hon kipana aneithei jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai nangin namite khotona namusah tengleh neihin geldoh'in lang neihin nai in neihuhdoh'in.   
\p
\v 5 Nalhendoh namite phatthei naboh nahoa keijong chan neineisah'in. Namite kipana a keijong neikipa sah'in. Nagou chang toh nangma thangvah khom kanom e.   
\p
\v 6 Kapu kapateu bangin keiho jong kachonse tauve, keihon kabolkhel tauve, keiho phaloutah'in kanachon tauve,   
\p
\v 7 Egypt gam a ana um kapu kapateu chu Yahweh Pakai in thil kidang aboldoh ho chun atilkhou pouve. Amahon adinguva Yahweh Pakai phatna hochu ana sumil loiji tauve. Amahon twikhanglen san mun nachun Yahweh Pakai dounan ahung phunchel tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Achuti jeng vangun, Amin loupe dopsangna dingleh athaneina thupitah chu akilandohna dingin amaho chu ana huhdoh thouthou jin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Aman twikhanglen sanchu akan-na dingin thu apen, Aman twikhanglen chu neldigam abahsah'in Israelte chu ahinpui galkai in ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hiti chun agalmiteuva kon in anahuhdoh jin, chuleh akidoupihoa kon in ana hoidohsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Twichu akinung ledoh sah'in agalmiteu akhukhum jin khatcha jong anahingdoh pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hitengle chun amiten akitepna chu atahsan jiuvin Ama vahchoina la chu asajiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ahinla Yahweh Pakai in abolpeh houchu gangtah'in asumilji tauvin, Ama thuhil angahji pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Gamthip noi achun amaho tahsa ngaichat thilngen anathum'un hiche gamchai lah'a chun Elohim Pathen chu anapatep'un,   
\p
\v 15 hijeh chun Aman angaichat'u chu anapen ahinlah nat na toh apehthan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Camp sunga umhochu Mose chungah athangthipmun chuleh Yahweh Pakai thempu theng Aaron a-ot'un ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hichejeh chun leiset chu ahung kamkan, Dathan, Abiram leh akiphinho jouse chu anavallhum'in avuimangtan ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Anungjui ho chungah meikong achun miphalou ho jouse chu meikong'in ahalgam tan ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Sinai mol'a sana a kisem bongnou chu chibai aboh'un,   
\p
\v 20 Loupitah Elohim Pathen chu hampane bonglim toh analheh tauve.   
\p
\v 21 Amahon ahuhingpau, Egypt gamma konna ahinpuidoh pau,   
\p
\v 22 Ham gam sunga thil kidang tamtah ahin boldohpeh pau, twikhanglen san na gimneitah thil ana tongdohpa a Pathen'u Elohim chu anasumil tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hijeh chun Aman kasuhmang ding ahi tin anaphongdoh tan ahi. Ahinlah Mose, lhendoh mipa chu Yahweh Pakai leh amipite kikah'a anadingtan, aman Yahweh Pakai kommachun alunghanna'a konna kile heija amipite chu asuhmang louna dingin ataotai.   
\p
\v 24 Mipite chu gam nom lutding chu ana nom tapouvin ahi, ajeh chu Elohim Pathen in ana kitepna banga apuihoi dingchu ana nom tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Ajeh chu akaleh langin achon un, aponbuh sung uvah ana phunchel gam un, Yahweh Pakai thu anangainom pouvin,   
\p
\v 26 hijeh chun Yahweh Pakai chu lunghemtah'in ana kihahsel'in amahohi hiche gamthip noi a kathagam ding ahiuve anatitai.   
\p
\v 27 Chutengleh ason apahteu chu chitin namtin lah'a kathejal sohding, chuleh gamla tah tah'a kaimang'a umdiu ahi ati.   
\p
\v 28 Hiti chun, ipu apateu chu Baal leh Peor chibai bohna a anapang'un, mithi dinga kikatdoh sa jengjong ananeuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Hitiho jehhin amahon Yahweh Pakai chu ana sulang hangun hijeh chun alah uva natset analangtan ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Ahinla Phenehas kitipa chun hangsantah'in nat se chu ana tingtan'in ahileh natset chu atangtai.   
\p
\v 31 Hijeh chun hichea patchun michonpha tin jana anapetauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Meribah-a jong Yahweh Pakai chu ana lunghansah'un hichun Mose chu anasuboi lheh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Amahon Mose chu analunghan sah'un ahileh aman ngolkaitah'in thu anaseilo tan ahi   
\p
\v 34 Israelten chidang namdang hochu Yahweh Pakai in thu anapeh dungjui in anasohjou pouvin,   
\p
\v 35 hichu hilouvin agamsung mite lah'a chun ana chenghal un achonnao phaloutah hochu ana joptauvin,   
\p
\v 36 amilim doi houvu chu anahou un hichun alhuhnao asodohsahtan ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Amahon achateu kisan chu anakatdoh'un chuleh achanuteu jengjong thillha hounan anapedoh'un,   
\p
\v 38 amahon themmona neilou thisan anasouvin, achapateu leh achanuteu thisan chu Canaan mite doi hounan anamang'un tolthanan gamsung chu anasuboh'un,   
\p
\v 39 amahole amaho jong thilgilou bolnan anakisuboh'un adoihou thanopnau chu Yahweh Pakai mitmun jonthanhoi ana hidohtan ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Hichejeh chun Yahweh Pakai lunghanna chu amite chungah anakoudoh jengin ahileh Yahweh Pakai in ama-a tum hochu ana kidah lotan ahi.   
\p
\v 41 Hijeh chun Yahweh Pakai in amaho chu agamsung nammite lah'a chun ana pedoh'in chuleh athet nammiteu chun amaho chungah vai anahomji tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Agalmi houchun asugep jiuvin chuleh abolgimnao khut thahatna noi a anakoiji tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Avel vellin Aman ahuhdohjin, ahinlah amahon Ama dounan akipedohji tauvin ahi, chutengleh amaho chu achonset jeh'un suhmangin aumji tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Ahijeng vangin ahahsat tenguleh Aman akhotokit jiuvin akanao angaipeh kitjitan ahi.   
\p
\v 45 Aman amaho toh akitepnao ahin geldoh kitji in angailutna chultheilou jeh in alung ahinhei kitji in,   
\p
\v 46 Aman ganhing a amanteu khutnah khotona amusah kitji nalaijin ahi.   
\p
\v 47 O Yahweh Pakai, ka Pathen'u Elohim neihuhdoh'un! Chitin namtin lah'a konhin neichomkhom kitnun hitiachu namintheng kathangvah theina diuvin chuleh kipah a nangma kathangvah theina diuvin.   
\p
\v 48 Israel Pathen Elohim, Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un, Amahi tonsot'a pat tonsot geija hingjing Elohim Pathen ahi! Mi jousen “Amen” tiuhen. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   
\c 107  
\s1 BU NGANA  
\s1 Gentheina Kona Yahweh Pakai Mihuhdohna  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai hi aphatjeh'in thangvahna peuvin, Ami ngailutna dihtah hi tonsot'a dettou jing ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in nalhatdoh hitam? Achutileh phongdoh'in! Aman namelma holah'a kon a nahoidohsahhi miho seipeh'in.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu Aman gam tamtah a kon in solamle lhumlam'a kon in, sahlam le lhanglam a kon in sohchangho ahin puikhom'in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Miloi khat hi gamthip gam mah avah mang'un, in le lou beijin avah mang'un,   
\p
\v 5 Gilkil leh dangchah geovin a thiding konchan aum mun,   
\p
\v 6 “Yahweh Pakai neipanpin” tin ahahsat nauva Pakai Yahweh akouvun, chuteng Aman agenthei nauva konnin ahuhdoh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Aman amaho chu bitkei chan apuijin achenna theiju khopi khatna akoiyin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai chu angailutna thupi tah jehleh thil kidang tahtah abolpeh jeh'un thangvahna peuhen.   
\p
\v 9 Ajeh chu Aman adangchah ho adangnou sah'in, agilkil'ho thilpha tamtah tothon a-oiva sahjin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Miloikhat muthim lah athimlah pen a atouvin, lung gimna thihkhao vin ahen oh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Amaho Elohim Pathen thu dounan akiphin un, Elohim Pathen thumop chu anelpeh'un ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hijeh chun Aman amaho chu akhut hamtah in avo lhun, amaho alhuh phatnun koima akithopidiu aumpon ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ahahsat tenguleh Yahweh Pakai akoujiuvin “Yahweh Pakai neipanpin” atiuve. Hitengle chun Aman athohgim nauva kon in ahuhdohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Aman amaho chu muthimleh ahahsatnau thimjin banga thimlah a kon in apui galkaijin akihennao asutlhappeh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Yahweh Pakai chu ami ngailutna thupitah jehleh thil kidangtah tah abolpeh jeh'in thangvah uhen,   
\p
\v 16 ajeh chu Aman sum-eng songkul kotpi avohlhahpeh'in chuleh akihennao thihkhao avohtan pehtan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Mingol themkhat chun boina asemuvin achonset jeh'un thohgimna atoh'un ahi.   
\p
\v 18 An le twi ngaichatnan athohlel lheh'un hiti chun amaho chu athiding kon ahiuve.   
\p
\v 19 “Yahweh Pakai neikithopin” tin ahahsat tenguleh Yahweh Pakai akoujiuvin Aman athohgim nauva kon in ahuhdohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Aman thu changkhat agahseijin aboldamjin, thina kotbul a kon in aloidohtan ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Ami lungsetna thupi tah jehleh amaho dinga thil kidang tamtah anabolpeh jeh'in Yahweh Pakai chu thangvahna peuhen.   
\p
\v 22 Kilhaina gantha pummin thangvahna peuhen, chuleh athilbol kidangtah ho jeh'in thangvahna peuhen.   
\p
\v 23 Mi phabep chu kong innei mangchan twikhanglen'ah vannoi leiset kiveina lampi ajot un akitollun ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Amaho jonghin twikhanglen athuhlang tah'a Yahweh Pakai thuneitah'a anatoh naleh thil thupi tahtah abolna ho amu'vin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Aman thu aseijin hui ahungnung doh'in twikhanglen ahin kinongsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Kong innei hochu vanlanga anuh touvin chule twi thuhlah'a ahung kilehlut kitjin kongtol hochu kichatnan akileh leuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Amaho jukham ho bangin a-onle leuvin kichat tijat nan adim'un ahi.   
\p
\v 28 “Yahweh Pakai neihuh'un” tin ahahsat phatnun Yahweh Pakai akouvun, Amanjong agimnauva kon in ahuhdohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 A-o neochakhat'in hui le guo kithochu athipsah'in chuleh twi kinong jong asutang'in ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Hiche athip theina chu ichan gei a pha a phatthei bohna hitam? Kongchu kong mun'ah bitkeichan apuilut in ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Yahweh Pakai chu angailutna thupitah jehleh thilkidang tamtah abolpeh jeh'un thangvahna peuhen.   
\p
\v 32 Nam lamkaiho masangleh, mipi kikhomho masangah japi hetthei doltah'in thangvahna peuhen.   
\p
\v 33 Aman vadung jong neldigam aso sahjin, twisam putna munho jong gamgo leh adang chahna aso sahjin ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Aman ga phatah sona gam phatah jong ima sodoh louna chitwi-al gamgo asosah thei in ahi, agam sunga cheng mipite phatmo jeh'a hitiachu abolji ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Ahinlah Aman neldigam chu twikul asosah'in, chuleh gamgo jong twi putna mun aso sahjin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Aman gilkel dangchah techu khopi semdoh dinga hiche mun a chu achensah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Amahon aloulai uva muchi kitheuvin tin lengpigui tu uvintin ga lhingsetna akilodiu ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Aman ichan gei a phatthei aboh hitam? Amahon insungmi tamtah atungdoh'un chuleh aganchahou ninglhingset ding ahi.   
\p
\v 39 Ijemtia bolgentheina jalle, boina le hahsatna jalla umho mihem a akemsuh uva avaichat phatnuleh,   
\p
\v 40 Yahweh Pakai in alengteu hinpaidoh intin amaho gamgo laija pannabei in umsah leleu vintin,   
\p
\v 41 hinla Yahweh Pakai in mivaichaho ahahsat nauva kon in kelngoihon phatah bangin ainsunga hinpunsah intin,   
\p
\v 42 Miphahon hiche thilsoh hohi hinveu vintin kipahdiu ahinla miphalou hochu suhthipma umdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Michingho jousen hitia thilsoh hohi lunggiltah'in hinheu vintin, amahon hitobang ikhankhouva kon a hi Yahweh Pakai mingailutna dihtah chu ahin mudohdiu ahi.   
\c 108  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Kitahna David In Avahchoi  
\s1 David labol  
\p
\v 1 O Pathen Elohim kalungthim hi nang ah akinem jinge, ahijeh chun kalungthim pumpia nangma thangvah la kasha theihi datmo ding ahipoi.   
\p
\v 2 Hungthouvin, katheile leh kasemjang, jingpi ihmuhi kavahchoilan sukhang'ing kate.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai mitinlah'a hin nangma hin thangvah ingkate. Keiman chitin namtin lah a hin nangma vahchoila sange.   
\p
\v 4 Nami ngailutna longlouhi vanho sangin asangjon ahi. Nakitahna hin meilomlah ho aphan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 O Elohim Pathen vanho lah'a asangpen sangin namin hi dopsangin umjo hen. Naloupina leiset pumpi chung vumma hin vahdoh hen.   
\p
\v 6 Tuhin name ngailut tehi huhdoh tan. Naban thahatnan neidonbutnun lang neihuhdoh tauvin,   
\p
\v 7 Elohim Pathen'in athenna a chu hichehi akitepna ahi. “Keiman kipahtah a Sechemhi kabokhen ding, Keiman Succoth phaicham hi katetoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Gilead hi kei a ahin, Manasseh jong kei a ahi, Ephraim kathih lukhuh ahin, ama a kon a hi kagalsat dingho hungkondoh diu ahi, chuleh Judah hi kaleng tenggol ahin ama a kon a hi kalengte hung kondoh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hinla Moab hi kakeng silna kong ahin ama a kon a hi kasohte hungkondoh diu ahi, chuleh Keiman Edom chunga hi kakeng kasilding ahi. Philistia chunga galjona kasapkhum ding ahi.”   
\p
\v 10 Koipenham kulpi kikaikhum khopi sunga eipuilut ding ah? Koiham Edom chunga galjona a eipuilut ding ah?   
\p
\v 11 O Elohim Pathen nangin neipaidoh hitam? Nangin kasepaite toh galsat'a nakonkhom louding hitam?   
\p
\v 12 O Yahweh Pakai kagalmite toh kidouna a hi neipanhu louding hitam, ajeh chu mihem kithopina hi aphachom aumpoi.   
\p
\v 13 Elohim Pathen toh pankhom hi thil loupi tahtah tohdoh theina ahi, ajeh chu Aman eikidoupi ho chu akengtoa alhopha ding ahi.   
\c 109  
\s1 Phulah Pehna Dinga David Taona  
\s1 Lalamkai pa henga Dabid labol  
\p
\v 1 O Elohim Pathen koiham kathangvah ding, kei a kon in thipbeh leh gamla tah in umdan lang,   
\p
\v 2 miphalouten eihousetna thujou eiseikhum teng u jong le thipbeh in umdan.   
\p
\v 3 Thet umtah thucheng ho pum in eiumkim vel un, ajeh beihel'in eikisat piuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Keiman amaho hi kangailui amaho dinga kataolai hin amahon thepmosah teiding leh suhmang dingin eigong jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Amahon thilpha kabol ho thilse jengin eilethuh'un, kangailutna hi vetda nan eithuh'un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Amahon asei un, “Ama doudin miphalou khat hintungdoh un, achungthu kitan theina dinga athepmo sahding hinsol'un” atiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Achungthu akitan teng amahi thepmosah uhitin, ataona chu chonsetnin simmu hite,   
\p
\v 8 Akum lhomsah uhite, michomkhat ama munna dinsah'u hite,   
\p
\v 9 achate paneilou hisah uhitin aji meithai hisah'u hite,   
\p
\v 10 achate khutdo a moh vahlele hiu henlang, inn gem in vah mang jeng uhen.   
\p
\v 11 Bat le tham houvin a in alou chuleh anei agou kichom u hen, kholgam mihon asum lodoh jouse lahpeh uhen,   
\p
\v 12 koimachan lungset dauhen; koimachan paneilouva um achate chu khoto dauhen.   
\p
\v 13 Ason apah jouse thisoh hen. A inn sung pumpiu min jong akhang cheh a din lah doh in um mai hen.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai in apateu chonsetna ngaidam hihbeh hen, anu-u chonsetna jong lekhabua kon in kikahdoh hihbeh hen,   
\p
\v 15 Yahweh Pakai in achonsetnau geldoh jinghen, chuleh aminjong mihemten geldoh hihbeh hen.   
\p
\v 16 Ajeh chu mi koima ngailut aneipoi, aman mivaichaho leh tahlelte abol genthei e, chuleh lung gentheite thina a adellut e.   
\p
\v 17 Ama mi samset athanom in; tun nang ama sugoi tan. Aman midang phatthei aboh khapoi; tun nangman ama jong phatthei boh hih in.   
\p
\v 18 Mi sapset hi amadinga aponsil, atwidon, abuneh tobang a angaito ahitai.   
\p
\v 19 Tun amisapsetna chu hung kile henlang ama chunga pon bangin behdoh henlang angonga kong gah bangin kikhit chah hen,   
\p
\v 20 Tun hiche sapsetna hochu eiseise hole eidem demho chungah Yahweh Pakai engbolna chujohen.   
\p
\v 21 Hinla O thaneipen Yahweh Pakai neidin pi in, nangma min khoto najal chun! Neihuh doh in ajeh chu nangma hi chutobangtah a pha le kitah nahi.   
\p
\v 22 Ajeh chu keimahi mivaicha le tahlel tah kahin kalungthim hi ana behseh jenge.   
\p
\v 23 Nilhah langa nisa lim achemang bang a mangthah ding kahi, min khaokhopi apaidoh banga eikipaidoh ahitai,   
\p
\v 24 Ka ann ngol na-a kon in kakengpah ho kisan atha aumtapon kavunleh kagu keubou kahitai.   
\p
\v 25 Keima hi muntin a mi totnopna bep kahitan amahon eimu tenguleh noisena'in alu-u eiheikhum jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Nei kithopin O Yahweh Pakai, ka Pathen Elohim! Nami ngailutna longlou chun neihuhdoh'in.   
\p
\v 27 Yahweh Pakai nangin ka chung ahi nangma natoh mong ahiti ahetchet nadiuvin musah'in.   
\p
\v 28 Hiteng chuleh amahon eisapset nom u jongleh eisamseuhen ajeh chu nangman phatthei neiboh ding ahinai. Amahon eihin delkhum tenguleh jumna akimudiu ahi. Ahinla nasoh keimavang kipah a kagalkai ding ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Eitaitom jingho vang jumna ponbanga akikhu khumdiu ahin, suhnem a aum nao chun ponbanga atomkhudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Ahinla kenvang Yahweh Pakai kom a kipathu kasei jingding mijouse kom a kasei choile ding ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Ajeh chu Aman tahlelte adinpi jingin suhmang ding gohoa kon in ahuhdoh jingin ahi.   
\c 110  
\s1 Messiah Hungna Ding David In Gaothua Asei  
\s1 David labol  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai in ka leng pakai kom ah, “nagal mite kasuhnem a, nakengtoa kachotpha sah tokahsen kakhut jetlam naloupina mun tou jengin” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in naleng gam thaneitah chu Jerusalem a kon a ahin lhundoh ding, nangin nagalmite chunga vai na homding ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Galsat'a nacheteng namiten thanomtah'a najuidiu ahi, nangma vonthenga nakivon ding chutengleh jingkah daitwi banga nisehleh natha kidodoh jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai in kihahselna anei ahin akitepna chu asuhkeh louding ahi. “Nangma Melchizedek hina banga tonsot thempu nahiding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai chu najet langa dinga napuihoi jing ahi. Ama alunghanna ahung koudoh leh lengle lalho tamtah asuhlhuh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Aman chitin namtin ajepding agamsunga thilong dimset ding, aman leiset pumpia lengle lalte aban vohlhuh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Ahinlah amavang lampi pang dunga long twi adon a hatdoh jingding ahi. Hitiachu amahi galjoupa hijengding ahi.   
\c 111  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Natoh Kidang Ho  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen! Michonpha hotoh kikhop khomna chan ah keiman kalungthim apumpin Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah ingkate.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai natoh hi iti kidan a hitam! Koi hileh ama a lunglhaina neijousen giltah a agel angaije.   
\p
\v 3 Athilbol ho jouse hin aloupina leh aja ngaina aphongdoh'in ahi. Athu adih nahi athon ngaipon ahi.   
\p
\v 4 IYahweh Pakaiju mi ngailutna le amikhotona hi iti kidan hitam tihi aman eigeldoh sahjiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Aman akitepna hi ageldoh jingin ama gingte chu nehle chah apejingin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Aman amite chu chidang namdangho gam alahpeh a amaho apeh achun athaneina thupitah chu akilandoh sah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Athilbol ho jouse hi adih'in aphan ahi, chuleh athupeh ho jouse hi tahsan theicheh ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hicheho hi tonsotna dihjing jeng ahin tahsan tahleh kitahna neitah a juiding ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Aman amite Manchu lhingsetna anapeh ahitai. Aman a mite toh akitepna chu tonsotna dinga asuhdet ahi. O ichan geija gimnei leh minthang hitam!   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai ginhi chihna dihtah kiphudohna khombul ahi. Athupeh hoitah a nit ho dingin chihna a khangtou cheh chehding ahi. Atonsotnin thangvah'in umjing tahen.   
\c 112  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Gin Jeh'a Phattheina Ho  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah un! Yahweh Pakai ginna neija athupeh ho lunglhai tah'a juiho dinga iti kipa um a hitam.   
\p
\v 2 Achaten muntin a lolhinna aneiding ahi. Khangkhat lhingset a mipha ngen hina phatthei changdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Amaho hung haodoh ding ahiuve chuleh athilpha bol u umjing jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Michonpha ho dingin jan jengjong avah'in ahi. Amahohi ahongphal un, khotona aneiyun chuleh thudih achepiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hongphal tah a sumpa hom hole thengtah'a akiveina chepiho phatthei changdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hitobang miho chu thilsen asuhmo joulou ding ahi. Mikitah hohi min asumil theipon ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Amahohin thuse hung kithangho jengjong akichapon amahon Yahweh Pakai in ahoibit diuvin tahsan na dettah aneiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Amahohin tahsanna dettah aneiyun kichatna aneipouvin ahi, chuleh akidoupi hojeng jong joteiding tahsan nan akimai topiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hitobang hohin panpi ngaichaho hongphal tah'in apeuvin kiphaltah'in mitoh chan aching khomji nom un ahi. Atohphat nahou geldoh'in aumjingin ahi. Amahohin mi thujona leh jana achang'un ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Milungdihlou hon hichehi mu uvintin alung hanpi diu ahi. Amahon lunghang tah'in aha gel unte, chuleh akinepnau thonjeh'in jumthet in kilapdoh tauvin te.   
\c 113  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Tobang Koima Aumpoi  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai thangvah'in umhen! Yahweh Pakai sohte ho thangvahna peuvin, Yahweh Pakai minchu choian un!   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai minchu nunnom hen, tuleh tonsot gei a dingin.   
\p
\v 3 Muntin a solam le lhanglam a kon in Yahweh Pakai minchu choiat in umhen.   
\p
\v 4 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai hi chitin namtin jouse sangin asangjon aloupina hi vanho jouse sangin jong asangjon ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Koi hintem Yahweh Pakai iPathen'u Elohim toh tekahpi thei chu, Amahi choisanga alaltouna a touva ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Aman kisunemtah'in van leh leiset ahinven ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Aman mivaichate vutvai lah'a kon in aphongdingin chuleh tahlelte munnom pen a kon in akaidingin,   
\p
\v 8 leng chate toh atoukhomsah'in Ama mite leng chapate jengto jong atoukhomsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Aman chaneilou numeiho cha le nao apen minu nomsatah in asemdohjin ahi. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   
\c 114  
\s1 Egypt'a Kon Israel Hin Puidohpa Yahweh Pakai Vahchoiyun  
\p
\v 1 Israelte Egyptma kon a ajamdoh jouvun, Jacob insung miten hiche midangho gamchu adalhah phatnun   
\p
\v 2 Judah gamchu Elohim Pathen muntheng a sohdoh tan Israel chu aleng gam asoh doh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Twikhanglen san chun ahungu amun ajam mangtan Jordan vadunga twi hojong ana kiheimang'in,   
\p
\v 4 Mol ho jong kelngoichal ho bangin akichom un thinglhang hochu kelngoinou bangin akichom leuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Twikhanglen san ipibol a na lhaimang loijeng ham? Jordan vadung ipibol a na lhaimang jengham?   
\p
\v 6 Mol ho nangho ipidinga kelngoichal banga nakichop uham? Thinglhang ho ipi dinga kelngoinou banga nakichop uham?   
\p
\v 7 O leiset, Yahweh Pakai angsung'leh Jacob Elohim Pathen masangah kithing thingin um in.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in songpi chu twi veina twikul asosah'in, songpi tahbetna kon in twisam alondoh sahjin ahi.   
\c 115  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Hi Dihtah'a Loupi Ahi  
\p
\v 1 Keiho a ahipoi, O Yahweh Pakai keiho a ahipoi, amavang loupina jouse hi namingailut na longlou jeh a chun nang ding jingbou ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Chitin namtin hohin a Pathen'u Elohim hoi a umham tia aseidingu ham?   
\p
\v 3 Ka Pathen'u Elohim hi vanho chunga aum in thil adeidan dana abolji ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Amaho semthu doihon vang sana le dangka a kisem ngenchang bou ahiuvin mihem khut in asemthu jeng ahiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Amahon kam anei un ahinla apaotheipon, chuleh mit anei un kho amuthei pouvin,   
\p
\v 6 kol aneiyun ajathei pouvin, nahkui anei un anahthei pouvin,   
\p
\v 7 khut anei un ima tohnan amangthei pouvin chuleh keng anei un achele theipouvin, lolhom anei un ahin thucheng ahungdoh theipon ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hitiachu doilim semthu hohi hiche tobang ahiuve, hicheho tahsan hojong hitobang machu ahiuve.   
\p
\v 9 O Israel Yahweh Pakai chu tahsan un! Amachu napanhu na lum a pang ahi.   
\p
\v 10 O thempuho Aaron ho Yahweh Pakai chu tahsan un! Amahi napanpia leh na lumdel a pang'a ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Nangho Yahweh Pakai gingjing ho Yahweh Pakai chu tahsan un! Amachu napanpi le nalumdal ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Yahweh Pakai in nahin geldoh jingin phatthei nabohjing ding ahi. Aman Israel mipite hi phatthei aboh ding ahi, chuleh thempuho le Aaron chilhah ho jong phatthei aboh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Mithupi hihenlang milham hijongleh Yahweh Pakai ging hochu Aman phatthei aboh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai in nangma nahin nachate ahin phattheina lhingset in napehen,   
\p
\v 15 Van le lei sem a Yahweh Pakai chun phatthei naboh hen,   
\p
\v 16 Vanhohi Yahweh Pakai a ahin, leiset vanghi mihemte apeh ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Mithin Yahweh Pakai thangvah la asatheipoi, ajeh chu amaho chu lhan munthip gam a che ahiuve.   
\p
\v 18 Ahinlah eihon tu le tonsot geija Yahweh Pakai ithangvah theiju ahi. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   
\c 116  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Hi Mihepi Ahi  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai in ka o eingai peh eikhoto dia katao na eisan peh jeh in keiman Yahweh Pakai kangailui.   
\p
\v 2 Aman eihin ang ngat a kataona eingaipeh'in kahaithei laisea keima katao jing jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Thinan apon in eihin tomkhum e; lhankhuh gimneitah chun eihin lonvuh e. Keiman lungkhamna leh lunggimna ngen kamu e.   
\p
\v 4 hiteng chuleh keiman Yahweh Pakai min kakoujin, “Yahweh Pakai lungset'in neihuhdoh'in!” katijin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai hi itobang tah'a milungsetthem hitam! Chuleh itobang tah'a pha a hitam! iPathen'u Elohim hi ichangei a mikhoto them hitam!   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai in chapang lungthengtah atahsanna neijachu ahahsatna'a ahoidoh jin ahi. Keima thina toh kimaitoa kaum laitah'in aman eihuhdoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Kalhagao, nacholdo namun hinjon kittan ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai hi keidingin aphalheh jenge.   
\p
\v 8 Aman kathina dinga kon in eihuhdoh'in kamitna mitlhi lonlouna dingle kakeng hi kakiselhuh louna dingin eiveng jenge.   
\p
\v 9 Hiche leisetna kahin laisen Yahweh Pakai masanga kavahle jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai keima kagenthei behseh jengtai katiteng jongleh nangma katahsan jing nalai e.   
\p
\v 11 Kahahsat teng jongleh nangma kahin koujin ahi, ajeh chu hiche mitehi tahsan thei ahipouve.   
\p
\v 12 Thilpha simjoulou eibolpeh jeh'a hi Yahweh Pakai chu ipi kapehding ham?   
\p
\v 13 Keiman huhhingna khon hi domsang'ing ting eihuhhing jeh'a amin kathangvah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Keiman amite ho jouse masangah Yahweh Pakai ah kakitepna nitjing ing kate.   
\p
\v 15 Yahweh Pakai in angailut mite athiteng leh alainatpi lheh jengjin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 O Yahweh Pakai keima nasoh kahi, nangin kasoh channa'a kon in neihuhdoh tai.   
\p
\v 17 Keiman thangvahna hi kilhaina gantha napengting Yahweh Pakai min'in taovinge.   
\p
\v 18 Keiman Yahweh Pakai a kakitepna chu amite jouse masangah pengtin,   
\p
\v 19 Yahweh Pakai houin ah Jerusalem lailungah subulhit'ing kate. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   
\c 117  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai in Lungsetna Tantih Neilouva Anei Jeh'a Vahchoina  
\p
\v 1 Chitin namtin in Yahweh Pakai chu thangvahna peuhen, leiset chungcheng jousen thangvah cheh hen,   
\p
\v 2 Amahi tonsot a kitahjing Yahweh Pakai ahin eingailutnao hi longlou ahijeh'in Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen.   
\c 118  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Mingailutna Hi Tonsot'a Ding Ahi  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu aphatna jeh'in thangvah'un! Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tanglouvin aumjinge.   
\p
\v 2 Israel pumpin avel in seikit hen. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tanglouvin aumjinge.   
\p
\v 3 Aaron chilhah holeh thempuhon avel in seikitnu hen. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tanglouvin aumjinge.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai ging jousen seikit uhen agailut thutah chun tonsot in athoh jing e.   
\p
\v 5 Kagenthei pet in Yahweh Pakai kom ah kataovin ahileh Yahweh Pakai in kataona asangin eilhadoh tai.   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai keilanga apanleh ipi kakichat ding ham? kon I-eilothei dingham?   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai keilanga apanleh Aman eipapin tin, eidou hochu kajosa tobanga kavetding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Mihem a kingai sangin, Yahweh Pakai kiselna a nei aphajoi.   
\p
\v 9 Leng chapate a kingai sangin, Yahweh Pakai a kisel aphajoi.   
\p
\v 10 Eidouva chidang namdangten eiumkimvel jongleh keiman amaho chu Yahweh Pakai thahatna jalla kasuhmang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Amahon eiumkimvellun eidelkhummun ahi, ahinla ken amaho chu Yahweh Pakai hanta jallin kasumang gamtan ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Amahon khoi bangin eiumkimvellun eitommun, meikong a-al leng lungngin eileo tobangin eibolseuvin ahinla keiman Yahweh Pakai thahatna jallin amaho chu kasumangtan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Kagal miten tha tei ding eigouvin ahin Yahweh Pakai in eihuhdoh tai.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai hi kathahatna leh kala ahin Aman galjona eipetan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Kipana le galjona lahi michonphate ponbuh sungah akisan, Yahweh Pakai thahatna banjet in thil loupitah atongdohtan ahi!   
\p
\v 16 Yahweh Pakai thahatna banjetchun thil loupitah atongdohtan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Keima thilouding kahin, Yahweh Pakai in eibolpeh thilho phongdoh dinga kahinjoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Yahweh Pakai in nasatah'in eijepmin, ahinlah eithisah pon ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Mikitah ho lutna kot chu neihondoh peh'in keima lut ing ting Yahweh Pakai chu thangvahna kapehding ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hiche kelkot hohi Yahweh Pakai kom lhuntheina ahin michonpha hojong hicheahi lutji ahiuve.   
\p
\v 21 Kataona neisanpeh jehleh galjona neipeh jeh'in nangma kathangvah e!   
\p
\v 22 Insahon adeimova apaimangu inning'a songpi khomdet pennin apangtai.   
\p
\v 23 Hichehi Yahweh Pakai natoh ahin mitvet dinga thilkidang tah ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Hiche nikho hi Yahweh Pakai in asem ahin, eihon kipahtah leh thanomtah'a imandiu ahi.   
\p
\v 25 O Yahweh Pakai lungsettah'in neihuhdoh'un, O Yahweh Pakai lungset tah'in neilolhin sahtei teijun.   
\p
\v 26 Yahweh Pakai minna hungpa chu anunnomme. Yahweh Pakai houinna kon in nangho phatthei kahinboh'un ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Yahweh Pakai chu Elohim Pathen, ichunguva hi vahjinga um a ahi. Kilhaina sa chu khaovin khitninlang maicham ki ho chutoh khitbeh'in   
\p
\v 28 Nangma ka Pathen Elohim nahin keiman kavahchoi ding nahi! Nangma ka Pathen Elohim nahin keiman kachoisang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Yahweh Pakai chu aphatna ho jeh'in thangvah'un! Ajeh chu amingailutna dihtah chu tonsot a umjing ahi.   
\c 119  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Danthu Phatchom Na  
\s1 Aleph  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai thupeh dungjui a chonho leh kitahna neiho chu kipah uhen.   
\p
\v 2 Koi hileh a Dan thu nit a alungthim pumpia Ama holjing hochu kipah'u hen.   
\p
\v 3 Amahochun thilphalou achepi pouvin Yahweh Pakai deilampi joh ajui un ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai nangin nathupeh hochu phatah'a kanit diuvin neiseipeh'un ahi.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai kanitin hinkho Mandan ahin nangman neideipeh hinkho hi kilangdoh jengle kati e.   
\p
\v 6 Chuleh nathupeh leh ka chondan kavetkah teng kajum louding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Keiman nei thuhilna dihtah hochu kahet dungjui a kakimanding dol a kakimanchah theijeh'a nangma chu kathangvah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Neidalha hihbeh'in, keiman na Dan chu kanitjing ding ahi.   
\s1 Beth  
\p
\v 9 Khangthah khatchu itileh ahinkho atheng theidem? Nangma thu angaileh hitheiding ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Keiman nangma mudoh teiding kagelkhoh'in ahi, nangma thupeh'a kon in neilam vai sahhih'in.   
\p
\v 11 Nangma douna kachonset louna dingin kalungsung ah nathu chu kachensah jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 O Yahweh Pakai nangma kathangvah'e nathupeh nitji dan neihil in.   
\p
\v 13 Ka chonding dan nangin neipeh hochu keiman kasimphongjin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Nei le gouva housangin na Dan thu chu juiding katha anomjoi.   
\p
\v 15 Neithupeh na Dan hochu keiman simjing ingting nei deipeh lampia chejing dingin kingaito jing nange.   
\p
\v 16 Na Dan thu hohi kakipapin, juidinga neithupeh hojong sumil ponge.   
\s1 Gimel  
\p
\v 17 Nasohpa keima hi thilpha neibolpen kahinkhoa hi nathupeh kanit jingna dingin.   
\p
\v 18 Nathupeh hoa thudih kidangtah hohi kamuchet theina dingin kamit hi hadohsah'in.   
\p
\v 19 Keima hiche leisetna hi kholjin bep kahibouve nathupeh hochu keima nei impeh hihbeh'in.   
\p
\v 20 Phatin in keiman nachondan juiding ngaichatna hin eilonvuhtan ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Nangin mikiletsah hochu nahousejin, nathupeh a kon a pampet hochu nasamsejin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Na Dan sem hohi kajui jingnai amahohi neinoise sahhih beh'in.   
\p
\v 23 Leng chapate ho toukhom u henlang keima dounan thu seijongleu keivangin na Dan semhohi juiding geljing nange.   
\p
\v 24 Na Dan semho hi kakipapi lheh jenge ajeh chu hiche hohin chihna thu eihil jingin ahi.   
\s1 Daleth  
\p
\v 25 Keima leivui lah'a kijama kahitai nathu chun neisuhal kittan.   
\p
\v 26 Ka chondan, kaumchan nakom ah kaphongdoh tai, tun nadan semchu neisei pehtan.   
\p
\v 27 Na Dan thupeh chu neithem sah'in, chutengleh keiman natohdoh datmo umtah hochu kalungin geljing nange.   
\p
\v 28 Lungkhamnan eibom in kakaptai, nakam changing neihaldoh sahkit tan.   
\p
\v 29 Mijou milepche hotoh neichom khen in, nathuhil kahetthem theinading thuguh chu neipen.   
\p
\v 30 Kitah tah'a hinkho manding hi kakilhen ahitai, nathuhil dungjui a hinkho mandinghi kadinpi ahitai.   
\p
\v 31 Na Dan semhi katuhchah ahitai, O Yahweh Pakai neijumso hihbeh'in!   
\p
\v 32 Nathupeh hohi kajui jingding ahi, ajeh chu nangin hetthem theina neipeh jingding jehin.   
\s1 He  
\p
\v 33 O Yahweh Pakai nathupeh chu neihillin, keiman achaina gei in juijing ing kate.   
\p
\v 34 Nathuhil kajuijing theina dingin hetthem theina neipen. Kalungthim pumpin hichu natohman podoh ingkate.   
\p
\v 35 Nathupeh dungjui in neikalson sah'in hichu kakipanapen ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Sum ngaichatna sangin na Dan thu hetthemding ngaichat theina neipejon.   
\p
\v 37 Thil phachomlou hoa kon in kamit heimangin lang nathuchengin neihindoh sah'in.   
\p
\v 38 Nangma ginle jana neiho napeh kitepna chu keima kom ah neisuhdetpeh'in.   
\p
\v 39 Kajumna hinkho hi neipailhah sah'in ajeh chu na Dan semho hi aphalheh jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Nathupeh hohi kajuinomlheh jenge naphatna'in kahinkho hi neithah sempeh kittan.   
\s1 Waw  
\p
\v 41 Yahweh Pakai namingailutna longlou tonsot hinna neiteppeh chu neipetan,   
\p
\v 42 Chutileh eitaitom ho donbutje kahetding ahi ajeh chu keiman nathutep chu katahsan in ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Phat tin in thutah jeng neisei sah'in ajeh chu nangma chondan thupeh a bouhin kinepna kanei in ahi.   
\p
\v 44 Keiman nathupeh hochu itihchan hijongleh kanit jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 45 Keiman chamlhatna tahbeh chu kaneitai, ajeh chu nangma thuhil juidinga kigo kahitai.   
\p
\v 46 Keiman nathupehho hi jahchalou hella lengte masanga jong kaphondoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 47 Keiman nang thupeh juidinghi kakipanapen ahitai ajeh chu hicheho hi keiman kadeilheh jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 48 Keiman na thupeh ho hi kadeilheh jengin chuleh jana jong kaneijin ahi, na Dan thu hohi giltah'in kagellin ahi.   
\s1 Zayin  
\p
\v 49 Kakom a na kitepna chu geldoh'in hiche bouchu ahi kakinepna.   
\p
\v 50 Hiche nakitepna hin kahinkho akiledohsah kit'in kalungthim boina hoa kon in jong lungmon na eipen ahi.   
\p
\v 51 Mikiletsah hon noise tah'in eibol jongleu keivang nangma thuhilhoa kon in kapotdoh pon ahi.   
\p
\v 52 Masanglai peh'a na Dan sem nachepi hochu kangaito leh O Yahweh Pakai hichechun eilhamon sahlheh jenge.   
\p
\v 53 Keima miphalou ho chunga kalung ahang'in ahi, ajeh chu amahon nathuhil apompouve.   
\p
\v 54 Hiche kakholjinna munhi hoilai hijongleh na Dan thu semho hi kala ngeipen ahijinge.   
\p
\v 55 O Yahweh Pakai jantengleh nangma nahina hi kalungsung ah akilangjin, hijeh chun nathuhil hohi kajui jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 56 Nathupeh juijinghi kahinkho mandan hitoh kilhon khoma ahitai.   
\s1 Heth  
\p
\v 57 O Yahweh Pakai, kachanding gouchu nangma nahi! Nathupeh juidingin kakiphaldoh jinge!   
\p
\v 58 Kalungthim pumpi hi namalsomna ngaichajing kahi, Nakitepna bangin neihepi jingtan.   
\p
\v 59 Kahinkho ka lam lhahdan hi kanung gel jin chutengleh na Dan thu juina dingahin ka lutkit ji tai.   
\p
\v 60 Nathupeh juina dingahin gangtah'in kipelut jing nange.   
\p
\v 61 Miphalou hon chonsetna a lhohlut teiding eigo jiuvin ahinla keima vang na Dan thuhilna a hin dettah'in kading jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 62 Na Dan thupeh hohi adih jeh'in jankhang jongleh kathoudoh'in nangma ka thangvah jin ahi.   
\p
\v 63 Nangma thupeh juijing holeh nangma ging jingho dingin agolphao kahijinge.   
\p
\v 64 O Yahweh Pakai namingailutna tanglou hin leiset chunghi adipmin, na Dan thuhi neihil jingin.   
\s1 Teth  
\p
\v 65 Yahweh Pakai nangin nakitepna dungjuijin thilpha tamtah neibolpeh tai.   
\p
\v 66 Nathupeh hoachun kading jinge, hetna thepna leh thu adih'a tantheina thuguh chu neihil in,   
\p
\v 67 Nangin neihilchah masang chun kana lamvaijin, tunvang nathu thun kanungtai.   
\p
\v 68 Nangman naphatna'in thilpha bou na bol jie, na Dan thuchu neihil in.   
\p
\v 69 Miphalou ho jouthu eisei khum jiuvin, ahinla kenvang kalungthim pumpin nathupeh ho dihtah'in kajuijing nai.   
\p
\v 70 Alungthim u ngol hoitah ahin; keivang nangma thupehho juijing hi kakipana ahijinge.   
\p
\v 71 Ka thohgimna chu keidinga thilphajo anahi, ajeh chu hichehin nathupeh juina ding langa lunglutna eipethei jin ahi.   
\p
\v 72 Nathuhil ho juiding hi sana le dangka simsenlou sangin aman atamjon ahi.   
\s1 Yodh  
\p
\v 73 Nangin neina gon a neinasemdoh ahin, tunvang nathupeh juina dinga hin hetthem theina neipen.   
\p
\v 74 Nangma ging ho jousen kei a konna hin kipa na mu u heuhen, ajeh chu keiman nathupeh ahin kinepna dihtah kanei in ahi.   
\p
\v 75 O Yahweh Pakai keiman na Dan semho adihdan hi kahethem tai, neisuhgim ji ding hi keidia thil phachom ahi.   
\p
\v 76 Tuhin nasohpa neiteppeh bangin namingailutna longlou chun eilungmonsah jin ahi.   
\p
\v 77 Kahintheina dingin namihepina chun neiumkimvel jingin ajeh chu neithuhilna hohi keidinga kipana leh lunglhaina ahi.   
\p
\v 78 Keichung changa thujou seiho miphalou hochu jumle jachatna penlang, keivangin nangma thupehho chu kangai jingding ahinai.   
\p
\v 79 Nangma Dan he themho leh nangma ging jingho chutoh nei ki vopkhom sah jingin.   
\p
\v 80 Na Dan thu kajuina ahin bolkhel kaneilouna dingin neivengin, chutileh jumna leh jachatna kaneilou ding ahi.   
\s1 Kaph  
\p
\v 81 Nangma huhdohna ding kangana lamma hin abeipaiding kahitai, ahinlah nathupeh ahin kakinepna adetjinge.   
\p
\v 82 Nakitepna ahung gulhunna ding vetnan kamit achahleutai, itih tahleh neilhamon dingham?   
\p
\v 83 Lengpi twipai savun ahun ahulgot bangin kagolhatai ahinlah na Dan thu juiding kasumil dehpon ahi.   
\p
\v 84 Itihchanpi hi kanga jingding hitam? Keima eibolse hohi itihleh aphu nalah dingham?   
\p
\v 85 Nangma thuhil nahsahlou mi kiletsah hohin keima kipalna ding ko thuhtah alaijun ahi.   
\p
\v 86 Nathupeh jouse hi tahsan dinga lomtah cheh ahi. Ajeh bei a eidel lele hoa konhin neihuhdoh'in.   
\p
\v 87 Amaho hin eichaidohpai got u ahitai, ahinla keiman nathupeh hohi kajuida dehpoi.   
\p
\v 88 Na mi ngailutna longlou chun kahinkho hi huhdoh'in, chutileh na Dan thu kajui theiding ahi.   
\s1 Lamedh  
\p
\v 89 O Yahweh Pakai tonsot a dinga nakitepna chu van a dettah'in aumjinge.   
\p
\v 90 Nangin nanatundoh hiche leiset hi aumjing bangin nakitahna jong akhang khanga umjing ahi.   
\p
\v 91 Nathilgon jouse hi nathupeh dungjui in tuni chan geihin aumsohkei un ahi, ajeh chu amahohi aboncha nalhacha ahisoh kei un ahi.   
\p
\v 92 Na Dan thupeh hin kipana hinkho'ah eihin khoukhah hihleh kagenthei lengvaina a kana mol lem ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 93 Na thupeh Dan hohi itihchan hijongleh ka suhmillou helding ahi, ajeh chu hicheho hin eihinghoi ahi.   
\p
\v 94 Yahweh Pakai nanga kahi; neihuhdoh'in! Ajeh chu nadan thu nitna a hin ka kihabol lheh jenge.   
\p
\v 95 Mi phalouhon suhmang dingin lampi dungah eichanglhi le jonguleh kei man vang na Dan thuhi kalung sungah thipbeh chan geljing nange.   
\p
\v 96 Thiljouse hin akhonna aneisoh keije ahinlah na Dan thupeh hin akhonna aneipoi.   
\s1 Mem  
\p
\v 97 Oh, na Dan thupeh hi iti kahin dei hitam! Ni lhumkei kei in hicheho hi kageljin in ahi.   
\p
\v 98 Na Dan thupeh hohin kagal mite sangin eichihsah'e, ajeh chu hicheho hin phattin in eiveng jinge.   
\p
\v 99 Na Dan thuhi phattin a ka geljing jeh'in eihilho sangin jong hetgilna ka neijotai.   
\p
\v 100 Na thupeh Dan ho kanitjing jeh'in kachunga upa tehse ho sangin jong kachingjo tai.   
\p
\v 101 Nathupeh dettah a kajuijing theina dingin thilse bolna a cheding kanompon ahi.   
\p
\v 102 Nangin phate keicha neihil ahitah jeh'in na Dan thu juina a konnin ka ki heimang nompon ahi.   
\p
\v 103 Na thupeh hi kapatep leh alhum lheh jenge, khoiju sangin alhumjon ahi.   
\p
\v 104 Na Dan thupeh hohin hetthemna eipen; hiti chun hinkho adihlou lam a cheding hi kathet lheh ji e.   
\s1 Nun  
\p
\v 105 Nathupeh hi kakalsonna a eipuiding thaomei jin apangin, kalampi salvah ding vah'in apangin ahi.   
\p
\v 106 Na Dan thupeh dihtah hohi kajuijing ding ahin, hiche dinga hi kitepna kananei ahitan avel a kakitep kitding ahi.   
\p
\v 107 Yahweh Pakai nathutep dungjui in ka hinkho hoidoh sah'in ajeh chu kathohlel behseh jenge.   
\p
\v 108 O Yahweh Pakai ka thangvah nahi kilhaina thilto bangin neisanpeh'in lang chuleh na Dan thupeh ho neihil in.   
\p
\v 109 Keima ka hinkho hi kilep ditdet in aum e, ahinlah na thuhil hi ka juidadeh pong e.   
\p
\v 110 Mi phalou hon ka kipalna dingin thang akam jingun ahi, ahi vangin nathupeh'a kon a ka ki heimang doh louding ahi.   
\p
\v 111 Na Dan thu hi keidinga gou ahi, hicheho hin ka lungthim akipasah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 112 Ka thini changei a na Dan thu nitding hi ka dinpi ahitai.   
\p
\v 113 Kitahna neiloute hi kathet ahin keivang na thuhil ho jui dinghi katha nopna ahi.   
\s1 Samekh  
\p
\v 114 Nangma hi kakiselna leh kalumdal nahi, nathupeh hi kakinepna bulpi ahijinge.   
\p
\v 115 Milung gilouho keija kon in potdoh'un, ajeh chu keiman ka Yahweh Pakai thupeh hohi kajuinom e.   
\p
\v 116 Yahweh Pakai, nakitepna bangin kahinjouna dingin tha neipen kakinepna hi neijumso hihbeh'in,   
\p
\v 117 Nathahatnan neituh'in chutileh kahoidohding ahi, chutengleh nathupeh hi kachepi jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 118 Nathupeh a kon a potdoh hohi nangin napaidoh gamheltan ahi. Amahohi amahole amaho kijoulhep ahibouve.   
\p
\v 119 Nangin mi-engse hochu leiset chunga konnin bohse bangin napaidoh jitan ahi, hijeh chun kei vangin na Dan thuho hi kajui nom e.   
\p
\v 120 Nangma ginnan ka kithinge, na thutan dihtah ho jeh'in ki chatnan kadim e.   
\s1 Ayin  
\p
\v 121 Keiman thudih tahleh kitahna neitah'in na katonge, kagal mite khut a neidalhahih'in.   
\p
\v 122 Phatthei neibohding kinepna neipen, mi kiletsahho neibolsetsah hihbeh'in.   
\p
\v 123 Nathutep dihtah chu asuh bulhit nadinga neihuhdohna dingchu kavet vetnan kamit achah leutan ahi.   
\p
\v 124 Nami ngailutna longlou chun nasoh hi neibolpha jingin, chuleh na Dan thuho chu neihil in.   
\p
\v 125 Na Dan thuhohi kahettheina dingin nasohhi hetthem theina neipen.   
\p
\v 126 Yahweh Pakai tu hi nakipatna na tohphat ahitai, ajeh chu miphalouhon na Dan thu apal kehgam tauve.   
\p
\v 127 Tahbeh'in nathupeh hohi sana mantampen sangin kadeijon ahi.   
\p
\v 128 Na thupeh hohi adihsoh kei in, hijeh'a chu lamdihlou hohi kathet ahi.   
\s1 Pe  
\p
\v 129 Na Dan semhohi akidang theilheh jengin hijeh'a chu kalungthim pumpia kajui ahi!   
\p
\v 130 Na Dan thuhil'a hin vah akilangin hijeh chun milham minjong ahetheijin ahi.   
\p
\v 131 Nathupeh ho kangaichat behseh jeh'in kaki gon chule kakam kah in kangah jinge.   
\p
\v 132 Nangma ngailuho nabolna bangin hung kihei in lang nami khotona neimusah'in.   
\p
\v 133 Nakitepna dungjuijin kalhuh louna dingin neituh'in, thilse eijosah hihbeh'in.   
\p
\v 134 Eisugenthei hoa kon in neihuhdoh'in, hitiachu nathupehho hoitah'a kajuijing theina dingin.   
\p
\v 135 Nasohpa kei ahin namaivah chu hin kilan dohsah'in chutengleh na Dan thuchu neihil in.   
\p
\v 136 Mi hemten na thuhil ajuitah lou jeh'un kamit na hin mitlhi twi vadung bangin along'e.   
\s1 Tsadhe  
\p
\v 137 O Yahweh Pakai nangma thudihtah nahi, na Dan semho jong adih'e.   
\p
\v 138 Na Dan semhohi nolnabei ahin chuleh tahsanthei mong mong ahi.   
\p
\v 139 Ka galmiten na thupeh hi anahsah loujeh'un ka lunghan hi aki khonhel jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 140 Na thutep hohi kapatep sohkei ahitan adih lheh jeng in keiman ka deilheh jenge.   
\p
\v 141 Keima hi hetkhamlou leh notthap ka hivang in nathupeh hohi ka sumil dehpoi.   
\p
\v 142 Yahweh Pakai nanga hin tonsotna thudih na aum e, chuleh na thuhil dihtah ho jonghi nolnabei ahi.   
\p
\v 143 Hahsat na le lung khamna in eilonvuh jeng jongleh nathupeh hohi keidinga kipana tahbeh ahijinge.   
\p
\v 144 Na Dan semho jouse jonghi adihjing jenge, hinna ka neitheina dingin neihet them sah'in.   
\s1 Qoph  
\p
\v 145 Kalungthim pumpin kataove O Yahweh Pakai neihouvin, keiman na Dan thuho chu kanit jingding ahi.   
\p
\v 146 Nangma kahin kouve Yahweh Pakai neihuh doh'in, na Dan thuho chu ka juijing thei nadin.   
\p
\v 147 Khovah masangin matah'in kathouvin, nathutep na chun kakinem in panpi kathum e.   
\p
\v 148 Jan khovah'in kahah'in nathutep chu kagel jinge.   
\p
\v 149 Nami ngailutna dihtah'a konchun O Yahweh Pakai kataona ngai in lang na Dan thu juina ahin neichoh hing kittan.   
\p
\v 150 Dan neilou miten eihung delkhum un ahi, amahohi nangma thuhilla kon in agamlha lheh'un ahi.   
\p
\v 151 Ahinlah O Yahweh Pakai nangma naichan naum in ahi, chuleh nangma thupehho jouse adih'in ahi.   
\p
\v 152 Na Dan semhohi tonsot a ding ahije tihi kaneolai a patna kanahetsa ahitai.   
\s1 Resh  
\p
\v 153 Kathoh gimna hi venlang neihuhdoh'in, ajeh chu keiman na thuhil hochu ka sumil khapoi.   
\p
\v 154 Keima langa pangin lang ka chung chang thu neiseipeh'in nakitepna bangin neihuh doh'in.   
\p
\v 155 Mi phalou hovang ki huhdoh louding ahiuve. Ajeh chu amahon na Dan thu hi anahsah pouve.   
\p
\v 156 O Yahweh Pakai namihe pina hi anasalheh jenge, na Dan semhohi jui ing kating ka hinkho hi neikile dohsah tan.   
\p
\v 157 Mitamtah'in asugenthei jin eisuboijin ahi, ahinlah na Dan thu juina a kon in kakiheimang dehpoi.   
\p
\v 158 Hitobanga mikitahlou hohi ka muting leh ka lungnatpi lhehjin ahi, ajeh chu amaho hin na Dan thu hi anahsah pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 159 Yahweh Pakai ven na thupeh hi ichangei a ka gelkhoh hitam, na mingailut na longlou jal in ka hinkho hi neilepeh kit in.   
\p
\v 160 Na Dan hung kipatna thuguh chu thutah ahi, na Dan thu dihtah hohi tonsot a dingjing ding ahi.   
\s1 Shin  
\p
\v 161 Mi thanei hon dihloutah'in eibol seuve, ahinlah keiman nathupeh hi ka lungthim in ginna kanei jinge.   
\p
\v 162 Khat touvin gou nasatah akimudoh bangin nathupeh ahin kakipah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 163 Keiman jou le nal kitihi kathetnin ahinlah nathupeh hohi kagelkhoh'e.   
\p
\v 164 Na Dan thu hohi adihjeh'in nikhat in sagivei thangvah na penge.   
\p
\v 165 Nang ma Dan thu ho gelkhoh na neiho jousen thahatna anei un ahi chuleh kipalna aneipou vin ahi.   
\p
\v 166 Yahweh Pakai nangin neihuhdoh dinghi ka ngaicha lheh jengin ahi, hijeh'a chu nathupeh ho hi ka juijing ahi.   
\p
\v 167 Na Dan semhohi kahinjui jinge ajeh chu hicheho hi deium ka salheh jenge.   
\p
\v 168 Ahi, keiman nathupeh hole na Dan semhohi kajui jinge ajeh chu nangin ka kiman chahna jouse nahen ahi.   
\s1 Taw  
\p
\v 169 O Yahweh Pakai kahin kou nahi ngai in nangin neitep pehna bangin het them theina lungthim neipen.   
\p
\v 170 Ka taona hi ngai in, nathutep na bangin nei huhdoh tei in.   
\p
\v 171 Kakam a kon in thangvahna hi hung lengdoh jenghen ajeh chu nangman na Dan thu hohi neihil themtan ahi.   
\p
\v 172 Kalei in nathupeh hohi thangvah lan sa hen, ajeh chu nathupeh jouse hi adih'in ahi.   
\p
\v 173 Nei kithopina khutchu hin lhangdoh'in ajeh chu na thupeh ho juidinga kigotna kanei ahitai.   
\p
\v 174 O Yahweh Pakai nangin neihuhdoh dinghi ka ngaichat jing ahi, ajeh chu nangma thuhil hohi kakipana ahijinge.   
\p
\v 175 Nangma ka thangvah jing theina dingin nei hing hoi in, chuleh nathupeh hohi eikithopin pangjing hen.   
\p
\v 176 Kelngoi banga vahmanga kahitai hungin lang neihung holdoh tan ajeh chu nathupeh hohi keiman kasumil theipoi.   
\c 120  
\s1 Thudih Lou Seina Kona Huhdohna Dinga Taona  
\s1 Jerusalem a Elohim Pathen hou a cheho chung chang a David labol  
\p
\v 1 Lungkham na leh lung gim na kato tengleh Yahweh Pakai kom kalhutjin ahileh Aman kataona asangjin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 O Yahweh Pakai in mijoubol ho a konleh milepche ho a kon in neihuhdoh'in.   
\p
\v 3 Oh lepchena leigui mangcha ho, Elohim Pathen in nangho ipi na louvin tem? Aman nachunga engbolna ichan gei in apunsahbe dem?   
\p
\v 4 Nangma thalchang hemtah a naki sunding chuleh meihol sapehpoh naki desah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Gamlatah Meshach lah'a ka chenchu kadanave, gamlatah Kedar ponbuh a ka chenchu ka thohlel ngeije,   
\p
\v 6 Keima chamna deilah'a kachenhi kakhoplheh jengtai,   
\p
\v 7 Keiman chamna kahol in, ahinlah keiman chamna thu kaseipou pouleh amahon gal bou adeijiu ve.   
\c 121  
\s1 Aphalouva Kon Yahweh Pakai in Nahuhdoh Ding Ahi  
\s1 Jerusalem a kon Pahen hou ho dia la kibol  
\p
\v 1 Keima kadah'in thinglhanglam kavei, hichea kon a khu eipanpi hung hintem?   
\p
\v 2 Vanle lei sem pa Paka a kon a eipanpi hung ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Aman nangma nakipalsah louding; nachingpa chu ihmu louding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Tahbeh'in Israel chingpa chu itihchan hijongleh ihmu lhulou ding ahilouleh ihmu louding ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai amatah chu nachingpa ahi! Ama nakom a ading jingin nahoidohna lim in apang jinge.   
\p
\v 6 Sun leh nisan nasangpeh pontin, janleh lhavah injong nasubeipon te.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai in thilse jousea nahoidohsah in tin nahinkho chingjing nante.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in tuapat tonsot gei in navai kondoh leh nahung vailhun in nachingjing tahen.   
\c 122  
\s1 Jerusalem'a Chamna Umna Dia David Taona  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai hou inn ah cheuhite tia kakom a asei u chun keima kakipahlheh jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Vo Jerusalem tuhin keiho nakelkot sung langah kadingtao ve.   
\p
\v 3 Jerusalem hi dettah'a kisa khopi ahin apal jonghi detchetna kigenbitna ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai mite Israel phungho jousen hicheahi kintheng bolla ahungnao ahi. Israelte chonna dan dungjui a Yahweh Pakai kom a thangvahna pedinga ahungnao ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hichea hin lengte thutanna laltouna hochu aum in David chilhah ho laltouna ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Jerusalem a cham lenna din taovun, hiche khopi ngailu jouse khangtouhen.   
\p
\v 7 Vo Jerusalem, nakulpi sunga chamleng hen chuleh nakhopi sung khangtou hen.   
\p
\v 8 Kainsung mite leh kagol kapaite khohsahna in keiman Jerusalem ah “Nanga chamna umhen” kati.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai, iPathen'u insung khohsah na'in, O Jerusalem nang dinga aphapen chu kahol ahi.   
\c 123  
\s1 Hepina Mutheina Dinga Taona  
\p
\v 1 Van a alaltouna a tou O ka Pathen Elohim nangma munomna in kadah'in kahinvei.   
\p
\v 2 Sohten amit uva apupao avetjing bangun Yahweh Pakai, iPathen'u Elohim khotona ngaichan keihon kahin vejing ui. Hiti hin soh nungah honjong api'u chaloh akivetgeu jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai ka chung u vah khotona neipeuvin ajeh chu keiho hi vetda changsa ka hiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Ajeh chu keihohi mi kiletsahho housetna leh mikhoh ho tai tomnan eichupmu ahitai.   
\c 124  
\s1 Ama Tahsan Ho Yahweh Pakai in Ahuhdoh  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai hi eiho langa anapanglou hikhataleh? Israelte jousen velseikit hen.   
\p
\v 2 Min eina delkhum pettah'un Yahweh Pakai hi eiho langa anapanglou hikhataleh,   
\p
\v 3 amahon alunghan u deojah pum in ahingin eina vallhum tauvinte.   
\p
\v 4 Twi chun einachup uvintin, twikhanglen chun einalhohmang diu ahitai.   
\p
\v 5 Hitiachu ichunguva twipi kitoltol ding ahiuve.   
\p
\v 6 Igalmiteu einasuhmang sah louva Yahweh Pakai chu thangvahna peuhite.   
\p
\v 7 Eiho thang kampa a kon a vacha ahoidoh banga hoidoh ihiuve. Thangpou chu akivobong tan eiho ihoidoh tauve.   
\p
\v 8 Hitobanga kithopina chu vanle lei sem ah Yahweh Pakai a kon a imu'u ahi.   
\c 125  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Tahsante Hoidoh Jing Ding Ahi  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai a tahsanna dettah neiho chu Zion mol tobag ahiuve. Amaho chu suhlinghoi hiloudiu a-itih'a detjing ding ahiuve.   
\p
\v 2 Jerusalem mol'in aumkimvel bangin, tuleh tua dingin Yahweh Pakai chu amite kimvel a akisung jinge.   
\p
\v 3 Michonphate gam a chu miphalou te vaihomna leng teng gol in chan aneilou ding ahi. Achuti louleh michonpha ho jengin jong thilse ahinbol maithei ahi.   
\p
\v 4 O Yahweh Pakai miphaho lungthim nangma toh chekhom theiho chu nangin thilpha bolpeh jingin.   
\p
\v 5 Ahinlah O Yahweh Pakai lamdihlouva chete chu thildihlou bolte toh paidohtha jengin. Israelte lah'a cham lenghen!   
\c 126  
\s1 Elohim Pathen In Asemphat Jal'a Thangvahna  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai in sohchang hochu Jerusalem a ahinlepuilut kitphatchun, hichu mangtoh abang jengin ahi!   
\p
\v 2 Keiho lungna chim tah'a nuinan ka dimset jingun, ki pahtah'in la kasauve. Hichun chidang namdang hon asei un, “Yahweh Pakai in thil loupi kidangtah chu aboldoh peh tauve” atiuve.   
\p
\v 3 Adih'e, Yahweh Pakai in thil loupi kidangtah chu eiboldoh pehtauve! Iti kipa um a hitam!   
\p
\v 4 Neldi gam a twilonglut hon athah semkit bangin O Yahweh Pakai kanei kagouhou hin kiledoh sah kittan.   
\p
\v 5 Mitlhi long pum pum a muchi tuten, kipah thanom tah'a aga akilodiu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Kapjing pum a atuding muchi kipoh'a vaikonten, aga hinkipoh puma inmun kipahle thanomtah'in hung kileuhen.   
\c 127  
\s1 Haona Kiti Hi Yahweh Pakaiya Hung Kon Ahi  
\s1 Solomon ki pahtah a ala sem  
\p
\v 1 Insa-a hi Yahweh Pakai apan louleh, asahon mohseh'a asah'u ahi. Khopi ngah'a hi Yahweh Pakai ajao louleh, khongah ho pannabei a hahkhovah ahiuve.   
\p
\v 2 Jingkah matah'a nakipat uva jankhang gei a nehding an holna a na natoh'u pan nabei ahi, ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in angailut achate hi a-ihmut sunguva hi ijakai agontohpeh ahibouve.   
\p
\v 3 Veuvin, chatehi Yahweh Pakaija kon a gou ahin, naobu sunga kona aga kimu jonghi kipa thilpeh ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Khang don laija cha kineiho hi galsatpan akhutna thal changho akichoi tobang ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Thal chang abom dimsetna kipohpa anun nom ahi. Amachu agalmite toh thutan na munna akimuto teng gal lel hilouhel ding ahi.   
\c 128  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Gingte Chunga Phattheina Ho  
\p
\v 1 Koi hileh Yahweh Pakai ging geh'a um a Ama lunglhaina lampia kalsongho chu anunnom ahiuve.   
\p
\v 2 Nangin nakhutsoh natohga naneh ding ahin, iti nakipading hitam na hinkho kiledoh ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 3 Nainsunga najinu jong lengpigui ga phatah banga phatthei punna hiding, ankong phunga an naneh khompi nachate melhoitah tah Olive thingbah lhoutah bangdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Veuvin, Yahweh Pakai gingte phatthei achandingu chu hitobang hi hiding ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai in Zion a kon in phatthei nabohjing jinghen, nahinkho lhumkei in Jerusalem machalna mujing jingin.   
\p
\v 6 Natuson gei in jong hin munlang, Israel chungah chamleng hen!   
\c 129  
\s1 Zion Kidoupite Alekhup Na Dinga Taona  
\p
\v 1 Kakhangdonlai a pat in kagalmiten eihin bolseuvin ahi. Israel pumpin hichehi velsei uhen.   
\p
\v 2 Kakhangdonlai a pat in kagalmiten eihin bolseuvin ahi, ahinla amahon khatveicha eijoukha pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Katungtun hi maha adiptauvin, loukhoipan lou akhoi chehlah lahtoh abahsah jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinla Yahweh Pakai chu aphatjeh'in miphalouhon khaova eikan nao eisutlhap peh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Koi hileh Jerusalem hot leh deimoa bolho jouse chu jumthet in ki nunglekit'u henlang lhuhpiu hen.   
\p
\v 6 Amahohi pannabei inchung vum a hampa kehtobang, akhan kilhit masanga goplha tobang hiuhen.   
\p
\v 7 Chang-at hon anotthap'u, chuleh chang kanhon adeimou hihen, chuleh hichelang hopa jousen, “Nachunguva Yahweh Pakai phattheiboh umhen keihon Yahweh Pakai mi in phatthei kahinboh uve” tin seihihbeh'u hen.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in phatthei na boh hen, Yahweh Pakai min in nang ma phatthei ka boh uve, chule nang man na lam jot na chun hichi mi ho chun phatthei na chu sutang jou pou vin te.   
\c 130  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Ngaidamna  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai lunglhahna kotong sunga kon in nangma panpina kahinthum e.   
\p
\v 2 O Yahweh Pakai kakanahi ngai in, kataona hi neingaipeh'in.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai kachonset nauhi hoitah'a namelchih ding hileh, koiham O Yahweh Pakai ahingdoh ding?   
\p
\v 4 Ahinla Nangin nangma ginje kahetthem theina diuvin ngaidamna neipejiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Keiman Yahweh ka Pakai nangma panpina kinem tah'in kangah'e. Henge, keima nangma a ki ngaijing kahi. Keiman athusei katahsan'in hichea kinem a ngahjing kahi.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman Yahweh Pakai chu ka ngahlel ngei e, kho ngahpan khovah ding angalel sangin kangahlel joi.   
\p
\v 7 Vo Israel, Yahweh Pakaija kinem in, ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai ahin longlou ngailutna umma ahin chuleh ama a hin lhatdamna lhingset in aum in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Amatah'in Israel chu achonsetna jouse a konna ahuhdoh ding ahi.   
\c 131  
\s1 David Kineosah Pum'a Yahweh Pakaiya Kingai Jing  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai, kalungthim akiletsah poi; kamit ha dan jong kihi sahna aumpoi. Keima hi thil thupitah in jong kakigel pon keimat phah din jong aloupi behseh e.   
\p
\v 2 Hiche sang chun keima kahina kalung lhaipen lung ol heuvin kaum in ahi. Naosen anu noitwi ngaicha talou bang in lung ollin kaum in, naosen lungmonga aum bangin keijong kalhagao lungmong in aum e.   
\p
\v 3 O Israel tule tonsotnin Yahweh Pakaijah lungmong'in ummin.   
\c 132  
\s1 Muntheng Phung Phatthei Channa Dia Taona  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai David hi athohgim na jouse pum in hin geldoh'in.   
\p
\v 2 Aman Yahweh Pakai ah kitepna gimneitah'in anase in ahi. Aman Israel Pathen Elohim ah kitepna ananei in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 “Keima kain ah cheponge, keima kicholdo ponge,   
\p
\v 4 keiman kamit kicholdo sah ponge ahilou leh kamit imutsah ponge,   
\p
\v 5 Keiman ka Yahweh Pakai dinga inkhat sahna ding mun kamu kahsen, Israel Pathen Elohim a dingin muntheng kamu kahsen!”   
\p
\v 6 Vetan hiche thing kong dinghi Ephrathah a aume ti kajaovin Jaar loujao dunga hiche mun hi kana mudoh tauve.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai chenna mun a cheu hitin akengphang bul ah chibai boh'u hite.   
\p
\v 8 O Yahweh Pakai thouvin nacholdona mun a chun luttan nathahat melchihna thingkong chutoh lutthatan.   
\p
\v 9 Nathempuhon chonphatna ponsil chu kisil uhen; nalhacha dihtah hon kipa la sauhen.   
\p
\v 10 Nalhacha David khohsahna jal in, nathao nusa lengpa chu paidoh hih'in.   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai chu David kom ah akihahsel in, kitepna nunglah doh kit louhel dingin: “Keiman nachilhah khat nalaltouna a katousah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Nachilhah ten nangtoh kakitepna leh ka Dan sem holeh kathuhil hohi anit uva ahileh nalal touna hi chejom peh ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in Jerusalem hi a inn chenna mun dinga adeilhen ahi.   
\p
\v 14 “Hichehi tonsot a kacholngah na munding ahi” anati. Keima hiche mun a hi kachending ahi, ajeh chu hiche hi kadeilhen inn chu ahi,   
\p
\v 15 Keiman hiche khopi hi phatthei kaboh ding chuleh ijakai kasuhmang pehding ahi, keiman asunga um vaichate an kapehding,   
\p
\v 16 athemputeu chonphatna pon kasilpeh ding, asoh dihtah hon kipa la asahdiu ahi,   
\p
\v 17 Hiche mun a hi David thaneina khantousah ding, hiche kathaonupa hi kamite dinga thaomeivah hiding,   
\p
\v 18 chuleh agalmite chu jumna le jachatna pon kasilpeh ding amavang leng loupitah kasosah ding ahi.   
\c 133  
\s1 Sopi Banga Kipum Khat Phattheina  
\p
\v 1 Veuvin, insungkhat hi kilungkhat tah'a achenkhom teng iti phat'a pha lunglhai um a hitam?   
\p
\v 2 Hichehi Aaron chunga thao mantam kisungah aluchanga kon a akhamul lah'a longlha a avon mong chan a longlha suhpeh tobang ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Kitohdel a Hermon mol chunga kon a longlha daitwi theng tobang a Zion mol a hung longlha chu ahi. Hichea kon a chu Yahweh Pakai in malsomna chu ahin phondoh'a hichu tonsot hinkhoa ding ahitai.   
\c 134  
\s1 Jan'a Khongah Ho Tilkhouna  
\p
\v 1 Oh Yahweh Pakai sohte jousen Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah un, nangho Yahweh Pakai inn a jankhovah'a asohkin na tongten.   
\p
\v 2 Nakhut theng'u chu taona in domsang uvin lang Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un.   
\p
\v 3 Van le leiset sempa Elohim Pathen chun, Jerusalem a kon in phatthei naboh tao hen.   
\c 135  
\s1 Vahchoina La  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah un! Yahweh Pakai min chu thangvah un! Yahweh Pakai lhacha ten Ama chu thang vah un,   
\p
\v 2 Nangho Yahweh Pakai lhacha na tong, Elohim Pathen, houin sung a natong ten.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai chu aphatna jeh'in thangvah'un; amin ngaitah chu vahchoilan domsangun.   
\p
\v 4 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in Jacob chu Ama a dingmong monga alhen ahin, Israel chu atumbeh'a amagou dinga agon ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Keiman Yahweh Pakai aletna leh aloupina chu kahen, iPakai u Yahweh hi pathen dang sanga lenjo le loupijo ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai in van le leiset chunga hin, twikanglen thuh sunga hin Aman along lhaina a adeidei abol ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Aman meiho jonghi leiset chunga kon a alentousah ahin, Aman gojuh pet in koljong aphetsah'in, huijong hi athilkholna a kon in ahin lhadohjin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Aman Egypt te insunga chun ainson in mihemle ganhing jong apeng masa jouse ana sugam in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Aman Egypt a chun Pharoah le amipi jouse douna in datmo umtah thil kidangho ana tongdoh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Aman namlentah tah ho anavolhun leng thupi tahtah hojong ana satchap e.   
\p
\v 11 Amor lengpa Sihon, Bashan lengpa Og chuleh Caanan lengho jouse anathat gam in ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Aman agam u chu Ama goulo Israelte gamtum dingin anapen ahi.   
\p
\v 13 O Yahweh Pakai namin hi tonsot a umjing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Ajeh chu Yahweh Pakai in amite chunga thutah'a vaihom ding asohte chunga khotona aneiding ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Chitin namtinte doilim hohi sana le dangka maimai mihem in asemthubou ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Amahon kam anei un ima aseithei pouvin, mit anei un ima amuthei pouvin,   
\p
\v 17 kol anei un ima ajathei pouvin nahkui anei un ima anahthei pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Doilim semthu ho jouse le hiche tahsanho jouse chu hitobang ngen ahiuve.   
\p
\v 19 Vo Israel Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un! O thempu Aaron chilhahho, Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un,   
\p
\v 20 O Levite Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un! Nangho Yahweh Pakai ginna neijouse Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 21 Zion'a kon in Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un ajeh chu Ama Jerusalema hin achengin ahi. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un!   
\c 136  
\s1 Elohim Pathen Lungsetna Longlou Jeh'a Vahchoina  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu aphat na ho jouse jeh in thangvah'un! Ajeh chu ami ngailut na dihtah hi tonsot gei a longlou ahi   
\p
\v 2 Semthu pathen ho, Elohim Pathen chu thangvahna peuvin. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot gei a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Pakai ho Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah na peuvin. Ajeh chu Ami ngailut na dihtah chu tonsot geija longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Ama bou hin thil loupi ki dangtah chu abolji ahi. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot gei a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Thepna giltah'a vanho hinsemdoh'a Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah na peuvin. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot geija longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Twilah'a leiset umsah pa chu thangvahna peuvin. Ami ngailut na dihtah chu tonsot gei a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Van a kon a vah semdohpa chu thangvah'un. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsotna longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Nisan sun a vai ahom in ahi, Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Chuleh lha leh ahsi hon jan ah vai ahom un ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Egypt gam a apeng masapen ho anathagam jeh'in Amachu thangvahna peuvin. Ama mi ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot na longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Aman Egypt ma kon in Israel ana puidoh'e, Ami ngailutna chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Aman akhut thahatna leh aban thaneina pum in na atongin ahi. Amingailutna dihtah chu tonsotna longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Twikhanglen san sukhen a chu Ama ahi, thangvah na peuvin. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsotna longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Aman Israel chu anapui galkai e, Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsotna longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Aman Pharaoh leh asepaite twikhanglen sanlah'a analehlut in ahi. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Gamthip noi a amite apuigalkai jeh'in thangvah na peuvin, Am ingailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Leng thupitah tahho anajeplhuh jeh'in thangvahna peuvin, Amingailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Aman leng thahat tah tah ho anathat gam in ahi. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Sihon Amor lengpa; Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Og Bashaan lengpa, Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Elohim Pathen in hiche lengho gamchu agoulo din amite anapen ahi. Ami ngailut na chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Asohte Israelten gam tumbeh'a alodiuva anapeh ahi. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Aman ihatmo nauvah eihin geldohjiu vin ahi. Amibngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Aman igalmihou va kon in eihuhdoh jiuvin ahi. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Aman hinkho neiho jouse dingin aneh achahdiu apejingin ahi. Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Van Elohim Pathen chu thangvahna peuvin, Ami ngailutna dihtah chu tonsot a longlou ahi.   
\c 137  
\s1 Babylon Gam'a Sohchang Ho Lung Hemna  
\p
\v 1 Jerusalem kageldoh phatnun Babylon vadungpang a chun katou un kakapgam tauve.   
\p
\v 2 Keihon kasemjang houchu mong thingbah chung dunga chun kakhai un ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hikom a chun soh a eihente houchun la sah sahding eigouvin, chuleh eisugenthei houchun kipahtah'a la sahsahtei ding eigouvin, “Jerusalem la ho chu khatpen beh neisahpeh'un” atiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinlah keihon hetkhahlou mi gam sunga hi Yahweh Pakai la hochu iti kasahdiuham?   
\p
\v 5 Vo Jerusalem nangma kasuhmil uleh kakhut jetlam hin semjang pehdan sumil jenghen.   
\p
\v 6 Nangma kageldoh louva, Jerusalem chu kakipana sangpen sang a thupi a kagel lou le, ka leihi kadang chungah behden jenghen.   
\p
\v 7 O Yahweh Pakai Babylon sepaiten Jerusalem alonkhum niuva Edom mite thilbol chu geldoh tei in, “Sumang jengin,” “Toltoh sumat jengun” tin asam un ahi.   
\p
\v 8 O Babylon, nangma nakisu mang ding ahi. Nangin neibol nao bang banga nalethuh penpen chu anunnom ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Nachapangteu puimang a songpi chunga sepgoiho chu nunnom hen!   
\c 138  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Lunglhai Jeh'a David In Avahchoi  
\s1 David lasem  
\p
\v 1 Ka Pathen Elohim kalungthim pumpin nangma thangvah ingkate, pathen dangho masanga nang vahchoinan la sange.   
\p
\v 2 Nahou inn theng lang nga'ing ting nami ngailutna tanglou jehleh nakitahna jeh'in namin vahchoi ing kate, ajeh chu nakitepna hi namin loupinan asuhdet ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Kataopet petleh nangin neidonbut in nangin thahatna neipen neitilkhou vin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Leiset chunga leng jousen nangma nathangvah diu ahi, ajeh chu amahon nathupeh ajauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Amahon nathilbolho jehleh naloupi behseh jeh'a nangma thangvah la asahdiu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Vo Yahweh Pakai nangma nalet lheh jeng vangin milham jong nakhohsah thouvin, ahinlah mikiletsah hoa kon in vang nakikhin gamlhan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Keima lungkhamnan eiumkimvel jeng jongleh nangin kagalmite khutna konna neihoidoh ding ahinai. Nangin nakhut hinlhangdoh'in natin nabanjetlang thahatna a neihuhdoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in keima hinkhoa athilgon achelhahsah ding ahi, ajeh chu O Yahweh Pakai na mi ngailutna dihtah chu atonsotna longlou ahi. Kachunga na natoh nahinpat hi subulhit tan.   
\c 139  
\s1 Muntin'a Um Le Ima Jouse Musoh Elohim Pathen  
\s1 La lamkaipa henga David lasem  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai nangin kalungthim nakholchil in neihechen sohkeitan ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nangin katouthimpet hihen, kadindoh pet hijongle nahei. Gamlhatah a kaum jeng vangin nangin kalung gel ngaito jouse nahei.   
\p
\v 3 Kakholjinpet hihen, inna katouthimpet hijongleh nangin neimun ahi, chuleh kabol jouse nahesoh kei e.   
\p
\v 4 Yahweh Pakai kathusei got jonghi kasei masangin nahejitai.   
\p
\v 5 Kamasanga nachen, kanunga jong neijuijin ahi, naphatthei bohna khutchu kaluchungah nangam'in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hitobang hetna hi keidingin aki dang val in, chuleh hitobang hetchet dinghi keidingin ahahsaval e.   
\p
\v 7 Nalhagaova kon a iti kajam mang thei dingham? Nanga kon a keima iti kajam mang theiding ham?   
\p
\v 8 Keima van a kaltou jongleng nangma naum in, mithigam ah lutjong leng nangma naum e.   
\p
\v 9 Keima jingkah lhaving in lengdoh ingting twikhanglen gallang peh'a gacheng jong leng,   
\p
\v 10 hichemun jenga jong chun nakhut in neikai hoi in natin, nathahat na in nei vengbit in nate.   
\p
\v 11 Keiman muthim jah'a neisel in tijongleng chuleh kavel a vahjeng jong muthim sosah jongleng,   
\p
\v 12 muthimlah'a kisel jing jongleng nanga kon a kakisel mangthei louding ahi. Ajeh chu nang dingin ajing jongchu sun banga vahding ahi. Muthimleh vah jong nangdingin thakhat ahibouve.   
\p
\v 13 Nangin ka oisung a thil umjuse jong najopmat mat a kanu naobu sunga neigontoh ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hitobanga thil kidangtah'a neina gontoh jeh'in kathangvah'e! Na natoh nathil bol danhi datmo umtah ahi ti kalung thim apumpin kahe them e.   
\p
\v 15 Keima jatchombeh'a kanu naobu muthimlah'a eina kigontoh jeng jongchun nangman neinavesui jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Kapen lhah masang a nang man nei namusa ahitai, nitin ka hinkhoa ka ki manchah na ding dan, phatche dungjui a ana kigongtoh chu nikhatcha jengjong achelhah masanga nalekhabua ana kigoltohsa ahitai.   
\p
\v 17 O Yahweh Pakai kachung changa nalung gel nathilgon tohsaho chu iti mantama hitam simjou jai ahipoi!   
\p
\v 18 Asim jengjong keijo chi ahipoi, neldi halsiho sang in jong atamjoi. Kahung khahdoh gei injong nangin neina umpi jing nalai e!   
\p
\v 19 O ka Pathen Elohim miphalouho hi nasuhmang hitavele ong! Tolthat ho kahinkhoa kon in potdoh'un.   
\p
\v 20 Amahohin na suminseu ve, nagalmi hohin namin hi asamseu ve.   
\p
\v 21 O Yahweh Pakai nangma nahotbolte hohi keiman jong kahot louding ham? Nangma nadouho hi kenjong kathet louding ham?   
\p
\v 22 Ahinai, nangman nathetho hi keiman pumthetna kathet ding ahi, ajeh chu nangma galmi ho chu keima galmi ho ahiuve.   
\p
\v 23 O Yahweh Pakai neikhol chil in kalung neihet peh in; neipatep inlang kahina hi kilang doh sah in.   
\p
\v 24 Kasunga hi nangma douva thilse umnalai am nei nodoh peh inlang tonsot lampi a neipui tan.   
\c 140  
\s1 Mi Gimsah Hoa Kon Kivenbitna Dinga Taona  
\s1 La lamkaipa henga: David lasem  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, miphalou hoa kon'in neihuhdoh in, pumhat-a natong hoa kon'in neihoidohsah'in,   
\p
\v 2 ajeh chu alung sung'uva thilse jeng agong un, beitih um louvin gal abol jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Alei gui-u gul in mi achuh bang in amang chauvin, athuseidoh jouseu jong gul-gu tobang ahi.   
\p
\v 4 O Yahweh Pakai, miphalou ho khutna kon hin neihoidoh in, pumhatna natong hoa kon'in neihuhdoh in; ajeh chu kakipal lhuhna din thisle jeng agong un ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Mi kiletsah hon kei matna din thang akam un, khao ajan-doh'un lampi dunga thang ei-kampeh'un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Keiman Yahweh Pakai kom'a, “Nangma hi ka Pathen Elohim nahi!” O Yahweh Pakai, khotona dinga kataona nei sanpeh tan.   
\p
\v 7 O Yahweh Pakai hatchungnung, athahat pan-a eihuhdoh pa; nangman gal kisat nikhoa nei huhdoh ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai, migilouho adei bang'in chesah hih'in, athilse gonhou chu lolhin sahhih'in; achuti louva ahileh kiletsahna dim diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Kagal miten kachunga thil phalou tohgon anei jal un, manthah nan lhung u-hen.   
\p
\v 10 Meiam kong chu alu chunguvah chuhsah'in, meilah'a seplut in; ahilouleh ajamdoh louna diu twiveina kotong'ah lhalut jeng u-hen.   
\p
\v 11 Ka gamsung uva hin ajou jouva mihehse ho khantousah hihbeh'in, pumhat'a natong ho achunguva thilse chuhsah'in lang sumang in.   
\p
\v 12 Hinlah suhgentheija umte Yahweh Pakai in asumil poi, ti kahen; Aman vaichate thu adih'a atanpeh ding ahi, ti kahei.   
\p
\v 13 Tahbeh'in mi kitah hon namin athangvah diu, chule michonpha ho na kom'a cheng diu ahi.   
\c 141  
\s1 Aphalou'a Kon Kivenbitna Dinga Taona  
\s1 David lasem  
\p
\v 1 O Yahweh Pakai, nangma kakouve, Panpi ngehna katao hi nei ngaipeh loijin!   
\p
\v 2 Kataona hi nahenga gimnamtwi kilhut bang'in chule kakhut teni kadopsang hi nilhah lang kilhaina gantha bang'in neisanpeh tan.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai, kakam'a hin kamdal neikoipeh'in. Kakam sung nei vetpeh jing in.   
\p
\v 4 Thilse bolna din kalungthim aselam-a kon'in neihoidah sah in, thil dihlou bolna'a neipansah hih'in. Thildihlou bol hon aphat chompiu thangset umtah thil hoa chan nei neisah hih'in.   
\p
\v 5 Miphan eiphoh hen hichu ngailutna joh ahi! Amahon eisuhdihna chu damna ahipoi, Miphalou hon thilse abol dounan katao jinge.   
\p
\v 6 Alamkaiteu kol'a akisot lhah tengleh, miphalou hon kathusei angaidiu chuteng dih ahinsah diu ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Songpi akikhet keh teng tol'a akitakeh bang in, miphalou ho gule chang ho jong vui louva kithe jal ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 O Yahweh Pakai hatchungnung, panpi ngaijin na henga kataove. Nangma kakiselna kulpi nahi; amaho khut-a thina neitosah hih in.   
\p
\v 9 Kei ona dinga thang akam-uva kon in neihuhdoh in, thilpha lou jenga chon ho thangkol'a nei o-sah hih in.   
\p
\v 10 Miphalou ho chu amaho thang kam-a chun oh uhen, kijam chap tauhen; keivang nei hoidoh sah'in.   
\c 142  
\s1 Gim Hesoh Pet-A Kithopina Ngaicha Taona  
\s1 Songkoa achen laija, David lasem, le Taona  
\p
\v 1 Keima Yahweh Pakai henga kataovin, Yahweh Pakai henga khotona kathum in ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Keima Yahweh Pakai ang-sunga kakiphin in, kahahsatna jouse jong kaphongdoh'in.   
\p
\v 3 Kalhagao alam vai jitan, hinlah Yahweh Pakai nangbou nahi kachena ding lampi ei-hil ji. Kajotna lam'a chun ei-douten thang eikam peh jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Keiman mikhat tou hunga eipanpi ding kangaichat lai jin, koiman amitsih jenga jong eive poi! Koimacha eikithopi ding aumpoi, kachunga thilsoh koiman imachan eigelpeh poi.   
\p
\v 5 O Yahweh Pakai, keima na henga kataovin, “Nangma hi kakiselna nahi, kahinkhoa kangaichat pen nang bou nahi,” kati.   
\p
\v 6 Kataona hi nei ngaipeh teijin, ei-kisunem behseh jeng tai! Ei-bolgenthei hoa kon'in neihuhdoh tan, ajeh chu amaho keisang in ahatval jeng tauve.   
\p
\v 7 Songkul'a kon'in neihuhdoh loijin, chutileh nangma kathangvah thei ding ahi. Lolhing tah'a neibol jeh'a kajet le kaveija mikitah dim lha diu ahi.   
\c 143  
\s1 Huhdohna Ding Le Lampi Ki Gottup Na Dia Taona  
\s1 David lasem  
\p
\v 1 Vo Yahweh Pakai, kataona ngaijin. Kangeh hi nei ngaipeh teijin! Nangma kitahna le dihna bang in, neidonbut in.   
\p
\v 2 Nalhacha hi nei patep hih in chule kachung thu jong tan hihbeh in, ajeh chu koima na ang-sunga adih aumpoi.   
\p
\v 3 Ajeh chu kagal miten eihin del peh in, kahing chang in tolgoi nan ineijin, lhan khuh-a athisa umho bangin, kada kacham louvin muthim lah'a eiumsah tai.   
\p
\v 4 Hijeh chun keiman kinepna ding kanei tapon, kalung sung kichatnan adim e.   
\p
\v 5 Keiman khanglui nikho chesa ho kageldoh'in, nakhut tenia natohdohsa thil thupi ho kagel jing in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Kakhut tenin nahenglam kasang'in kataovin, Gamgo-in sadoh leuva twi angaichat bang in; keiman nangma kangaichan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 O Yahweh Pakai, nei donbut loijin, ajeh chu kahin kho bei pai ding ahitai. Keija kon'in kihei mang hih in, ijeh-inem itileh lhan khuh-a lhalut ho kabah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Jingkah sehleh nalungsetna longlou neijahsah in, ajeh chu keima kingaina nangbou nahi. Kalam lhahna jouse neihil them in, kahin kho hi nangma dia kaphal theng ahi.   
\p
\v 9 O Yahweh Pakai, kagal mitea kon'in neihuhdoh in, nahenga kisel dinga hung jamlut kahi bouve.   
\p
\v 10 Ka Pathen Elohim nahi, nadeilam bolje neihil in, name khotona lhagao chun dettah'a pan kalah jingna din neipui jing in.   
\p
\v 11 O Yahweh Pakai, namin loupina ding in kahinkho hinghoi teijin. Ajeh chu nakitahna jal'in kahahsatna'a kon in nei puidoh tan.   
\p
\v 12 Nami ngailutna longlou chun, kagal mite manthahsan in! Chule nalhacha kahi, eidou ho jouse sumang hel in.   
\c 144  
\s1 Sochatna Le Haona Dinga Taona  
\s1 David lasem  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un Amachu kasongpi ahi. Aman kakhut teni hi galsatje dan eihil in, chule kakhut jung hohi galsatna'a manchahje dan eihil ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Amahi eipanpi phapen leh kakulpi ahin, kahoidohna pal leh eihuhdohpa ahi. Chitin namtin anoijah akunsahji ahi.   
\p
\v 3 O Yahweh Pakai, mihem hi ipi hija hibanga nagel-lut'a, mihem chapa jeng jong ipi hija hibanga nakhohsah hitam?   
\p
\v 4 Ajeh chu mihem hi hai khatseh'a hing ahibouvin, ahin-nikho jong nisa-lep tobanga mangpai thei ahibouve.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai vanho hinhong in hung kum lhan, molsang hohi tham'in lang meikhun len mangsah in.   
\p
\v 6 Kehchang len-dohsah inlang galmite thejalsah in! Nathalchang kap inlang jamsah soh hel in.   
\p
\v 7 Vanna kon'in nakhut hin lhang in, twithuh lah'a konleh kagalmite thaneina'a kon in nei huhdoh in.   
\p
\v 8 Akam'un jou jeng aseijun, thudih kaseije atiuvin akihahsel un, hinlah jou jeng aseijun ahi.   
\p
\v 9 O ka Pathen Elohim, na henga lathah khat sange; selangdah jangsom kibut chu mangchan na vahchoila sange.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu nangman lengho galjona napen! Nalhacha David jong athi nading chemjam'a kon in nahuhdoh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Neihuhdoh'in! Kagalmite thaneina'a kon'in neihuhdoh'in, akam un jou jeng aseijun; thutah kaseiding ahi tin akihahsel-un, hinlah jou jengseh aseijun ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Kachapateu akhandon laijun thingphung phatah bang in khanlhit sah in, ka chanuteu jong leng inpi jemhoi dinga kisem khompi hoitah ho bang u-hen.   
\p
\v 13 Ka chang pang jouseu jong lousoh jouse pum'in dimsoh hen, kalou jaova kagan chateu asang sang in, sangsom som chan geijin pung hen.   
\p
\v 14 Kagancha teu gai pha hen, veiset le apengsol um hih hel hen! Ka khopi sung jenguva jong lung gim khoisat beihel hen.   
\p
\v 15 Hitobang thilpha achunga lhung ho kipah uhen! chule a Pathen'u Elohim, Yahweh Pakai hikha nam mite chu kipah cheh'u hen!   
\c 145  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Phatna Le Thahatna Jal-a Vahchoina  
\s1 David in vahchoila asem  
\p
\v 1 Ka Pathen leh kalengpa Elohim nangma choi at inge, chule itih chan hijong leh nangma thangvah jing ing kate.   
\p
\v 2 Niseh'a nangma ka thangvah jing ding, itihchan hijongleh nangma kavahchoi ding ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Yahweh Pakai hi athupin, Amabou thangvah dinga lom ahi; koiman athupina tejou ponte.   
\p
\v 4 Akhang khanga mihem ten Yahweh Pakai natoh apachat jing diu, thil kidangtah tah nabol ho aphonjal diu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Yahweh Pakai nalal loupina kidang leh nathilbol datmo umtah ho giltah'a kagel jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Nathilbol gimnei hohi mijouse kam'a kijadoh ding, keiman nathupi na ho kaphondoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Kidangtah'a naphatna thusim hi mijousen aseiphong diu, keiman jong nadihna thu hi kipahtah'a vahchoila kasah ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai hi milungset them leh hepina'a dim, lunghang vahlou; lungsetna long lou ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai hi mijouse din aphai, Aman athilsem saho jouse chungah khotona lhingset apen ahi.   
\p
\v 10 O Yahweh Pakai, nasemsa jousen na henga kipathu asei diu, chule nanungjui dihtah jousen nathangvah diu ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Amahon nalenggam loupina asap phong diu, nathahatna atah-lang diu ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Amahon natohdoh thil loupi ho mihem chate aseipeh diu, navaihomna lenggam loupi leh anatsat dan aphondoh peh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ajeh chu nalenggam hi tonsot lenggam ahin, nangin akhang khanga vai nahop ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Yahweh Pakai in alhuho athoudoh'in apohgih'in adelpha ho aphong dingin ahi. Aseidoh chan a kitah Yahweh Pakai ahin, atohna jousea lungset them ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Mit jousen kinem tah'in nangma lam ahin ven, nangman amaho ngaichat dung juijin aneh diu napejin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Nangman nakhut namang chan, hinkho neijouse hi agilkel adangchah nau nasuh bulhinpeh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Yahweh Pakai hi atohna jousea kitahnan ajuijin, atohna chan'a ngailutna dim ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Yahweh Pakai henga taote Aman anailut jing in, tahbeh'a taote aumpi jing in ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Aman gimna le jana neipumma ngaichatna neiho alolhinsah in, panpi ngaicha'a akanao angaipeh'in ahuhdoh jin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Yahweh Pakai in Ama ngailuho ahuhdoh jin, hinlah miphalou ho vang asumang jin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Keiman Yahweh Pakai chu kathangvah jing ding, vannoi leisetna cheng jousen tonsot tonsot in Amin thangvah jing tauhen.   
\c 146  
\s1 Thil Adih Jenga Abol Jeh'a Vahchoina  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai vahchoijun! O kalhagao Yahweh Pakai vahchoi jin!   
\p
\v 2 Kahin laisea Yahweh Pakai kavahchoi ding, hinna hu kanei laisen ka Pathen Elohim vahchoi la sange.   
\p
\v 3 Leng chapate chunga natahsan koi hih'in, hichu panpi bei ahibouve.   
\p
\v 4 Mihem chate hu abei teng leisetna akilekit-un leivui akisoh jin, hiche nikho lechun athilgon chengseu toh thi thading ahitauve.   
\p
\v 5 Hinlah apanpi dinga Israel Pathen Elohim neiho, chule Yahweh Pakai, Elohim Pathen a kinepna neiho anunnom ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Aman van le leiset twikhanglen leh asunga um jouse anasem in, Aman imatih chan'a akitepna achepi jing ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Aman suhgentheija umho thudih'in achungthu atanpeh in, chule agilkel te an apen ahi. Yahweh Pakai in songkul tangho alhadoh'in, achamlhat sah jin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Yahweh Pakai in mitchoho kho amusah'in, alhu ho aphong ding in, michonpha Yahweh Pakai in angailun ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Yahweh Pakai in gamdang miho ahuhdoh in, Aman meithaiho leh chaga ho akhoton, amavang miphalou ho thilgon asuhbei peh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Yahweh Pakai in tonsotna vai ahomding ahi. O Jerusalem, Amahi akhang akhanga na Pathen hiding ahi. Yahweh Pakai vahchoijun!   
\c 147  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Tahsan In Chule Ama Jeng Hou-In  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai vahchoijin umhen! iPathen'u Elohim vahchoi lasah ding hi iti phat-a pha hitam! Ijeh-inem itileh Ama lungset nan adimn in, vahchoi dia lomtah ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Yahweh Pakai in Jerusalem aki ledohsah in, amangtasa Israelte ahin lepui kit in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Aman lungthimna jong aboldam in, amaha jeng-u jong adamsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Aman ahsi ho asim toh in, amin cheh'in akouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 I-Yahweh Pakaiju hi iti loupi hitam! Athaneina hi akhonna gei ahi! Athil hetthem theina jong mihem hetphah hoi ahipoi.   
\p
\v 6 Yahweh Pakai in mikineosah ho adomsang'in, ahin miphalouho vang toltoh alhobeh'in ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Yahweh Pakai thangvahna la sauvin, semjangto thon Elohim Pathen vahchoila sauvin.   
\p
\v 8 Aman vanho meilom'in akhun, leiset'a go ajuh lhahsah in, chule molchunga hampa louhing akedohsah'in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Aman gamsa ho neh ding apen chule va-ah nou ho apenteng aneh diu apejin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Aman sakol thahatna leh mihem thahatna'a akison-jiu akipapi poi.   
\p
\v 11 Yahweh Pakai chu Ama ging jing hole ami ngailutna longlou chunga kinepna neiho akipa pin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Vo Jerusalem, Yahweh Pakai loupina vahchoijun! O Zion, na Pathen Elohim vahchoijun.   
\p
\v 13 Ajeh chu Aman nakelkot jol ho alhousah in, chule nakul sunga nachate phatthei aboh in ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Aman nagamgi tin-uva chamna alensah in, chule nagilkel nauvah an twitah'in navah uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Vannoi leiset chunga thu-apeh teng jongleh aman gang in ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Aman buhbang jeng jong samul abahsah jin, chule dai-kai jong vutvam kithejal abahsah jin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Gel-chang jong song kisunglha abahsah jin, adapsah teng jong ama-anga ding jou ding koiham?   
\p
\v 18 Chujouteng Aman thu apen ahileh ajunlha gamji tan, Aman hui chu asol'in ahileh buhbangho chu twijin alongji tai.   
\p
\v 19 Aman Jacob henga thu aseipeh in, Israel kom'a a Dan thupeh hole athuhil hochu ahilchen in ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hitobang hi namdang ho jah'a aseipeh pon, amahon athuhil jong ahepouvin ahi. Yahweh Pakai vahchoijin umhen!   
\c 148  
\s1 Thilsem Jousen Yahweh Pakai Vahchoi Hen  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un! Vanhoa kon'in Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un! Vanthamjol-a kon'in Amachu thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 2 Avantilte jousen thangvah'un! Van sepaite jousen thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 3 Nisa le lha-in amachu thangvah'un! Aphelhet lhet ahsi hon Amachu thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 4 Achungsang lam'a um vantham jol'in thangvah'un! Meilom chung sangpeh'a um meitwi hon Amachu thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 5 Thilsemho jousen Yahweh Pakai chu thangvahna peuvin, ajeh chu Aman thu apen ahileh amaho chu ahung kisemdoh jengun ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Aman tonsot geija dinga anagontohsoh ahitai. Ama Dan semchu itih hijongleh ki khokhel louding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Leisetna konnin thangvah'un, twikhanglen lailunga thilsemhon thangvah'un,   
\p
\v 8 meileh gel hon, buhbang leh meilom hon thangvah'un, huileh adap asatnin Ama thu chu ngaijun.   
\p
\v 9 Mol leh lhangho, aga nei thingphung ho le Cedar thinghon,   
\p
\v 10 gamsa ho le ganhingho jousen, ganhing neochacha ho le vachahon,   
\p
\v 11 leiset chunga lengho le mipite jousen, leiset chunga vaihom hole thutanho jousen,   
\p
\v 12 pasal khangthah ho le numei khangthah hon, tehse hole chapanghon,   
\p
\v 13 abonchauvin Yahweh Pakai min thangvah'u hen! Ajeh chu Aminhi aloupi lheh jenge, hiche Amin loupina hi leiset le vanho jouse sanga sangjo ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Aman amite chu ki khat atundohpeh tan ahi, amadinga kitahna neijouse Aman angailut Israel mipite chu jana apetan ahi. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   
\c 149  
\s1 Tahsan Chate Jousen Yahweh Pakai Vahchoijun  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'un! Yahweh Pakai vahchoina lathah sauvin. Tahsan chate kikhopna ah avahchoila sauvin.   
\p
\v 2 O Israel nasempa chunga kipah'in, O Jerusalem mipite, na lengpau chungah kipah'un.   
\p
\v 3 Khongpi gintoh semjang saito thon lampum pum'in Aminchu vahchoijun,   
\p
\v 4 Ajeh chu amite chungah akipah'in, mi nun nem te chu jana lallukhuh akhupeh tai.   
\p
\v 5 Elohim Pathen chate chu hitobang jana achanjeh'un, jankhovah'in avahchoila sauhen,   
\p
\v 6 Akhut'in chemjam hemtah kichoiyu henlang, akamsunguuvah kipah tah'in Elohim Pathen thangvah la sauhen.   
\p
\v 7 Chitin namtin ho chunga aphulah theina diuleh, namtin chunga engbolna apehtheina diuvin,   
\p
\v 8 alengteu thihkhao kola akihen'uva, chuleh alamkaiteu thihkhaova akikan theina diuvin,   
\p
\v 9 achunguva thu kitanna dungjuija akitohdohna dingin. Hichehi Elohim Pathen chate chan loupitah achannao chu ahi. Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   
\c 150  
\s1 Yahweh Pakai Vahchoijun  
\p
\v 1 Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah na peuvin! Elohim Pathen chu Houin'ah thangvah'un, Avan chung thahatna mun nah thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 2 Athilbol thahatna kidangtah jeh'in amachu thangvah'un, aletna seijoulou jeh'in thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 3 Sumkon gin kithong pum'in vahchoijun, theile mut selangdah saito thon thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 4 Khopi ginleh lam pummin vahchoijun, kuli leh tumging theito thon thangvah'un!   
\p
\v 5 Khong gintoh thon thangvah'un, Khong gin kithong gimneitah chuto thon vahchoi jun,   
\p
\v 6 Haina hu neijousen Yahweh Pakai thangvah na la sauvin! Yahweh Pakai chu thangvah'in umhen!   